&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Sony Interactive Entertainment?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Sony Interactive Entertainment isn’t just the Best Place to Play — it’s also the Best Place to Work. Sony Interactive Entertainment (SIE) is the company behind the PlayStation brand. As a subsidiary of Sony Group Corporation, we’re part of a proud legacy of innovation and excellence. SIE is a dynamic technology company, delivering cutting-edge hardware and network services to more than 100 million people and an entertainment leader, home to some of the most beloved and recognizable intellectual properties (IP) in the world. Our role at SIE is to create and nurture the experiences under the PlayStation brand, a name synonymous with entertainment excellence and creativity.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;Role Overview:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;We are seeking a Senior Director to lead our Enterprise Reporting and Analytics Engineering organization, a team of analytics engineers, report developers, visualization specialists, and people leaders. This organization focuses on the last mile of the enterprise data supply chain: the semantic models, curated data products, metric definitions, and consumption experiences that turn engineered data into decisions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;This is not a traditional reporting leadership role; the classic notion of “reporting” in the form of a myriad of dashboards and filters is racing towards obsolescence. But the need for data and insights, and the need to deliver it in a way that is digestible and actionable, is timeless. Yes, governed dashboards and trusted reporting remain the foundation, and this leader must be excellent at that foundation. But the mandate is to move the organization decisively beyond static reporting toward a proactive, intelligent analytics capability: partnering with Data Science to productize and visualize their models, enabling generative AI and LLM-based access to our data, building exception-based systems that alert users when outcomes deviate from expectation in a statistically meaningful way, and designing agents that monitor data continuously and deliver insight without being asked.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Analytics engineering shares much of its DNA with data engineering — modeling, transformation, testing, version control, CI/CD, performance and cost discipline — but is oriented toward business enablement rather than platform and pipeline. Success in this role therefore depends as much on partnership as on technical depth. This leader will work shoulder to shoulder with Data Engineering on the boundary between platform and consumption, with Product Management on roadmap and requirements, with Data Science on advanced analytic products, and with Analytics Operations on a disciplined intake and prioritization process that makes the best possible use of finite capacity.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;The ideal candidate has spent years building the traditional foundations — governance, metadata, lineage, dimensional modeling, engaging with enterprise BI platforms— and is now looking to apply that rigor to a fundamentally different generation of analytic products in new and innovative ways.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll be doing:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Organizational Leadership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Lead, coach, and develop an organization of approximately 30 people, including managing through frontline managers; own hiring, role clarity, career pathing, performance management, and succession planning.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Define a multi-year vision and roadmap for enterprise reporting and analytics engineering, and translate it into quarterly outcomes the team and its partners can measure. Partner closely with Product Management to jointly shape the multi-year enterprise end-to-end data strategy.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Own the organization&#39;s budget, vendor relationships, and contractor or offshore capacity.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Establish and sustain an engineering culture within an analytics function: peer review, automated testing, documentation standards, source control, CI/CD, etc.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analytics Engineering and Data Architecture&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Drive maturity of the last-mile architecture in partnership with Data Engineering: curated marts, semantic layers, reusable data products, and certified datasets that serve reporting, ai enablement, data science, and downstream applications.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Define and enforce dimensional modeling standards, transformation frameworks, and modular, tested, version-controlled analytics code.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Own the enterprise metric layer so that key business measures carry a single, governed definition regardless of where they are consumed.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Partner with Data Engineering to define clear contracts and handoffs between pipeline and platform work and last-mile modeling, including shared tooling, standards, and escalation paths.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Manage query performance, warehouse consumption, and platform cost as first-class engineering concerns.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Governance, Metadata, and Lineage&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Own cataloging, business glossary, data certification, and stewardship workflows, leveraging tools such as Atlan as the primary metadata platform.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Maintain column-level lineage across the analytics estate to support impact analysis, change management, audit, and root-cause investigation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Leverage data access provisioning and entitlement models, including row- and column-level security, in partnership with Security, Privacy, and Compliance.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Collaborate with Data Engineering to drive data quality monitoring, freshness and availability SLAs, observability, and incident response for analytic assets.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Enterprise Reporting and Data Visualization&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Drive analytics engagement by leveraging enterprise visualization and provisioning platforms, including Domo and Tableau, in partnership with Data Engineering. Ensure best practices are followed in data architecture, governance, adoption, performance, and total cost management.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Set visualization and information design standards that make reports readable, consistent, accessible, and decision-oriented.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Rationalize the existing reporting portfolio: retire redundant and unused assets, consolidate overlapping content, drive down tech debt and drive consumption toward certified sources.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Build a durable self-service capability through training, templates, community, office hours, and clear guardrails on what belongs in self-service versus centrally managed content.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Advanced, Proactive, and AI-Enabled Analytics&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Partner with Data Science to productize their work: build the visualization, interaction, monitoring, and feedback loops that turn models and research into products the business actually uses.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Partner with Product Management and Data Engineering to enable generative AI and LLM access to enterprise data. This includes preparing the semantic and metadata foundation that makes data legible to models, delivering conversational analytics, text-to-SQL, and retrieval-augmented experiences on governed sources, and establishing guardrails, evaluation, and accuracy monitoring so that answers can be trusted.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Build exception-based analytics that detect when an outcome deviates from its expected value in a statistically significant way, using seasonality-aware baselines, forecast residuals, control limits, and anomaly detection rather than static thresholds.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Route those exceptions to accountable owners with context, likely drivers, and a recommended next action; actively tune sensitivity and volume to prevent alert fatigue and preserve signal.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Design and deploy analytic agents that proactively monitor data, investigate variances, assemble narrative explanations, and deliver insight into the tools where people already work.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Shift the organization&#39;s consumption model from pull to push: the measure of success is not how many people opened a dashboard, but whether the right person was told the right thing at the right time.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Partnership, Intake, and Prioritization&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Operate as a true partner to Product Management: contribute to roadmap, requirements, user research, and release planning, and run analytics with a product mindset covering personas, adoption metrics, and asset lifecycle management.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Partner with Analytics Operations to run a transparent intake, triage, sizing, and prioritization process, with published capacity, explicit tradeoffs, and reliable delivery commitments.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Make capacity constraints visible to stakeholders and executives, drive reuse over one-off builds, and decline or defer work with evidence rather than friction.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Serve as a senior, executive-facing partner to business functions, translating ambiguous business questions into well-scoped analytic solutions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we&#39;re looking for:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in Computer Science, Information Systems, Engineering, Statistics, Mathematics, Economics, or a related quantitative field; equivalent professional experience will be considered.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;15+ years of progressive experience in data, analytics, or business intelligence, including 8+ years leading teams and 4+ years managing managers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Demonstrated experience leading an organization of 25 or more people in a large, matrixed enterprise.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Strong hands-on foundation in SQL, dimensional modeling, and ELT/ETL design, with production experience on a modern cloud data warehouse or lakehouse (for example Snowflake, Databricks, BigQuery, Redshift, or Synapse) and a transformation framework such as dbt.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Experience applying software engineering practices to analytics work, including Git-based workflows, automated testing, and CI/CD.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Enterprise-scale leveraging of BI and data visualization platforms such as Domo, Tableau, Power BI, or Looker, including governance, provisioning, adoption, and cost management.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Demonstrated ability to participate in driving data governance program covering catalog, lineage, glossary, stewardship, quality, and access, using platforms such as Atlan, Collibra, Alation, or Informatica.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Proven track record of delivering jointly with Data Engineering and Product Management, with clear ownership boundaries and shared accountability.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Direct experience partnering with Data Science, including operationalizing, visualizing, and monitoring model output for business consumption.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Working command of the statistical concepts underlying exception detection, including hypothesis testing, confidence intervals, variance and control limits, seasonality, and forecasting.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Experience running a formal intake, prioritization, and capacity planning process for a shared services or platform organization.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Excellent executive communication and influence skills, with the ability to operate effectively amid ambiguity and competing priorities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Experience managing budget, vendor contracts, and platform licensing.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Skills:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Master&#39;s degree or MBA in a related field.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Production experience delivering LLM-based analytics: retrieval-augmented generation over governed data, text-to-SQL or conversational BI, semantic layers designed for model consumption, and prompt, evaluation, and cost monitoring frameworks.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Experience designing agentic workflows and orchestration for monitoring, investigation, and notification use cases.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Hands-on experience with Atlan, Domo, and Tableau specifically.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Proficiency in Python or R for prototyping, and familiarity with common statistical and ML libraries and MLOps concepts.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Experience deploying anomaly detection at scale, including alert routing, suppression, and fatigue management.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Familiarity with data product and data mesh operating models, domain-aligned ownership, and data contracts.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Experience operating in an Agile or product operating model at scale, including portfolio, OKR, and roadmap management. Deep experience with the “Silicon Valley” school of Product Management, as exemplified by the “Marty Kagan”-style academic approach a significant plus.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Experience leading global or matrixed teams, including offshore or vendor-partnered delivery models.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Track record leading a major platform migration, consolidation, or reporting rationalization effort.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Demonstrated success attracting, developing, and retaining senior technical talent in a competitive market.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Please note, Sony Interactive Entertainment conducts background checks at the offer stage for all new employees (which may include criminal background checks for some roles) and will need to process personal information to support these checks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Please refer to our Candidate Privacy Notice (where applicable) for more information about what personal information we collect, how we use it, who we share it with, and your data protection rights.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal Opportunity Statement:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Sony is an Equal Opportunity Employer. All persons will receive consideration for employment without regard to gender (including gender identity, gender expression and gender reassignment), race (including colour, nationality, ethnic or national origin), religion or belief, marital or civil partnership status, disability, age, sexual orientation, pregnancy, maternity or parental status, trade union membership or membership in any other legally protected category.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We strive to create an inclusive environment, empower employees and embrace diversity. We encourage everyone to respond.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Sony Interactive Entertainment is a Fair Chance employer and qualified applicants with arrest and conviction records will be considered for employment.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Overview&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We have an opportunity for a Principal Engineer in our AI &amp;amp; Algorithms department,&amp;nbsp;working&amp;nbsp;with a particular focus on our defence and security clients.&amp;nbsp;You’ll&amp;nbsp;join a team of talented engineers and scientists designing,&amp;nbsp;building&amp;nbsp;and testing intelligent systems that&amp;nbsp;require&amp;nbsp;cutting edge&amp;nbsp;algorithms.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As&amp;nbsp;one of the senior technical voices in the team,&amp;nbsp;you’ll&amp;nbsp;be&amp;nbsp;architecting the&lt;u&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/u&gt;algorithmic&amp;nbsp;approach on&amp;nbsp;our projects, setting the technical bar for others, and helping shape the work we&amp;nbsp;deliver.&amp;nbsp;As well as&amp;nbsp;hands-on engineering,&amp;nbsp;you’ll&amp;nbsp;spend time with clients, using your&amp;nbsp;expertise&amp;nbsp;to win new projects as well as deliver them.&amp;nbsp;You’ll&amp;nbsp;work&amp;nbsp;in multidisciplinary teams that use&amp;nbsp;our labs and computing resources&amp;nbsp;to enable us to deliver&amp;nbsp;ambitious&amp;nbsp;projects.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Much of our defence and security work requires&amp;nbsp;security clearance, so we ask for it up front. You&amp;nbsp;won’t&amp;nbsp;work exclusively in that sector, but a genuine interest in it matters to us.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&amp;nbsp;offer a flexible approach to hybrid working, although some of the projects you will be working on will require&amp;nbsp;full-time working in the office.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll be doing:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Applying data-driven software development in machine learning/AI, applied statistics, and sensor processing, alongside mathematical computing techniques such as digital signal processing, simulation, and numerical optimisation.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Acting as technical lead and architect on our larger, more complex projects, owning the technical solution and the value it delivers to the client.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Setting technical direction and acting as technical reviewer across the department, with your opinion&amp;nbsp;sought&amp;nbsp;by colleagues.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leading the development of proposals and costed work programmes, turning client problems into work we can win and deliver.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Driving internal capability and demonstrators that keep us at the leading edge and&amp;nbsp;open up&amp;nbsp;new conversations with clients.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentoring engineers and conducting technical interviews to help us recruit and grow strong people.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contributing to how the department works, improving our processes and technical standards.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you need to succeed:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years’&amp;nbsp;experience designing and delivering&amp;nbsp;cutting&lt;u&gt; &lt;/u&gt;edge&amp;nbsp;algorithms&amp;nbsp;for&amp;nbsp;intelligent systems, including&amp;nbsp;working on defence or security projects.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical skills in one or more of:&amp;nbsp;transformer&amp;nbsp;models,&amp;nbsp;diffusion models, reinforcement learning, machine&amp;nbsp;vision&amp;nbsp;and perception.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A&amp;nbsp;strong&amp;nbsp;undergraduate degree&amp;nbsp;in&amp;nbsp;a relevant technical subject, such as AI/machine learning, computer science,&amp;nbsp;mathematics&amp;nbsp;or,&amp;nbsp;physics. A PhD in a relevant subject is welcome but not&amp;nbsp;required; deep, demonstrable industrial&amp;nbsp;expertise&amp;nbsp;is what matters.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong Python and software engineering judgement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to architect the technical approach on complex projects and to review the work of others, including working autonomously as the technical authority.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience mentoring and developing engineers.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience&amp;nbsp;working with non-technical stakeholders for your work.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interest in&amp;nbsp;working directly with&amp;nbsp;clients&amp;nbsp;and contributing to proposals and sales conversations.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A genuine affinity for working in the defence and security sector.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;While not essential requirements, we would also be&amp;nbsp;very interested&amp;nbsp;if you have experience with any of the following:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical experience with any&amp;nbsp;of:&amp;nbsp;signal processing, edge computing, statistical modelling,&amp;nbsp;numerical optimisation, or simulation.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record&amp;nbsp;of building client relationships and leading the technical side of sales campaigns and proposals.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Some projects at Cambridge Consultants are subject to security restrictions. This role requires you to obtain a Security Check (SC) level security clearance &amp;nbsp;( &lt;a id=&quot;menur1fij&quot; class=&quot;fui-Link ___1q1shib f2hkw1w f3rmtva f1ewtqcl fyind8e f1k6fduh f1w7gpdv fk6fouc fjoy568 figsok6 f1s184ao f1mk8lai fnbmjn9 f1o700av f13mvf36 f1cmlufx f9n3di6 f1ids18y f1tx3yz7 f1deo86v f1eh06m1 f1iescvh fhgqx19 f1olyrje f1p93eir f1nev41a f1h8hb77 f1lqvz6u f10aw75t fsle3fq f17ae5zn&quot; href=&quot;https://www.gov.uk/guidance/united-kingdom-security-vetting-applicant&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;United Kingdom Security Vetting: Applicant&lt;/a&gt; ). You must be able to work in the UK without restrictions in accordance with UK National Law and be prepared to successfully undertake an appropriate level of UK National Security Vetting according to UK Government National Security Vetting criteria.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please be aware that, for roles requiring Security Check clearance, applicants will typically need to have been a continuous resident in the UK for a minimum of 5 years immediately prior to applying for this role in order to meet the requirements for Security Check (SC) clearance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What we offer:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;25&amp;nbsp;days&amp;nbsp;annual&amp;nbsp;leave&amp;nbsp;plus&amp;nbsp;bank&amp;nbsp;holidays&amp;nbsp;(with&amp;nbsp;the&amp;nbsp;option&amp;nbsp;to&amp;nbsp;buy&amp;nbsp;10&amp;nbsp;more&amp;nbsp;a&amp;nbsp;year)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company&amp;nbsp;bonus&amp;nbsp;(profit&amp;nbsp;share)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible&amp;nbsp;working&amp;nbsp;patterns&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;hybrid&amp;nbsp;working&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Medical&amp;nbsp;insurance&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;group&amp;nbsp;income&amp;nbsp;protection&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee&amp;nbsp;assistance&amp;nbsp;programme&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;mental&amp;nbsp;health&amp;nbsp;support&amp;nbsp;group&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enhanced&amp;nbsp;parental&amp;nbsp;leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sabbatical&amp;nbsp;leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Travel&amp;nbsp;insurance&amp;nbsp;(business&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;leisure)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous&amp;nbsp;company&amp;nbsp;pension&amp;nbsp;plan&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Personalised&amp;nbsp;career&amp;nbsp;development&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;training&amp;nbsp;plans&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Free&amp;nbsp;breakfast&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;two-course&amp;nbsp;lunch&amp;nbsp;in&amp;nbsp;the&amp;nbsp;office&amp;nbsp;every&amp;nbsp;day&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Free&amp;nbsp;onsite&amp;nbsp;parking&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;we&amp;nbsp;are&amp;nbsp;close&amp;nbsp;to&amp;nbsp;public&amp;nbsp;transport&amp;nbsp;links&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A&amp;nbsp;variety&amp;nbsp;of&amp;nbsp;events&amp;nbsp;organised&amp;nbsp;by&amp;nbsp;our&amp;nbsp;social&amp;nbsp;committee,&amp;nbsp;ranging&amp;nbsp;from&amp;nbsp;summer&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;Christmas&amp;nbsp;parties&amp;nbsp;to&amp;nbsp;board&amp;nbsp;game&amp;nbsp;nights&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;socials&amp;nbsp;at&amp;nbsp;our&amp;nbsp;own&amp;nbsp;rooftop&amp;nbsp;bar!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Cambridge Consultants?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Cambridge Consultants creates exciting and novel breakthroughs in technology and products. Our work on intelligent systems area has helped create world-first and market-changing technologies including&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.cambridgeconsultants.com/omniscia-superhuman-surgery-in-real-time/&quot;&gt;real-time AI-enhanced medical imaging&lt;/a&gt;,&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.cambridgeconsultants.com/project/pioneering-ai-cyberattack-response-for-the-uk-military/&quot;&gt;autonomous defence systems against cyberattacks&lt;/a&gt;, and&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.cambridgeconsultants.com/helping-visually-impaired-people-navigate-indoor-spaces/&quot;&gt;edge algorithms to help visually impaired people navigate indoor spaces&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;We combine our research output with engineering rigour to create innovative and robust solutions to solve complex problems presented to us by our clients. We help clients across a diverse range of markets, including defence/security, healthcare, biotech, industrial and energy, so there is no shortage of variety.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At the heart of what we do are talented and motivated multi-disciplinary teams empowered to create&amp;nbsp;cutting edge&amp;nbsp;technologies and systems to solve difficult problems for our clients.&amp;nbsp;We offer a diverse, fun, and challenging work environment where&amp;nbsp;you&#39;ll&amp;nbsp;have the chance to work on a wide variety of projects that deliver real value using technology. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We recognise and celebrate individual talent and we understand the importance of letting individuals be just that. Our people are here to do the best work of their lives and our job is to provide the platform for them to do it.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;By submitting an application to Cambridge Consultants, you confirm that the information provided in this application, together with any supporting documentation, is true, complete, and accurate to the best of your knowledge and belief. You understand that any false statement, misleading information, or material omission may render you liable to disqualification from the recruitment process, withdrawal of any offer of employment, or dismissal without notice if discovered following appointment. You acknowledge that the organisation reserves the right to verify the information supplied.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Introduction&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for an experienced Electronics and/or Software Engineer keen to help our clients solve complex technical challenges.&amp;nbsp; You’ll need to be eager to turn your hand to a lot of different tasks and enjoy constantly learning new things.&amp;nbsp; In return we can offer the chance to tackle some of the hardest engineering problems around, such as &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.cambridgeconsultants.com/project/a-step-change-in-ai-based-robotics-for-military-logistics/&quot;&gt;novel applications of robotics&lt;/a&gt;,&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wired.com/video/watch/an-inside-look-at-legos-new-tech-packed-smart-brick&quot;&gt;collaborating with LEGO®&lt;/a&gt; to develop &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wired.com/story/exclusive-inside-look-at-new-lego-smart-brick/&quot;&gt;LEGO® SMART Play™&lt;/a&gt; &amp;nbsp;and &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.cambridgeconsultants.com/project/overcoming-smart-meter-challenges-for-the-last-5/&quot;&gt;other embedded products&lt;/a&gt;, as well as defence and national security projects such as &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.cambridgeconsultants.com/project/pioneering-ai-cyberattack-response-for-the-uk-military/&quot;&gt;pioneering AI cyberattack response for the UK military&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Cambridge Consultants undertakes over 300 technology, design and consulting projects every year. You will get to work across the broad range of markets, from Consumer Devices to Industrial Systems to Defence and National Security. The Electronics and Software group is a cohesive team of multi-disciplinary experts in everything to do with embedded systems and devices – whether that’s electronics, embedded software, physics, control, communications, security or algorithm design.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for people with relevant previous experience to help widen our group’s skillset and support our junior engineers. We need people who are enthusiastic about learning, keen to pick up new skills, and can show evidence of a rigorous approach to solving real-world problems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your responsibilities&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With support and guidance from your peers, you will work as part of our technical team on client assignments in multi-disciplinary projects for a wide range of markets. You may work on one or more projects at a time, in a variety of different disciplines and roles.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will work on the design and implementation of systems for a wide range of applications and products. You will have many opportunities to develop your technical design skills for analogue and digital hardware, information engineering, embedded software, control, communications and whole product design. This could include writing software in C for embedded targets, writing SystemVerilog for FPGAs, PCB design and hardware testing.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be expected to interact directly with clients at all phases of projects, from requirements capture and progress updates to final handover.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for applicants with the following experience or skills:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An excellent degree or PhD in general, electrical, electronic or information engineering, computer science or physics.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior industrial experience in at least one of the following areas, and enthusiasm for learning about the others:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Software implementation in C, C++, Rust, or a similar programming language&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;PCB design&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Digital electronics (processors, memory, DSP, Verilog, VHDL)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analogue electronics (general, interfaces, RF, power)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Some projects at Cambridge Consultants are subject to security restrictions.&amp;nbsp;This role requires you to obtain a Security Check level security clearance ( &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.gov.uk/guidance/united-kingdom-security-vetting-applicant&quot;&gt;https://www.gov.uk/guidance/united-kingdom-security-vetting-applicant&lt;/a&gt; ). You must be able to work in the UK without restrictions in accordance with UK National Law and be prepared to successfully undertake an appropriate level of UK National Security Vetting according to UK Government National Security Vetting criteria.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We welcome applications from people with prior industrial experience in one or more relevant technical roles.  We are looking for excellence and are interested in both your skills and ability to learn quickly as well as your experience.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Along with your CV, please describe why you are attracted to this position, what you feel you offer Cambridge Consultants, and any achievements that you are particularly proud of. We are especially interested to hear about relevant prior industrial experience and personal projects.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;By submitting an application to Cambridge Consultants, you confirm that the information provided in this application, together with any supporting documentation, is true, complete, and accurate to the best of your knowledge and belief. You understand that any false statement, misleading information, or material omission may render you liable to disqualification from the recruitment process, withdrawal of any offer of employment, or dismissal without notice if discovered following appointment. You acknowledge that the organisation reserves the right to verify the information supplied.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THE ROLE 📝&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We’re looking for a Senior Digital Marketing Manager to lead Form3’s digital growth and demand generation strategy, helping drive pipeline growth and brand development across our priority markets.&amp;nbsp;Reporting to the Marketing Director, you’ll combine strategic ownership with execution across integrated campaigns, account-based marketing, digital acquisition and performance measurement. You’ll also identify practical ways to use AI, automation and marketing technology to improve targeting, personalisation, efficiency and campaign results. You’ll work closely with Sales, Customer Success, Product and the wider Marketing team, aligning marketing activity with commercial priorities and identifying opportunities within strategic accounts.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and own Form3’s digital growth and demand generation strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create go-to-market plans for products, propositions, markets and strategic announcements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create integrated, multi-channel programmes that generate awareness, engagement, qualified leads and pipeline.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build account-based marketing programmes for high-value prospects and strategic accounts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use AI, automation and marketing technology to improve targeting, personalisation, lead generation and campaign performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor performance across the marketing funnel and make insight-led recommendations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve website performance, conversion rates, user journeys and marketing-driven engagement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WE’RE LOOKING FOR 🔍&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Essential&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6+ years’ experience in B2B digital marketing, demand generation or campaign management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience developing campaign strategies and delivering integrated marketing campaigns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to link marketing investment to revenue growth and return on investment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expertise in account-based marketing, audience segmentation, pipeline generation and campaign activation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Practical experience using AI, automation and marketing technology to improve campaign performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong digital marketing capability across websites, landing pages, email, paid media, search and social, with the breadth and depth to lead an integrated digital strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical and performance-reporting skills, combined with a commercial and customer-focused approach.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and stakeholder-management skills, with the ability to collaborate effectively across functions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Desirable&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience within technology, SaaS, Fintech or payments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working within a start-up/scale-up environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working experience across multiple markets e.g. UK/Europe/NA&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with tooling such as Salesforce, Pardot, Salesloft, Cognism, ZoomInfo.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;INTERVIEW PROCESS ✍️&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stage One:&lt;/strong&gt; Screening Call with the Talent Team&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stage Two:&lt;/strong&gt; Interview with Marketing Director&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stage Three:&lt;/strong&gt; Case Study &amp;amp; Presentation with Marketing Team&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stage Four: &lt;/strong&gt;Interview with Head of Commercial Operations&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We always aim to stick to the above process; however, there may be occasions when an additional interview stage is required for us to be sure we are hiring the right person!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;HIRING LOCATIONS 📍&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Here are the locations that we are hiring from for this position:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;United Kingdom&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;All new joiners start their first day in our office to collect the equipment needed to work remotely. We&#39;ll also arrange for some of your team to come in to say hi, ensuring you&#39;re supported and have a positive first few days with Form3!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;BENEFITS 🏝️&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Form3 are a 100% remote, flexible business and are able to offer part-time working arrangements. We believe this enables our people to achieve amazing things with a healthy work-life balance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For further information on what it’s like to work here, and for more information on our full benefits package, visit our careers page. If you have any other questions, we’d be happy to discuss these with you during the interview process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ABOUT FORM3 💭&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Revolutionising the world of payments with our cloud-native, multi-cloud platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information about Form3, check out the following pages:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.form3.tech/platform&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Hyperlink&quot;&gt;What we do&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;|&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.form3.tech/culture&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Hyperlink&quot;&gt;Life at Form3&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;|&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.form3.tech/careers&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Hyperlink&quot;&gt;Benefits&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;|&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/@Form3Cloud/podcasts&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Hyperlink&quot;&gt;Payments Cannot Fail Series&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;|&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://techpodcast.form3.tech/episodes&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Hyperlink&quot;&gt;.Tech Podcast&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;OUR DEI&amp;amp;B COMMITMENT&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:259}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;We hire talented people from a variety of backgrounds and experiences and are committed to a work environment based on diversity, open-mindedness and curiosity. We’re united by our company values (we even created them together!) and we celebrate our unique differences.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:259}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Our employee lifecycle processes are designed to embrace equal opportunity and prevent discrimination against our people regardless of personal characteristics. It is our strong belief that the more inclusive and belonging we are as a business, the better our work will be.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:259}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;As an inclusive employer, we guarantee to interview all neurodiverse and physically disabled applicants who meet the minimum criteria for this role. We also encourage candidates to notify us of any reasonable adjustments that may be required during the recruitment process. This includes providing job adverts in alternative, accessible formats or adjustments required at interview stage.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:259}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;If you consider yourself to be neurodiverse or physically disabled under the UN definition of disability and would like to be considered under this scheme and/or require any reasonable adjustments please let us know by sending an email to &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a ----- ----- data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; clearly stating your consent for us to process this data. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;For more information please refer to our &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.form3.tech/legal/recruitment-data-policy&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Recruitment Data Policy&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:259}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;THE ROLE&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;📝&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We’re looking for a Reporting &amp;amp; Data Analyst to help Form3 develop a more reliable, scalable and accessible reporting capability across the organisation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;This is a six-month fixed-term contract with two clear priorities: completing and enhancing the Customer Service reporting suite in AWS QuickSight, and building trusted, reusable datasets that enable teams to create and maintain their own reporting.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;You’ll work across the business to improve data quality, reduce manual reporting and establish stronger documentation, governance and knowledge transfer for the future.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Complete and enhance the Customer Service reporting suite and reporting deck in AWS QuickSight.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Design, build and document reusable datasets for multiple reporting use cases.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Integrate key business systems into curated reporting datasets.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Translate stakeholder questions into clear data and dashboard requirements.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Establish consistent business metrics, definitions and reporting logic.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Automate manual reporting and duplicated data preparation where possible.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Validate reporting outputs and investigate data-quality issues.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Provide knowledge transfer to internal teams and support a longer-term reporting roadmap.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;WE’RE LOOKING FOR &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;🔍&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Essential&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Experience in a Reporting Analyst, Data Analyst, BI Analyst or similar role.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Hands-on experience building and maintaining dashboards using AWS QuickSight or a comparable BI platform.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Practical experience using SQL and Python for reporting, data transformation or analysis.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Experience working with multiple data sources and translating stakeholder requirements into accurate, maintainable reporting.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;A self-sufficient and pragmatic approach, with the ability to take ownership and deliver within a focused six-month engagement.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Desirable&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Experience using Amazon Athena or a similar cloud-based data querying service.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Experience creating curated datasets for self-service reporting.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Experience improving data quality, reporting governance and technical documentation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Experience working in a start-up, scale-up or small team where you have had broad ownership.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;TECH STACK &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;⚙️&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;AWS QuickSight&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; - building dashboards, reporting suites and reusable datasets.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;SQL&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; - querying, transforming and validating reporting data.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Python&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; - supporting data transformation, automation and reporting workflows.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Business and operational systems&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; - integrating data sources into trusted reporting datasets.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;INTERVIEW PROCESS &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;✍️&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Stage 1:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; Screening Call with Talent Team&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Stage 2:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; Practical Technical Task&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Stage 3:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; Interview with the Hiring Manager, including a discussion of your technical task and your approach to reporting, data quality, stakeholder requirements and self-service analytics&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We always aim to stick to the above process, however there may be occasions when an additional interview stage is needed for us to be sure we’re hiring the right fit for the role.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;HIRING LOCATIONS📍&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Here are the locations that we are hiring from for this position.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;32&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;United Kingdom&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;All new joiners start their first day in our office to collect the equipment needed to work remotely. We&#39;ll also arrange for some of your team to come in to say hi, ensuring you&#39;re supported and have a positive first few days with Form3!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;BENEFITS 🏝️&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Form3 are a 100% remote, flexible business and are able to offer part-time working arrangements. We believe this enables our people to achieve amazing things with a healthy work-life balance.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;For further information on what it’s like to work here, and for more information on our full benefits package, visit our &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.form3.tech/careers&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Hyperlink&quot;&gt;careers page&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;. If you have any other questions, we’d be happy to discuss these with your during the interview process.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;ABOUT FORM3 💭&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Revolutionising the world of payments with our cloud-native, multi-cloud platform. For more information about Form3, check out the following pages:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.form3.tech/platform&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Hyperlink&quot;&gt;What we do&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; | &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.form3.tech/culture&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Hyperlink&quot;&gt;Life at Form3&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; | &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.form3.tech/careers&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Hyperlink&quot;&gt;Benefits&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; | &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/@Form3Cloud/podcasts&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Hyperlink&quot;&gt;P&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Hyperlink&quot;&gt;ayments Cannot &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Hyperlink&quot;&gt;Fail &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Hyperlink&quot;&gt;Series&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; | &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://techpodcast.form3.tech/episodes&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Hyperlink&quot;&gt;.Tech&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Hyperlink&quot;&gt; Podcast&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;OUR DEI&amp;amp;B COMMITMENT&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:259}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;We hire talented people from a variety of backgrounds and experiences and are committed to a work environment based on diversity, open-mindedness and curiosity. We’re united by our company values (we even created them together!) and we celebrate our unique differences.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:259}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Our employee lifecycle processes are designed to embrace equal opportunity and prevent discrimination against our people regardless of personal characteristics. It is our strong belief that the more inclusive and belonging we are as a business, the better our work will be.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:259}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;As an inclusive employer, we guarantee to interview all neurodiverse and physically disabled applicants who meet the minimum criteria for this role. We also encourage candidates to notify us of any reasonable adjustments that may be required during the recruitment process. This includes providing job adverts in alternative, accessible formats or adjustments required at interview stage.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:259}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;If you consider yourself to be neurodiverse or physically disabled under the UN definition of disability and would like to be considered under this scheme and/or require any reasonable adjustments please let us know by sending an email to &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a ----- ----- data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; clearly stating your consent for us to process this data. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;For more information please refer to our &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.form3.tech/legal/recruitment-data-policy&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Recruitment Data Policy&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:259}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hi 👋 we’re Genio. We create beautifully simple learning tools that boost knowledge, skills, and confidence.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We’re a SaaS scale up - there’s 90+ of us around the UK with our HQ in Leeds.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Our software is award-winning and used by 100,000s of students at over 1,000 universities &amp;amp; colleges worldwide.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We’re driven achieve our mission to support 1 million students to become better learners by 2030.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🚀 About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Career track:&lt;/strong&gt; IC4&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Unit:&lt;/strong&gt; Shared Services&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Genio has given everyone access to Claude, but most of what makes AI work across a company doesn’t exist here yet: connections to our business systems, a shared skills library, people in each team who can help their colleagues, and the checks that keep it safe. This role designs and builds that system, then gets every team using it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;It’s a hands-on building role. We buy and configure leading platforms rather than build our own agent infrastructure, and you’ll write code and build custom integrations wherever configuration isn’t enough. Success is measured by how well other teams build and run their own workflows.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You will be responsible for:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Design.&lt;/strong&gt; You design how our AI platforms, connectors, skills and agents fit together. You track what’s changing in AI tools, recommend platform and model choices to the Head of BizOps, and judge new tools on measured performance, reliability, security and cost.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build and run.&lt;/strong&gt; You build and maintain the integrations and agents that connect our AI platforms to business systems such as our CRM and our documentation, communication and finance tools. You’re responsible for the health of the whole system: spotting failures and out-of-date skills, and tracking use and cost by team so they can be recharged and reported. Champions answer first-line questions and IT handles access, while you handle escalations and fix root causes so problems don’t come back.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Knowledge.&lt;/strong&gt; You build and look after the skills library and the shared knowledge our AI tools draw on: where it lives, how it’s organised, and how it’s kept current and correctly permissioned. You spot good workflows in one team, refine them and make them available to everyone, and decide which become company standards. The teams that own content keep it up to date.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Adoption.&lt;/strong&gt; You train people at every level of technical skill and build a network of champions, nominated by their function heads, so every team has someone nearby to ask. You work alongside teams as they redesign processes, bringing the options for what can be automated, and share practice with engineering in both directions. You also report, team by team, where use is growing, where it’s slow and which uses are producing value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Guardrails.&lt;/strong&gt; You keep the inventory of AI tools and what each can access, run a fast track for low-risk trials using criteria from our AI policy, and coordinate security, data protection and legal reviews for everything else. Every trial starts with agreed success criteria and ends with a decision to adopt, scale or stop. You configure and check guardrails, such as human review before AI output reaches customers or students, and limits on what agents can do on Genio’s behalf.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;👥 Meet the team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be reporting directly into the Head of BizOps (Business Operations) and working most closely with:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Division leaders and SME champions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Platform Ops and the Principal Engineers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Head of EX (Employee Experience), on how roles and expectations change&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;VP Finance, on cost and recharging&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;IT and InfoSec, RevOps and Data in BizOps&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Legal and data protection&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;👤 About you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Essential:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional experience rolling out AI tools or automation that teams other than your own use day to day, including redesigning the processes around them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience connecting systems through APIs and automation platforms such as Zapier, Make or n8n, and enough Python or JavaScript to write, read and debug integrations, with AI assistance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of teaching technical things to non-technical people, and a way of knowing it worked.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Examples of persuading senior people when you disagreed with their priorities, and of setting your own direction against a wider goal.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sound judgement about data and access, including knowing when a connection needs a security review before it goes live.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Desirable:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;HubSpot administration or development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Organising shared knowledge, such as documentation or knowledge bases&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Setting up or running a champions or super-user network&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in education or with sensitive personal data&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An engineering background&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;💰 Salary and benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;£70,000 - £85,000 dependent upon experience&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🏖️ 33 days annual leave (Inclusive of bank holidays)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🎄 3 gifted days off at Christmas&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;💰 EMI Share Options Scheme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🎓 Generous individual learning and training allowance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;⌚ Truly flexible hours to suit when you work best&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;💻 Full home working set up and beautiful collaborative office space&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🚗 Free Leeds City Centre office parking&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🌴 Nomad working policy with family travel insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🍼 Enhanced 26 weeks maternity and 4 weeks paternity (fully paid)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🤍 Health cash plan (from glasses to massages)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;💸 6% employer pension contribution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;📍 Location&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our beautiful office space in Leeds is our key hub for collaboration, and we love to get together in person. We operate a flexible hybrid working model, including supporting our Genios who are based remotely across the UK. If you are more than 50 miles away from the office, we offer full remote working support, with the opportunity to join colleagues for in-person collaboration several times a year.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We will discuss ways of working with you at interview however if you have any questions before you apply please reach out to &lt;a ----------
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;📄 Applicant Privacy Notice&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We think it’s important that you understand how we use and handle your personal information, so here’s a link to our &lt;a href=&quot;https://glean.co/glean-applicant-privacy-notice&quot;&gt;privacy notice.&lt;/a&gt; By submitting your application, you’re confirming that you’ve read and understood this notice.&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Liftoff&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; is a leading AI-powered performance marketing platform for the mobile app economy. Our end-to-end technology stack helps app marketers acquire and retain high-value users, while enabling publishers to maximize revenue across programmatic and direct demand.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Liftoff’s solutions, including Accelerate, Direct, Monetize, Intelligence, and Vungle Exchange, support over 6,600 mobile businesses across 74 countries in sectors such as gaming, social, finance, ecommerce, and entertainment. Founded in 2012 and headquartered in Redwood City, CA, Liftoff has a diverse, global presence.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Liftoff is looking for a Commercial Legal Counsel that will assist the in-house legal department with Insertion Orders (Agreements), third party contracts and other legal needs. This position will support the Commercial, Finance and Accounting teams, located around the world.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;As a Commercial Legal Counsel at Liftoff, you will play a pivotal role in ensuring the seamless execution of contracts that drive our business forward. You will be at the intersection of legal expertise, meticulous organization, and collaborative teamwork. Your responsibilities will encompass contract drafting, negotiation, process improvement and training. As an essential part of our team, you&#39;ll contribute to the foundation of our business relationships and help us navigate the complex world of contracts with precision and efficiency. If you&#39;re passionate about detail-oriented work, contract law, and making a meaningful impact, this role is your opportunity to shine. Join us in shaping the way we manage contracts and elevate our commitment to excellence.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Draft, review, and negotiate a wide range of contracts, including vendor agreements, customer contracts, and licensing agreements, to ensure compliance with company policies and legal requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with internal teams, including legal, sales/commercial, product, engineering, finance and accounting to understand contract terms, resolve issues, and provide guidance on contractual matters.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain an organized and up-to-date contract ticketing system, respond to each contract ticket in a timely manner and track contract milestones and deadlines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist in&amp;nbsp; contract compliance, addressing any deviations or breaches.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist in the development and improvement of contract templates and standard clauses.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the contract approval process, ensuring proper authorization and documentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide guidance and training to employees on contract-related matters and best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay updated on relevant laws and regulations impacting contract management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4-8 years&#39; PQE&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in Law, or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience as a Contracts Counsel/Legal Counsel or in a similar role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of contract law and legal terminology.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Detail-oriented with exceptional organizational and time management abilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in contract management software or tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work collaboratively in a cross-functional team environment globally.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior experience in ad-tech is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This position is based in London or remotely within the United Kingdom, occasionally going into the office.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This position is a contract position. The expected hours of work required for this position are 35 to 40 hours per week, with occasional early evening hours for team meetings, as the manager is located in our Redwood City office in California.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-REMOTE&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-NM1&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Liftoff offers a fast-paced, collaborative, and innovative work environment where employees are empowered to grow and make an impact. We’re shaping the future of the mobile app ecosystem—join us and help accelerate what’s next.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Liftoff’s compensation strategy includes competitive salaries, equity, and benefits designed to support employee well-being and performance. We benchmark compensation based on role, level, and location to ensure fairness and market alignment. Benefits may include medical coverage, wellness stipends, and additional perks based on your country of residence.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Liftoff is an equal opportunity employer. We are committed to creating an inclusive environment for all employees and applicants regardless of race, ethnicity, national origin, age, marital status, disability, sexual orientation, gender identity, religion, veteran status, or any other characteristic protected by applicable law.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Agency and Third Party Recruiter Notice:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Liftoff does not accept unsolicited resumes from individual recruiters or third-party recruiting agencies in response to job postings. No fee will be paid to third parties who submit unsolicited candidates directly to our hiring managers or Recruiting Team. All candidates must be submitted via our Applicant Tracking System by approved Liftoff vendors who have been expressly requested to make a submission by our Recruiting Team for a specific job opening. No placement fees will be paid to any firm unless such a request has been made by the Liftoff Recruiting Team and such a candidate was submitted to the Liftoff Recruiting Team via our Applicant Tracking System.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;HelloFresh manages approximately €1.7B in annual direct procurement spend across ingredients and packaging, covering markets in the EU, US, Canada, ANZ, and the UK.&amp;nbsp;This role builds the cost intelligence capability for Global Procurement. You will create the analytical models and frameworks that give the business clear visibility into what ingredients really cost: where those costs come from, how they move, and where the opportunities lie. Your work will give regional teams the insight they need to make well-grounded decisions and to track progress against the group&#39;s cost reduction ambitions.&amp;nbsp;This is a role for a senior procurement professional who is comfortable with detailed analysis and who can explain complex numbers simply to senior leaders and to colleagues in markets. You will be recognized as the go-to expert on cost across the team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop a harmonized cost measurement methodology with Finance and regional procurement teams, so that ingredient savings are defined, measured, and reported consistently across all markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build should-cost models and total cost of ownership frameworks for priority categories, breaking unit price into its drivers (origin, processing method, logistics, certification, and shelf life), and use them to identify savings and inform sourcing decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track ingredient price drivers across markets, including contract prices, actual prices, and market inflation, and identify overlap across brands to find rationalization and consolidation opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Report progress against the group&#39;s ingredient cost reduction target to senior leadership, explaining root causes rather than just variances, and help build the governance needed to sustain this over time.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You are...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An analytical professional who builds models that hold up to scrutiny from Finance and senior leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commercially minded: you look at total value, not just unit price, and you understand what drives cost in food and packaging.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A clear communicator who turns complex analysis into a simple story that regional teams can act on.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborative: you build alignment with Finance, procurement, and market teams through influence rather than authority.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-directed: you manage several analyses at once and take ownership from the question through to the recommendation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You have...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years in procurement, cost analysis, or consulting in a global food, retail, or consumer goods business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience building should-cost models or total cost of ownership frameworks, and using them to influence real commercial decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience measuring cost and savings across multiple markets, including the common pitfalls such as inconsistent methods, inflation effects, and volume mix.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with food, ingredient, or packaging categories, including origin, certification, and specification considerations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent in English. Bonus if fluent in French, German, or Dutch. Comfortable working across time zones, with the ability to travel up to 20%.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to have...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with sustainability certification schemes and their cost implications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with commodity price risk or hedging frameworks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You&#39;ll get…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;If based in New York or Toronto:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive salary &amp;amp; retirement savings plan with company match&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous parental leave &amp;amp; PTO policy, plus paid holidays&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible health, dental, and vision plans&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Up to 75% discount on HelloFresh subscription&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Emergency child and adult care services&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Snacks &amp;amp; monthly catered lunches&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
