&lt;p&gt;As a Principal Product Designer on the Diner Platform team, you will shape how millions of diners discover, book, and return to the restaurants they love, across our mobile apps and website. You will take on the most complex problems in acquisition, engagement, and retention, whether that means setting the vision for something new or stepping into a stalled project to find the way forward. You will work hands-on from early exploration through the build, and you will manage a small team of one to three designers while reporting to a Design Director. Your work will raise the quality and speed of design across the platform and help the designers around you grow.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
