&lt;h2 style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;About The Opportunity&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Become part of the Contentful Personalization Team and help shape how leading businesses deliver personalized digital user experiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Software Engineer, you will solve complex customer problems and deliver value through end-to-end personalization solutions. You will work across high-performance backend services, developer-facing frontend tools and SDKs, infrastructure, and observability to help customers deliver personalized content experiences in a performant, reliable, and developer-friendly way.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will bring a proactive approach to problem-solving, a high sense of ownership, and a continuous improvement mindset. You will use modern AI tools, including agentic coding workflows, thoughtfully to improve how you explore, build, test, and maintain software. You will also contribute actively to the team&#39;s Agile ways of working, understanding how planning, refinement, delivery, reviews, retrospectives, and continuous improvement fit together.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;What To Expect?&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, develop, and maintain high-performance backend services and APIs with a focus on reliability, scalability, and low latency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver end-to-end solutions across backend services, React-based frontend experiences, and developer-facing SDKs, libraries, and tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implement complex CDN and edge-based caching solutions that allow users to retrieve personalized content in the most performant way.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solve technical challenges in creative ways, balancing the trade-off between performance and elegant software architecture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continuously monitor and optimize system performance through benchmarking, while making sure systems are well instrumented for observability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implement defensive coding practices and guarantee correctness and maintainable code through automated testing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use AI-assisted and agentic coding tools responsibly to improve engineering workflows, while maintaining high standards for code quality, security, testing, and review.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate actively in Agile ceremonies, including planning, refinement, reviews, and retrospectives, to help the team deliver customer value and continuously improve.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay up to date with the latest technologies and constantly evaluate their potential use at Contentful.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;What You Need To Be Successful?&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience building APIs and services that efficiently handle large volumes of traffic.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong proficiency with server-side TypeScript and API protocol design.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience delivering full-stack solutions, including React-based frontend experiences and SDKs, libraries, or tools for developers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with serverless architectures, ideally edge compute environments such as Cloudflare Workers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with CDN operations and caching strategies to optimize system performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with benchmarking, instrumenting code for observability, and performance optimization for large-scale systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expertise in defensive coding practices, ensuring system robustness and fault tolerance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in using CI/CD pipelines and maintaining automated tests, including unit and end-to-end tests.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using AI tools, including agentic coding workflows, to improve software delivery while applying sound engineering judgment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A practical understanding of Agile delivery and how planning, refinement, implementation, reviews, and retrospectives support sustainable delivery and continuous improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proactive approach with a strong sense of ownership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Great communication skills in English, especially when explaining complex technical concepts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;More details about our company benefits can be found at the following link:&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;link__new-tab&quot; href=&quot;https://www.salesforcebenefits.com/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;https://www.salesforcebenefits.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Contentful is now officially part of Salesforce.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Unleash Your Potential&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;When you join Salesforce, you’ll be limitless in all areas of your life. Our benefits and resources support you to find balance and be your best, and our AI agents accelerate your impact so you can do your best. Together, we’ll bring the power of Agentforce to organizations of all sizes and deliver amazing experiences that customers love. Apply today to not only shape the future — but to redefine what’s possible — for yourself, for AI, and the world.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;More details about company benefits can be found at the following link: &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.salesforcebenefits.com&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;https://www.salesforcebenefits.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;If you need reasonable accommodations at any point during the application or interview process, please let your Recruiter know.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Equal Opportunity Statement&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Salesforce is an equal opportunity employer and maintains a policy of non-discrimination with all employees and applicants for employment. What does that mean exactly? It means that at Salesforce, we believe in equality for all. And we believe we can lead the path to equality in part by creating a workplace that’s inclusive, and free from discrimination.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.eeoc.gov/know-your-rights-workplace-discrimination-illegal&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Know your rights: workplace discrimination is illegal.&lt;/a&gt; Any employee or potential employee will be assessed on the basis of merit, competence and qualifications – without regard to race, religion, color, national origin, sex, sexual orientation, gender expression or identity, transgender status, age, disability, veteran or marital status, political viewpoint, or other classifications protected by law. This policy applies to current and prospective employees, no matter where they are in their Salesforce employment journey. It also applies to recruiting, hiring, job assignment, compensation, promotion, benefits, training, assessment of job performance, discipline, termination, and everything in between. Recruiting, hiring, and promotion decisions at Salesforce are fair and based on merit. The same goes for compensation, benefits, promotions, transfers, reduction in workforce, recall, training, and education.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #3e3e3e;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Please be aware of scammers who may fraudulently claim to be from Contentful. These types of fraud can occur through copycat websites, fake email addresses claiming to be from our company, or social media. We do not ask for your personal information, such as bank account numbers, identification numbers, etc., through social media or chat-based apps, nor do we request or send money to purchase business equipment. If you suspect fraud, please report it to your local authorities and contact us at &lt;a ----- ----- &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #3e3e3e;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;with any information you may have.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;By clicking “Apply for this job,” I acknowledge that I have read the “&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.contentful.com/legal/privacy-and-data-protection/privacy-notice-to-candidates/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Contentful’s Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;” and hereby consent to the collection, processing, use, and storage of my personal information as described therein.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;BOUT TIDE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Tide, we help SMEs save time and money in the running of their businesses by not only offering business accounts and related banking services, but also a comprehensive set of highly usable and connected administrative solutions, from invoicing to accounting.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Tide is transforming the small business banking market and now supports over 2 million members globally across the UK, Germany and France.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Using advanced technology, all solutions are designed with SMEs in mind. With quick onboarding, low fees and innovative features, we thrive on making data driven decisions to serve our mission: to help SMEs save time and money so they can get back to doing what they love.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tide facts:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tide is available for UK, German and French SMEs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Over 2 million members globally and rapidly growing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Over $300 million raised in funding&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3,000 Tideans globally&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We have offices in Central London, with a member support and technology centre in Sofia, Bulgaria, technology centres in Serbia, Romania, Lithuania and Hyderabad and offices in Gurugram, New Delhi, Berlin, Paris and Luxembourg&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ABOUT THE ROLE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Tide is hiring a VP of Engineering to lead the engineering organisation behind Ongoing Monitoring. You will report directly to the Chief Data and Technology Officer. Ongoing Monitoring protects our members by detecting fraud, financial crime and regulatory risk across every transaction Tide processes. The engineering, data science and platform capability behind it is one of the most technically demanding estates at Tide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be accountable for the engineering strategy, organisation and execution across all Ongoing Monitoring value streams: real-time transaction monitoring for bank payments fraud, acquiring fraud, Anti Money Laundering, Counter Terrorist Financing, sanctions and prohibited activities monitoring, and the tooling our financial investigators depend on. That means ML models in production, agentic AI inside regulated workflows, and multi-market screening infrastructure that stands up to regulatory scrutiny.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role sits at the intersection of regulated risk operations, near real-time platform engineering and applied AI. Our first line operations teams are the primary internal customer, our second line sets the risk appetite, and our regulators set the bar. We need someone who can raise detection quality and reduce fraud losses while driving the cost of monitoring per member down, and scale agentic solutions where a wrong answer has consequences for a member and for Tide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As VP Engineering, Ongoing Monitoring you will:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set the engineering strategy for Tide&#39;s fraud, financial crime and ongoing monitoring platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead engineering across backend, frontend, data science, ML engineering and analytics engineering, primarily based in Hyderabad with product leadership split between Hyderabad and London&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead managers and senior engineers, and build the leadership bench underneath you&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with multiple stakeholders across risk, operations, business, design, product and engineering&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the Decision Engine and Decision Intelligence Platform as shared capabilities, unifying domestic and international payment flows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the model lifecycle end to end, from development through backtesting, shadow deployment and staged rollout to production performance monitoring&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Scale agentic AI in regulated workflows, including migrating Ongoing Monitoring agents onto Tide&#39;s shared agentic infrastructure and holding the line on our agentic governance framework&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver measurable risk and efficiency outcomes: lower fraud losses, higher automated alert throughput, and a falling ongoing monitoring cost per member&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build the operating model that connects first line operations, second line risk and compliance, payments and acquiring engineering, KYX, AI Platforms and data science leadership behind one roadmap&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply principles so we build once, deploy globally, and keep market-specific logic isolated&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is one of the most important engineering roles at Tide. Ongoing Monitoring is where we prove that trust scales, across every transaction we process. You will shape how quickly we protect our members, how confidently we enter new markets under our own licences, and how far applied AI can compound into a lasting advantage in a regulated environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;WHAT WE ARE LOOKING FOR&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading engineering organisations in fraud, financial crime, risk or another real-time decisioning domain&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong track record of turning platform investment into measurable outcomes across fraud detection and mitigation, unit economics reduction and workflows automation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience taking machine learning from development into production at scale, and owning model performance once live and fast iteration of model development&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience operating in a regulated environment, working with second line risk and compliance functions and with regulators&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong judgement across organisation design, delivery, platform strategy, data architecture and technical quality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to lead distributed teams across multiple markets and align several functions behind one roadmap, operating model and set of priorities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience deploying AI or agentic systems inside regulated workflows, with a clear view on governance, evaluation and human oversight would be a bonus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;WHAT YOU’LL GET IN RETURN&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our location-specific employee benefits are designed to cater to the unique needs of Tideans:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive Compensation –&amp;nbsp; Competitive salary and share options.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Time Off – Generous annual leave on top of bank holidays.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Parental Leave – Maternity, paternity, and adoption leave to support your family journey.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sabbatical – Extended unpaid and paid leave options after completing milestone years with Tide.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Health Insurance – Public health insurance plan.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Retirement Planning – Public pension scheme on eligible earnings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;DeutschlandTicket via Spendit - Employer funded free, unlimited travel throughout Germany on all local public transport (not valid in ICE, IC/EC).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Urban Sports Club Membership - Employer funded M membership to help you live a healthy and active lifestyle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mental Wellbeing – Access to therapy sessions, courses, meditations, and workshops.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Volunteering &amp;amp; Development Days – Paid days annually for volunteering or personal growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Learning &amp;amp; Development – Annual budget for books, courses, coaching, and more.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;WOO (Work Outside the Office) – Work from abroad for up to 90 days annually.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Home Office Setup – Contribution towards setting up your home office.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Laptop Ownership – Keep your old laptop and get a new one when it’s time for a replacement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;TIDEAN WAYS OF WORKING&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Tide, we champion a &lt;strong&gt;flexible workplace &lt;/strong&gt;model that&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;supports both in-person and remote work to cater to the specific needs of our different teams.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;While remote work is supported, we believe in the power of face-to-face interactions to foster team spirit and collaboration. Our offices are designed as hubs for innovation and team-building, where we encourage regular in-person gatherings to foster a strong sense of community.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
