&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 3&quot;&gt;Deine&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 3&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 3&quot;&gt;Erfahrung&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 3&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;amp; Skills&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134245418&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245529&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;335557856&amp;quot;:16777215,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:281,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:281}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Du&amp;nbsp;bringst&amp;nbsp;4–6 Jahre&amp;nbsp;fundierte&amp;nbsp;Berufserfahrung&amp;nbsp;als&amp;nbsp;Brand-&amp;nbsp;oder&amp;nbsp;Marketing Manager&amp;nbsp;im&amp;nbsp;FMCG- /&amp;nbsp;Konsumgüterbereich&amp;nbsp;mit.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Gerne aus dem Bereich Food &amp;amp; Beverage&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Du&amp;nbsp;hast&amp;nbsp;nachweisbare&amp;nbsp;Erfahrung&amp;nbsp;in der&amp;nbsp;Führung&amp;nbsp;oder&amp;nbsp;Betreuung&amp;nbsp;eine&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;r&amp;nbsp;oder&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;mehrerer&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Marken in&amp;nbsp;der Schweiz mit Umsätzen&amp;nbsp;von&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;mindestens&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;50 Mio&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;. CHF&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Du&amp;nbsp;besitzt&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;fundierte Erfahrung&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;in der Steuerung eines&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;D2C-Business&amp;nbsp;sowie in der Steuerung von&amp;nbsp;Omnichannel-Kampagnen (inkl. Mass Media, Influencer Marketing&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Social Media wie TikTok und Meta&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;, sowie Point of Sale + Pureplay&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Du zeichnest dich durch eine starke Hands-on-Mentalität, ausgeprägte Fähigkeiten im Projektmanagement und echte Lust auf crossfunktionale Zusammenarbeit aus&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Du hast ein strategisches, kreatives und datengetriebenes Mindset und gehst sicher mit digitalen Marketing-Tools um&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Du hast verhandlungssichere Deutsch- (Schweizerdeutsch) sowie fließende Französischkenntnisse und nutzt Englisch sicher für unsere interne Kommunikation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Warum wir?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;258&quot; data-end=&quot;599&quot;&gt;Bei The Quality Group arbeiten über 1.200 Menschen mit einer gemeinsamen Mission: Ernährung neu zu denken - gesünder, smarter und mit echtem Mehrwert für die Community.&lt;br data-start=&quot;434&quot; data-end=&quot;437&quot;&gt;Wir glauben an Teamgeist, Eigenverantwortung und den Mut, Grenzen zu verschieben. Dabei zählt jeder Beitrag, unabhängig vom Standort oder Bereich.&lt;br&gt;Je nachdem, wo du bei uns einsteigst, erwarten dich unterschiedliche Benefits, unter anderem:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Attraktive Mitarbeiterrabatte auf Produkte von ESN &amp;amp; More&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible Arbeitszeiten &amp;amp; Homeoffice-Möglichkeiten&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Zuschüsse zu Mobilität &amp;amp; Fitness (z. B. Wellpass, Deutschlandticket)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Betriebliche Altersvorsorge&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Workation-Optionen und mehr&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;981&quot; data-end=&quot;1212&quot;&gt;Im Bewerbungsprozess erfährst du, welche Vorteile dich an deinem Standort konkret erwarten und was es heißt, Teil von &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1101&quot; data-end=&quot;1108&quot;&gt;TQG&lt;/strong&gt; zu sein: Ein Unternehmen, das mit Leidenschaft, Qualität und Mut die Zukunft von Ernährung gestaltet.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;981&quot; data-end=&quot;1212&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Über uns&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Quality Group (TQG) ist ein innovativer Anbieter von Sporternährungsprodukten und vereint seit 2021 die erfolgreichen Marken ESN und More Nutrition. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;ESN ist seit 2004 deutscher Marktführer für Sporternährung und bietet Produkte wie Proteinpulver, Riegel und Supplements, die auf ambitionierte Fitnessziele ausgerichtet sind. More Nutrition, gegründet 2017, steht für gesunde, zuckerreduzierte Ernährungsprodukte und bietet Lösungen für bewusste Ernährung und Gewichtsmanagement – ohne Verzicht. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Die Vision von TQG ist es, Menschen dabei zu unterstützen, die beste Version ihrer selbst zu werden. Mit Leidenschaft und Innovationskraft entwickelt das Unternehmen hochwertige Produkte, die Gesundheit, Leistung und Lebensfreude fördern. Mit einer agilen Unternehmenskultur und spannenden Karrieremöglichkeiten ist TQG nicht nur für Kunden, sondern auch für Mitarbeitende ein starker Partner. &amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Das sind wir – The Quality Group – nice to meet you! Now it’s your turn!&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Wir freuen uns auf deine Bewerbung! Unabhängig von Geschlecht, Alter, Herkunft oder Identität – bei uns zählt, wer du bist und was du einbringst. Werde Teil unseres Teams und wachse mit uns.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.ch">Jobs in Switzerland</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Nebius:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nebius is leading a new era in cloud infrastructure for the global AI economy. We are building a full-stack AI cloud platform that supports developers and enterprises from data and model training through to production deployment, without the cost and complexity of building large in-house AI/ML infrastructure.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Built by engineers, for engineers. From large-scale GPU orchestration to inference optimization, we own the hard problems across compute, storage, networking and applied AI.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Listed on Nasdaq (NBIS) and headquartered in Amsterdam, we have a global footprint with R&amp;amp;D hubs across Europe, the UK, North America and Israel. Our team of 1,500+ includes hundreds of engineers with deep expertise across hardware, software and AI R&amp;amp;D.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h4&gt;The role:&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In Token Factory analytics there is no split into product analysts, ML engineers and data engineers. Each person owns a question end to end: builds the data, runs the analysis, and comes back with a recommendation that changes a decision.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Your responsibilities will include:&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;- Define core product and business metrics and build a single source of truth that Product, Finance, and Sales can rely on.&lt;br&gt;- Build a comprehensive view of self-service customers, including usage patterns, customer health, satisfaction, retention risks, unmet needs, and growth opportunities.&lt;br&gt;- Translate customer demand and commercial plans into capacity forecasts and support capacity allocation decisions.&lt;br&gt;- Measure effective capacity utilization and identify opportunities to improve the commercial value of available capacity.&lt;br&gt;- Develop and evaluate pricing and packaging models, including guaranteed capacity, on-demand pricing, commitments, clawback mechanisms, and provisioned throughput units.&lt;br&gt;- Provide data-driven recommendations for the self-service and managed offerings, including customer segmentation, pricing, and capacity.&lt;br&gt;- Partner with Product, Engineering, Applied AI, Finance, and Sales to turn insights into concrete product and operational improvements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;We expect you to have:&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;- 5+ years of experience in analytics or data science.&lt;br&gt;- Strong Python, SQL, and statistics: you understand the code and the methods you use.&lt;br&gt;- Hands-on experience analysing large-scale customer, product, and usage datasets using statistical / analytical or distributed data-processing tools.&lt;br&gt;- AI-assisted coding as your default way of working: you guide it, verify it, and own the result.&lt;br&gt;- The ability to go from a question to a production-ready solution.&lt;br&gt;- The ability to turn complex data into clear recommendations.&lt;br&gt;- Strong commercial and product judgment, with the ability to balance customer value, monetization, growth, and profitability.&lt;br&gt;- Experience with pricing, packaging, monetization, or commercial analytics for technical or consumption-based products.&lt;br&gt;- Strong cross-functional collaboration skills across Product, Engineering, Data, Finance, Sales, and Operations.&lt;br&gt;- A hands-on and proactive working style, with the ability to operate effectively in an ambiguous and technically complex environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Nice to have:&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;- Familiarity with LLM inference economics: tokens, throughput and latency, batching, GPU costs.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits &amp;amp; Perks:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive compensation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Career growth and learning opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexibility and ownership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborative and innovative culture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opportunity to work on impactful AI projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;International environment and talented teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What&#39;s it like to work at Nebius:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fast moving&amp;nbsp;- Bold thinking&amp;nbsp;- Constant growth&amp;nbsp;- Meaningful impact&amp;nbsp;- Trust and real ownership&amp;nbsp;- Opportunity to shape the future of AI&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal Opportunity Statement:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nebius is an equal opportunity employer. We are committed to fostering an inclusive and diverse workplace and to providing equal employment opportunities in all aspects of employment. We do not discriminate on the basis of race, color, religion, sex (including pregnancy), national origin, ancestry, age, disability, genetic information, marital status, veteran status, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, or any other characteristic protected by applicable law.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Applicants must be authorized to work in the country in which they apply and will be required to provide proof of employment eligibility as a condition of hire.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you need accommodations during the application process, please let us know.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;blockquote&gt;Bouw aan mission-critical technologie op grote schaal&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Bij Schuberg Philis zijn we gespecialiseerd in het leveren van mission-critical IT-oplossingen die de bedrijfsvoering van onze klanten ondersteunen, met betrouwbaarheid en uitmuntendheid in elke laag. Onze toewijding aan kwaliteit en innovatie drijft ons om op zoek te gaan naar een Senior Devops engineerr met een passie voor het bouwen van robuuste en efficiënte systemen die essentieel zijn voor het succes van onze klanten. Door deel uit te maken van ons team speel je een rol in het vormgeven van de toekomst van kritieke digitale infrastructuren, waarbij je gebruikmaakt van de geavanceerde mogelijkheden om complexe uitdagingen op te lossen en grenzen te verleggen in veeleisende omgevingen.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;De opdracht:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;Je wordt technisch verantwoordelijk voor de end-to-end software release pipeline voor een platform dat uiteindelijk softwaredistributie naar circa 8 miljoen devices ondersteunt.&lt;br&gt;De omgeving is nog volop in ontwikkeling. Je krijgt daarom veel verantwoordelijkheid voor het ontwerpen, bouwen en professionaliseren van de release-, test- en deploymentketen.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Belangrijkste verantwoordelijkheden:&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;margin: 4px 0; padding: 0; color: #1d1c1d;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin: 4px 0 4px 24px; padding: 0;&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin: 2px 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(29, 28, 29);&quot;&gt;Ontwerpen en operationaliseren van een end-to-end release-, test- en deploymentketen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin: 2px 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(29, 28, 29);&quot;&gt;Ontwerpen en verbeteren van GitHub Actions Workflows voor build, test, validatie, gates en gecontroleerde releases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin: 2px 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(29, 28, 29);&quot;&gt;Inrichten en professionaliseren van de AWS-omgeving, CI/CD en repositorystructuur.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin: 2px 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(29, 28, 29);&quot;&gt;Borgen van software supply-chain security, waaronder SBOM, signing, vulnerability scanning en traceerbaarheid.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin: 2px 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(29, 28, 29);&quot;&gt;Architectuur vertalen naar concrete technische ontwerpen en werkpakketten.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin: 2px 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(29, 28, 29);&quot;&gt;Integraties realiseren met testomgevingen, repositories en PKI/key management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin: 2px 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(29, 28, 29);&quot;&gt;Samenbrengen van engineering, security, testing, operations en externe leveranciers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;margin: 4px 0; padding: 0; color: #1d1c1d;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Gewenste ervaring:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;margin: 4px 0; padding: 0; color: #1d1c1d;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;We zoeken een hands-on senior engineer/technical lead met sterke ervaring in:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin: 4px 0 4px 24px; padding: 0;&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin: 2px 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(29, 28, 29);&quot;&gt;AWS&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin: 2px 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(29, 28, 29);&quot;&gt;GitHub &amp;amp; GitHub Actions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin: 2px 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(29, 28, 29);&quot;&gt;CI/CD en Infrastructure as Code&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin: 2px 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(29, 28, 29);&quot;&gt;Linux en runners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin: 2px 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(29, 28, 29);&quot;&gt;Release- en deployment automation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin: 2px 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(29, 28, 29);&quot;&gt;Artifact- en containerrepositories, bijvoorbeeld Sonatype Nexus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin: 2px 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(29, 28, 29);&quot;&gt;Software supply-chain security&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin: 2px 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(29, 28, 29);&quot;&gt;Technische architectuur en platform engineering&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin: 2px 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(29, 28, 29);&quot;&gt;Technische aansturing van engineers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;margin: 4px 0; padding: 0; color: #1d1c1d;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;Ervaring met PKI, KMS/HSM, containers, embedded software, Yocto, OTA-updates, IoT/device management of hardware-in-the-loop testing is een sterke pré.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Everyone we work with and consider working with has a right to equal treatment. The hiring and appraisal process at Schuberg Philis is designed to be thorough and equitable, implementing fair payment, benefits, and opportunities across all demographics.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;It is our desire to be a company that brings together multiple nationalities, cultures, religions, genders, abilities, and talents within and across our teams. We welcome colleagues from diverse backgrounds to join Schuberg Philis and actively support diversity and inclusion in the tech industry.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl">Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Brief info about Vinted&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Our mission is to make second-hand the first choice, and we&#39;re looking for people who want to help us get there. Every day, we work together to help our members buy and sell pre-loved clothing and lifestyle items, giving each piece a second life – or even a third. &lt;br&gt;The Vinted Group is made up of three business units that support this mission:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.vinted.com/marketplace&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Vinted Marketplace&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; is Europe’s leading platform for second-hand fashion and a go-to destination for all kinds of pre-loved items, with a growing range of categories. Our platform connects millions of members across 20+ markets, helping great items find a new life.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.vinted.com/vintedgo&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vinted Go&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; enhances the shipping experience with a vast network of over 500,000 pick-up and drop-off points, partnering with more than 60 carriers across Europe, with added services like item verification for peace of mind on high-value pieces.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.vinted.com/vintedpay&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vinted Pay&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; is the newest part of the Vinted Group, dedicated to bringing secure, reliable payments to buyers and sellers across Europe. Seamlessly integrated into the Vinted app, it helps keep every transaction safe, efficient, and easy for our members.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Founded in 2008 in Lithuania, Vinted began as a way for friends to find new homes for clothes they no longer needed. In 2019, we became Lithuania&#39;s first unicorn! Today, our headquarters remain in Vilnius, and we&#39;ve grown with offices across Europe, supported by a team of over 2,000 people.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Information about the position&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;IMPORTANT - this role is initially offered as a 24-month fixed-term contract, with the possibility of an extension depending on business needs.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We see design as a crucial element of achieving our mission, so designers are represented at all levels, including senior leadership. As our new Senior Product Designer, you will be empowered to concentrate on design solutions for people’s needs. The design organisation is well established and our impact is highly valued. That means you will be able to fully focus on your contribution to our success.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for an experienced Senior Product Designer to join our Security domain. The team works to keep Vinted safe and trusted without compromising the member experience. This work goes beyond preventing fraud and abuse: you’ll also shape a new, high-impact member-facing experience that broadens how people can safely access and use Vinted.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Product Designer in Security, you’ll own complex, ambiguous product problems from discovery through delivery, turning questions around trust, access, and protection into intuitive, accessible, and easy-to-use solutions. You’ll collaborate closely with product managers, engineers, researchers, data analysts, content designers, and other designers, balancing strong safeguards with clarity and ease for millions of members.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In this position, you’ll&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with cross-functional partners to be the voice of our members, define problems and goals, map flows, prototype interactions, and support the development process.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own complex product work end to end, from framing the right problem and defining the experience architecture through prototyping, implementation, launch, and iteration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use AI-assisted building tools to turn ideas into working experiences, test assumptions early, and accelerate delivery, while critically assessing their output and knowing when human judgement is essential.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner up with other domain designers to work on initiatives that keep raising design quality and user-centeredness maturity.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct usability tests to assess and validate design ideas and collaborate with User Researchers on discovery and generative studies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Give and solicit feedback from designers and cross-functional partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be part of our Security domain and report to the Product Design Director.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About you&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong proven experience (typically 5+ years) designing complex web or native mobile products and taking them from ambiguous problem spaces through implementation, launch, and measurable outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interaction design, visual design and evaluative user research skills.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good at working with complex systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills, including excellent written and spoken English.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good understanding of the design process, designing with qualitative and quantitative insights.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong collaborator with cross-functional peers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience using AI-assisted prototyping or building tools to create, test, and ship working product experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A portfolio demonstrating strategic impact, complex problem-solving, and proof of shipping, including your personal contribution, delivery trade-offs, collaboration through implementation, and what changed after launch.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience contributing code-based prototypes or pull requests within an engineering workflow is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Only applications that include a portfolio will be considered.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work perks&amp;nbsp; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The opportunity to benefit from our share options programme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;30 days of paid annual leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Newest MacBook models&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confidential Employee Assistance Program (EAP) for you and your family&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Home office support: we provide IT workstation equipment and a personal budget of up to €540 for home workplace furniture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lunch benefit per your workday&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Frequent team-building events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A personal monthly budget for shopping on Vinted&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to a discounted gym membership plan&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pension Plan with Vinted matching 150% of your chosen contribution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Supplemental Private Health Insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Life and Disability insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A subsidised Deutschlandticket for your commute to the office by public transport&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A dog-friendly office&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Working at Vinted&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Workation policy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Better balance holidays with workdays by working remotely! Up to 90 days per year in the EU, of these, 21 days can be spent globally. For non-EU citizens, it&#39;s 21 days worldwide. This can be combined with time off for vacation or personal time.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Individual learning budget&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Each year, you’ll be given a learning budget (starting at €3,000), and a total of up to 10 working days over a 2-year period to support your personal and professional development.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hybrid work&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our hybrid model, with 2 recommended office days a week, gives you and your team the flexibility to decide if and when you want to work from home, and when to catch up in person.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We welcome applications from everybody, regardless of your background, identity, or life experiences. Job openings come with guides, not checklists. If you’re excited about a role, but don’t identify with every point in the ‘About you’ section, apply anyway – you might still be the perfect match!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;The annual gross salary range for this position is:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€86.300&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€116.700 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Staffbase&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We inspire people to achieve great things together. Our mission is to help organizations unlock the power of inspirational communication with the first &lt;strong&gt;AI-native Employee Experience Platform&lt;/strong&gt;. Our&lt;strong&gt; industry-leading and award-winning agentic AI communications channels&lt;/strong&gt; - intranet, employee app and email solutions - create engaging experiences that connect and empower employees.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Headquartered in Chemnitz, Germany and New York City, with offices in Berlin, London, Sydney, Tokyo, Prague, and Minneapolis–St. Paul, our diverse team of 550+ employees supports 1,500+ customers—reaching over 14 million employees—in transforming their employee experience.&lt;br&gt;We are proud to be a&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Unicorn&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;company—privately valued at over $1 billion—demonstrating strong growth, innovation, and lasting impact in our industry. Together, we’re shaping the future of workplace communication.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;We&#39;re looking for a Fullstack Engineer to join our Actions team in building the core infrastructure that powers our plugin platform. You&#39;ll create the UI components, integration layers, and security mechanisms that enable our customers to extend the platform with custom integrations while maintaining safety and flexibility across our 1,500+ customer base. This is essential infrastructure work that shapes how our customers scale their integrations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our environment&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Working with skilled and like-minded professionals in a team that values diversity and inclusivity&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;We aim to create a flexible and agile work environment that promotes the well-being and work-life balance of our employees&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;We believe that team events during working hours play a vital role in building an exceptionally effective team, and we encourage them&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;We are enthusiastic about technology and committed to using it to improve the world&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;We follow the “You build it, you run it” approach and take pride in it&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;The Actions team sits at the heart of Staffbase&#39;s AI ambitions. We&#39;re the team that gives Navigator — our AI assistant and the main entry point into Staffbase — the ability to actually do things: submit a form, complete a task inside an integration, or take an action on a user&#39;s behalf through the agent. If Navigator is the brain, we build the hands.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;That means two big things. First, we enrich what the AI can see and act on, our plugins, our widgets and the wider Staffbase platform so the assistant can do real work, not just talk about it. Second, we build the extensions that connect to the tools people already use, like Workday, Personio, ServiceNow and Microsoft.   We&#39;re not just shipping features, though. A core part of our mission is building the extensibility framework that lets others build too.  &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll be doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Building a UI component library that generated apps can assemble from, turning components like payslip views and approval flows into maintained, reusable pieces instead of regenerated artifacts&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Creating the connection layer between generated apps and customer source systems—HR platforms, time-tracking and scheduling systems, and a long tail of vendors with thin or undocumented APIs&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Defining extension points (widgets, menus, sidebars) so plugins declare where they surface and what they connect to in a single, clean configuration&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Designing and implementing a cross-integration authentication solution that lets customers run multiple integrations without forcing employees to log in repeatedly&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Shipping plugins on the platform yourself, staying a consumer of what we build so we catch gaps early&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you need to be successful&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Strong knowledge of React and TypeScript for frontend work, Kotlin or Go and TypeScript experience for backend services&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Real experience integrating third-party APIs, especially the challenging ones—inconsistent auth, partial documentation, legacy and on-prem systems&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Deep understanding of multi-tenancy security and data isolation; you care about scope checks and preventing cross-tenant leaks&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Good judgment about what to standardize and what to leave flexible—drawing that line in the right place is central to this role&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to have experience &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;You are comfortable with edge and serverless runtimes like Cloudflare Workers&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;You have built a plugin system, SDK, or developer platform before&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Developed a design system or component library that other teams depended on&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Real-world experience with OAuth and enterprise SSO&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Experience treating AI code generation as a product surface, not just a personal tool&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll get&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Competitive Compensation&lt;/em&gt; - we offer attractive salary packages including LTIP (unit-based Long Term Incentive Plan)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Flexibility &lt;/em&gt;- we offer flexible working time models and the option of hybrid work, and support this with a yearly flex work allowance of €1560&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Recharge&lt;/em&gt; - with 31 vacation days annually (incl. one floating holiday), plus pro rata fully paid Fridays off during August&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Support&lt;/em&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;-&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;we offer offering a company pension scheme&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Volunteers Day&lt;/em&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;- you’ll get one day off per year for supporting a social project&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://imgur.com/a/kIbq0q5&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;max-width: 100%;&quot;&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Firmus Technologies&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;FIR Body&quot; data-ccp-parastyle-defn=&quot;{&amp;quot;ObjectId&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;baa2b379-a6d3-56f4-af2b-6a08de9434e5|1&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;ClassId&amp;quot;:1073872969,&amp;quot;Properties&amp;quot;:[469777841,&amp;quot;Aeonik&amp;quot;,469777842,&amp;quot;Aeonik&amp;quot;,469777843,&amp;quot;Aeonik&amp;quot;,469777844,&amp;quot;Aeonik&amp;quot;,469769226,&amp;quot;Aeonik&amp;quot;,201342446,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,201342447,&amp;quot;5&amp;quot;,201342448,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,201342449,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,201341986,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,268442635,&amp;quot;20&amp;quot;,335551500,&amp;quot;197122&amp;quot;,335559740,&amp;quot;264&amp;quot;,201341983,&amp;quot;0&amp;quot;,335559738,&amp;quot;145&amp;quot;,469775450,&amp;quot;FIR Body&amp;quot;,201340122,&amp;quot;2&amp;quot;,134234082,&amp;quot;true&amp;quot;,134233614,&amp;quot;true&amp;quot;,469778129,&amp;quot;FIRBody&amp;quot;,335572020,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,469778324,&amp;quot;Body Text&amp;quot;]}&quot;&gt;Firmus Technologies is a global&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;FIR Body&quot;&gt;leader&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;FIR Body&quot;&gt; pioneering the development &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;FIR Body&quot;&gt;and operation of efficient AI infrastructure across Asia Pacific.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;FIR Body&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:145,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:264}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;FIR Body&quot;&gt;Founded in Australia in 2019, our mission is to create the most efficient AI infrastructure by &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;FIR Body&quot;&gt;combining&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;FIR Body&quot;&gt;cutting-edge&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;FIR Body&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;technology with a steadfast commitment to sustainability.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:145,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:264}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;FIR Body&quot;&gt;At Firmus, we are unique in our approach. We design, build, and&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;FIR Body&quot;&gt;operate&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;FIR Body&quot;&gt; a new class of digital &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;FIR Body&quot;&gt;infrastructure – the AI Factory. Through our model-to-grid technology approach, we have pushed &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;FIR Body&quot;&gt;the boundaries of multi-generational liquid cooling systems, energy management, AI software &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;FIR Body&quot;&gt;orchestration, and construction. For our customers, this approach allows us to make every watt &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;FIR Body&quot;&gt;count and deliver low-cost AI tokens globally.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:145,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:264}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Firmus AI Cloud&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;FIR Body&quot; data-ccp-parastyle-defn=&quot;{&amp;quot;ObjectId&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;baa2b379-a6d3-56f4-af2b-6a08de9434e5|1&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;ClassId&amp;quot;:1073872969,&amp;quot;Properties&amp;quot;:[469777841,&amp;quot;Aeonik&amp;quot;,469777842,&amp;quot;Aeonik&amp;quot;,469777843,&amp;quot;Aeonik&amp;quot;,469777844,&amp;quot;Aeonik&amp;quot;,469769226,&amp;quot;Aeonik&amp;quot;,201342446,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,201342447,&amp;quot;5&amp;quot;,201342448,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,201342449,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,201341986,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,268442635,&amp;quot;20&amp;quot;,335551500,&amp;quot;197122&amp;quot;,335559740,&amp;quot;264&amp;quot;,201341983,&amp;quot;0&amp;quot;,335559738,&amp;quot;145&amp;quot;,469775450,&amp;quot;FIR Body&amp;quot;,201340122,&amp;quot;2&amp;quot;,134234082,&amp;quot;true&amp;quot;,134233614,&amp;quot;true&amp;quot;,469778129,&amp;quot;FIRBody&amp;quot;,335572020,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,469778324,&amp;quot;Body Text&amp;quot;]}&quot;&gt;Our large-scale GPU cloud platform, Firmus AI Cloud, is purpose-built &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;FIR Body&quot;&gt;to deliver energy-efficient AI&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;FIR Body&quot;&gt;compute&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;FIR Body&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;at scale to customers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:145,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:264}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;FIR Body&quot;&gt;It empowers developers, enterprises, educational institutions, and government users to train and &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;FIR Body&quot;&gt;deploy AI models with unmatched efficiency and cost savings. With an ever-growing suite of services &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;FIR Body&quot;&gt;and applications, we are committed to delivering a cloud experience that is market-leading, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;FIR Body&quot;&gt;proprietary, and built to scale.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:145,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:264}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body Text&quot;&gt;AI FactoryOS Operations&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:145,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:264}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;normaltextrun&quot; data-ccp-charstyle-defn=&quot;{&amp;quot;ObjectId&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;ac0262f4-8a9e-5820-b908-2d943c5f7113|1&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;ClassId&amp;quot;:1073872969,&amp;quot;Properties&amp;quot;:[201342446,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,201342447,&amp;quot;5&amp;quot;,201342448,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,201342449,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,469777841,&amp;quot;Calibri&amp;quot;,469777842,&amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,469777843,&amp;quot;Calibri&amp;quot;,469777844,&amp;quot;Calibri&amp;quot;,201341986,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,469769226,&amp;quot;Calibri,Arial&amp;quot;,268442635,&amp;quot;22&amp;quot;,469775450,&amp;quot;normaltextrun&amp;quot;,201340122,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,134233614,&amp;quot;true&amp;quot;,469778129,&amp;quot;normaltextrun&amp;quot;,335572020,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,469778324,&amp;quot;Default Paragraph Font&amp;quot;]}&quot;&gt;AI FactoryOS is Firmus&#39; proprietary operating system for the AI Factory. It governs GPU telemetry, cooling, power and grid interaction as one integrated layer, so that every Firmus site can be optimised and monitored as a single system.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:true}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;AI FactoryOS Operations runs that platform in production and owns the 24/7 reliability of AI FactoryOS, Firmus AI Cloud and the platforms built on them, together with the service levels the estate is measured against.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;The remit is an engineering one. The function builds the guarded automation, remediation and operational tooling that turn manual response into a software-defined capability, and builds and operates the shared services the estate&#39;s own operation depends on. The function works closely with the engineering teams that build the platform, supplying the production evidence that shapes what they fix and what they build next.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body Text&quot;&gt;Role Summary&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;335557856&amp;quot;:16777215,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
