&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;5222&quot; data-local-id=&quot;2ee441a3b102&quot;&gt;Degree in Computer Science or a related software engineering field, or equivalent practical experience preferred. 2+ years of experience preferred.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;5373&quot; data-local-id=&quot;b931735310c6&quot;&gt;Experience writing distributed, highly scalable, and available backend systems &amp;amp; APIs using Java, Python, or similar programming languages.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
