&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A &lt;strong&gt;structured, high-performing and supportive work environment&lt;/strong&gt; that combines high standards with a collaborative culture.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A &lt;strong&gt;purpose-driven company&lt;/strong&gt;, proudly &lt;strong&gt;B Corp certified&lt;/strong&gt;, committed to making a positive impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
