&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. With exceptional talent, trusted data and intelligence, and world-class partnerships – all united by our pioneering agentic marketing platform, WPP Open – we help clients navigate change, capture opportunity, and deliver transformational growth. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is WPP&#39;s AI-driven media operating unit, bringing together media, data, and partnerships to deliver creative personalisation at scale. Connected through WPP Open and powered by Open Intelligence, clients see exactly where, how, and why their media investment is working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;wppmedia.com&quot;&gt;wppmedia.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;4076 - Senior Manager, Global Resource Management – GOC (Parental Leave Cover)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Summary and Impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Senior Manager, Global Resource Management will play a key role in supporting the effective planning, deployment and utilisation of talent across the Global Operations Centres (GOCs).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The role will have responsibility for the &lt;strong&gt;day-to-day Resource Management of selected GOC Global clients&lt;/strong&gt;, while also leading key RM activities including &lt;strong&gt;utilisation reviews, balanced team management, bench governance and cross-GOC RM projects&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Working closely with Capacity Planners, Staffing Strategists, Talent Acquisition, HR and market teams, the Senior Manager will help ensure client demand is effectively resourced, workforce risks are proactively identified, and RM processes are consistently managed across the GOCs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The role will act as a key operational partner to the GOC RM Lead, taking ownership of defined areas and escalating strategic, commercial or significant workforce decisions where required.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt; Global Client Resource Management&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own Resource Management for selected strategic global clients using GOC talent.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support new global client opportunities and transitions, translating demand into clear resource requirements and staffing plans.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate staffing requirements across multiple GOC locations and disciplines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with Capacity Planning and Staffing teams to identify appropriate resources and drive open requirements through to fulfilment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain oversight of the client&#39;s GOC workforce, including open roles, upcoming demand, resource movements, backfills and capacity risks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish an effective RM cadence with relevant client and market stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively identify resource issues and drive actions to resolution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Escalate significant commercial, capacity or stakeholder risks to the GOC RM Lead.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Utilisation &amp;amp; Workforce Optimisation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate regular utilisation reviews across GOC teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify under-utilisation, over-utilisation and available capacity and work with relevant teams to agree appropriate actions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor utilisation trends and highlight emerging risks or opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure actions from utilisation reviews are tracked through to completion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support proactive redeployment of available talent against suitable client demand.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide concise utilisation insights and exception reporting to the GOC RM Lead.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt; Balanced Teams&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support regular reviews of team structures across GOC clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify opportunities to improve team balance, workload distribution and appropriate management oversight.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with RM, client and operational teams to address identified team structure or workload issues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor agreed actions and ensure they are followed through.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highlight structural workforce issues requiring longer-term intervention.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt; Bench Management &amp;amp; Redeployment&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the ongoing coordination and governance of GOC bench activity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the rollout of the existing bench framework across additional GOC locations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain visibility of available resources and actively connect relevant skills and capacity with upcoming client requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate appropriate bench project opportunities where immediate billable deployment is not available.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track bench movements and provide visibility of key risks, ageing cases and redeployment opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with relevant GOC stakeholders to ensure consistent adoption of the bench process.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt; Resource Planning &amp;amp; Operational Support&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide support on complex staffing requirements that require coordination across multiple markets, clients, disciplines or GOCs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist Capacity Planners and Staffing teams with more complex resource challenges.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor key staffing risks, blockers and ageing requirements and help drive them towards resolution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate with Finance, Talent Acquisition, HR and other functions where additional support is required to fulfil resource needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support workforce and capacity planning activities by ensuring emerging demand and supply risks are visible.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt; RM Projects &amp;amp; Continuous Improvement&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and deliver selected Resource Management projects and improvement initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the rollout of consistent RM practices across GOC locations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify opportunities to simplify manual RM processes and improve ways of working.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support improvements to RM reporting, dashboards and workforce visibility.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead agreed workstreams such as:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bench management rollout&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Balanced Teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Utilisation governance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;RM reporting and dashboards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Process standardisation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Skills and capability visibility&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills &amp;amp; Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The successful candidate will ideally have:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in Resource Management, People Operations, or a related area is desirable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;This is a hands-on role that requires someone who is motivated to make an impact, not simply tick boxes; it requires initiative, ownership and an appetite for challenge.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication, proactive, organisation and influencing skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing resource requirements across multiple clients, teams or geographies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good understanding of utilisation, capacity management and workforce deployment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical skills with the ability to convert workforce data into practical actions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong stakeholder-management skills and confidence working with senior stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to manage multiple priorities and drive actions to completion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience delivering cross-functional projects or process improvements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong problem-solving skills with a practical, solutions-focused approach.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to operate independently while recognising when issues require senior escalation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Success Looks Like&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Senior Manager will be successful when:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Selected global clients have clear, proactive RM ownership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Complex staffing requirements are driven to resolution without requiring continuous intervention from the GOC RM Lead.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Utilisation and balanced-team reviews result in &lt;strong&gt;clear actions and follow-through&lt;/strong&gt;, rather than simply reporting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bench capacity is visible and actively managed across GOCs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;RM initiatives are delivered consistently across locations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Capacity Planning and Staffing teams have an effective senior operational escalation point.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Major workforce risks are identified early and escalated with clear recommendations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Life at WPP Media &amp;amp; Benefits&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Our passion for shaping the next era of media is powered by our commitment to&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Be Extraordinary, investing in our employees to inspire transformational creativity. We also&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Lead Optimistically, firmly believing in and&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Championing Growth and Development&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;for every individual. This commitment allows WPP Media employees to leverage the extensive global WPP Media &amp;amp; WPP networks to pursue their passions, build vital professional connections, and learn at the cutting edge of marketing and advertising.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;We&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Create an Open environment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;built on trust and respect, where everyone feels they belong and has opportunities to progress. This inclusive culture is fostered through a variety of employee resource groups and frequent in-office events showcasing team wins, sharing thought leadership, and celebrating holidays and milestone events. Our comprehensive benefits package reflects this commitment, including competitive medical, group retirement plans, vision, and dental insurance, significant paid time off, preferential partner discounts, and employee mental health awareness days.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;WPP Media is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to characteristics. We believe the best work happens when we&#39;re together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection in this open and supportive environment. That&#39;s why we’ve adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office around four days a week. If you require accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;  Please note that while our philosophy is the same across WPP, benefits may vary by office/country.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Please note this is a UK based role and requires individuals to have the right to work in this location&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Please read our Privacy Notice (&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Hyperlink&quot;&gt;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Hyperlink&quot;&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;While we appreciate all applications received, only those candidates selected for an interview will be contacted.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;#LI-Promoted&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;Please read our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy#:~:text=WPP%20Media%20Privacy%20Notice%20for%20Recruitment&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. With exceptional talent, trusted data and intelligence, and world-class partnerships – all united by our pioneering agentic marketing platform, WPP Open – we help clients navigate change, capture opportunity, and deliver transformational growth. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is WPP&#39;s AI-driven media operating unit, bringing together media, data, and partnerships to deliver creative personalisation at scale. Connected through WPP Open and powered by Open Intelligence, clients see exactly where, how, and why their media investment is working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;wppmedia.com&quot;&gt;wppmedia.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;2931 - Associate Director, Activation &amp;amp; Delivery, GCS&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Summary and Impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a Search &amp;amp; Ecommerce Account Director to lead the strategic development, execution, and performance of integrated biddable activity across &lt;strong&gt;Google Ads (Search, Shopping, Performance Max)&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;Amazon Search&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a senior leader within the team, you will be responsible for &lt;strong&gt;defining and delivering best-in-class search and ecommerce strategies&lt;/strong&gt;, ensuring alignment with broader client business goals and full-funnel media objectives.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will act as the &lt;strong&gt;senior client contact&lt;/strong&gt;, working with stakeholders at Director level and above, while leading cross-functional teams and offshore delivery hubs to execute against strategy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role combines &lt;strong&gt;deep platform expertise, strategic leadership, and operational oversight&lt;/strong&gt;, ensuring campaigns are executed to the highest standard while continuously driving innovation and growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Leadership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the development of holistic Search &amp;amp; Ecommerce strategies across:
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Google Ads (Search, Shopping, Performance Max)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Amazon Search (Sponsored Ads ecosystem)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure strategies are aligned to client business objectives, KPIs, and commercial priorities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate broader marketing strategy into channel-specific activation frameworks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify growth opportunities across demand capture (Search) and retail media (Amazon)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive integration between Search, Ecommerce, and wider media channels (Paid Social, Programmatic, SEO)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop forward-thinking POVs on industry trends, platform developments, and emerging opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Client and Stakeholder Management&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the primary senior contact for Search &amp;amp; Ecommerce across your client portfolio&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build strong relationships with senior stakeholders, becoming a trusted strategic advisor&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead client meetings, presentations, quarterly reviews, and strategic planning sessions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clearly articulate performance, insights, and forward strategy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify opportunities to grow client investment and expand scope&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Performance and Campaign&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain ultimate accountability for performance delivery across all Search &amp;amp; Ecommerce activity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee campaign execution across Google Ads and Amazon platforms, ensuring alignment with strategy
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure robust optimisation frameworks are in place across:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bidding &amp;amp; automation (e.g., Smart Bidding, PMAX optimisation)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Feed optimisation (Shopping / Amazon)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Query, audience, and keyword strategies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead performance reviews, identifying risks and opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure rigorous testing frameworks are defined and executed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure all campaigns are delivered &lt;strong&gt;on time, within budget, and to the highest standards&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain strong governance across:
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;QA processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Financial management and invoicing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Platform best practice adherence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive improvements in workflows, automation, and efficiency&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure clear documentation of processes and ways of working&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead development of &lt;strong&gt;test &amp;amp; learn roadmaps&lt;/strong&gt; across Search and Ecommerce&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify opportunities to leverage new platform capabilities (e.g., PMAX, AI bidding, Amazon innovations)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to agency thought leadership, case studies, and award submissions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Actively participate in the wider Search and Commerce communities within WPP Media&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Onshore–Offshore Delivery Model&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and manage ways of working between onshore strategy teams and offshore execution teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure offshore teams are set up for success with:
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear briefs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Defined processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;QA frameworks and performance standards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee output quality across offshore Account Managers and Executives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive scalability, efficiency, and operational excellence across delivery&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and develop a team of Account Managers and Account Executives (onshore and offshore)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide coaching, mentorship, and performance management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure effective workload allocation, prioritisation, and delivery&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support hiring and team growth aligned to client needs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Foster a high-performing, collaborative, and innovative team culture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Skills &amp;amp; Experience:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive experience across:
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Google Ads (Search, Shopping, Performance Max)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Amazon Search / Retail Media ecosystems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of leading performance-driven search and ecommerce strategies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of full-funnel media strategy and cross-channel integration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced analytical skills with ability to translate data into actionable insights&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing large-scale, complex accounts and budgets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong client leadership experience, including senior stakeholder management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing and developing multi-layered teams (including offshore models)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of bidding strategies, feed-based media, automation, and measurement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication and presentation skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Life at WPP Media &amp;amp; Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our passion for shaping the next era of media includes investing in our employees to help them do their best work, and we&#39;re just as committed to employee growth as we are to responsible media investment. WPP Media employees can tap into the global WPP Media &amp;amp; WPP networks to pursue their passions, grow their networks, and learn at the cutting edge of marketing and advertising. We have a variety of employee resource groups and host frequent in-office events showcasing team wins, sharing thought leadership, and celebrating holidays and milestone events. Our benefits include competitive medical, group retirement plans, vision, and dental insurance, significant paid time off, preferential partner discounts, and employee mental health awareness days.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to particular characteristics. We are committed to fostering a culture of respect in which everyone feels they belong and has the same opportunities to progress in their careers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe the best work happens when we&#39;re together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection. That&#39;s why we&#39;ve adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office around four days a week. If you require accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please note this is a UK based role and requires individuals to have the right to work in this location&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please read our Privacy Notice (https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy) for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Promoted&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;Please read our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy#:~:text=WPP%20Media%20Privacy%20Notice%20for%20Recruitment&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Forward Deployed AI Engineer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;DEPT® is a Growth Invention company built to help the world’s most ambitious brands grow faster. Operating at the intersection of technology and marketing, our 4,000+ specialists deliver growth invention services across Brand &amp;amp; Media, Experience, Commerce, CRM, and Technology &amp;amp; Data. We’re 50|50 tech and marketing, partner-led, and first to move. Clients include Google, Lufthansa, Meta, eBay, and OpenAI. We have been certified B Corp and Climate Neutral since 2021.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the job&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Global AI Strategy &amp;amp; Solutions defines how DEPT®’s clients respond as AI agents become the primary layer between customers and brands. The Future of the Customer Journey (FCJ) is the team’s flagship offer: it maps how AI systems intermediate customer journeys, diagnoses where a brand’s product reality diverges from what AI systems say about it, and directs investment accordingly. Growth and strategy teams across markets are selling and delivering it now.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a&amp;nbsp;Forward Deployed AI Engineer, you are an embedded builder inside that motion. You will sit with growth and strategy teams, understand the problem in front of them, and answer with working software rather than documentation. You will convert FCJ methodology into agentic components, prototypes, and internal tools, and integrate with infrastructure that lets new prototypes appear in days. When needed, you will work across global client projects on a partially billable basis, making sure the firm-wide strategy is captured and implemented properly rather than reinvented market by market. As components mature, you will collaborate with product and craft teams to keep everything compatible with the long-term platform and hand over cleanly.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be given broad problem statements to help collaborate and solve, not specific product ideas and features to create. We are not looking for someone to lead on devops or CI/CD, this is about having great ideas that are sensitive to our clients’ real challenges, and shipping prototypes and strategic tools rapidly.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your most important collaboration is with the FCJ core team on the global growth strategy: deciding what gets built next, for which market, to unlock which engagement. The toolchain will keep changing underneath you, new models, new vendor products, new technology-partner platforms, and that is the point. This role suits an engineer who learns by shipping and treats every new AI product as something to master in the field.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with the FCJ core team on the global growth strategy, converting methodology into working agentic components, prototypes, and internal tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with growth and strategy teams to understand their problems and provide working solutions at prototype pace.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work across global client projects on a partially billable basis, ensuring the firm-wide FCJ strategy is captured and implemented consistently across markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with product and craft teams where necessary to document integration paths, maintain platform compatibility, and hand over validated components.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with technology partners to evaluate, adopt, and integrate new AI products; maintain an AI-native toolchain and share what works across markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience prototyping and shipping software in any modern backend language (Python, TypeScript, Go, or similar), with the ability to leverage AI tooling to spin up prototype frontends and APIs quickly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building applications across the mainstream LLM model families (Gemini, GPT, Claude), connecting models to enterprise data and tools using patterns such as retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) and skills-based agent systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in working with APIs to connect different services, authentication, data exchange, and integration across platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience developing agentic systems with orchestration frameworks such as LangChain, LangGraph, or equivalent.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AI-native way of working: AI tooling is the default across coding, research, and delivery, with comfort spanning the tools in use across different markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in a forward-deployed, customer engineering, solutions engineering, or applied AI role within an agency, consultancy, or AI company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience presenting working software to non-technical stakeholders, including strategists and clients, and iterating live on their feedback.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of emerging integration standards such as OpenAPI and Model Context Protocol (MCP) for connecting agents to business systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of any of the following: paid media, social platforms, user behaviour, agentic commerce, or generative engine optimisation (GEO).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with evaluation, tracing, and observability for LLM applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated learning mindset: a record of adopting new AI products from technology partners quickly, learning by doing rather than waiting for training.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We Offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A flexible, hybrid working policy (2 days from the office in London).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An excellent salary based on experience and equal pay policies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pension, free private healthcare, mental health support, and company sick pay scheme.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;26 days paid holiday (plus UK Bank Holidays).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help getting you to work with a season ticket loan and cycle to work scheme.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enhanced family friendly policies to support new parents.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Social and Cultural Events, plenty of opportunities to connect with colleagues through organised activities and celebrations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Inspirational Talks, bringing the outside in with regular guest speakers and events.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Learning and Development, supporting your growth with continuous opportunities to learn and advance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Buddy Programme: You will be paired with a ‘Buddy’ to help you through your first weeks’ at DEPT®.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A reputation for doing good. DEPT® has been a Certified &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.deptagency.com/en-gb/insight/dept-is-a-certified-b-corporation/&quot;&gt;B Corp® since 2021&lt;/a&gt; and named ‘Agency of the Year’ at both The Lovies and The Webby Awards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Awesome clients. Whether big or small, local or global — at DEPT® you’ll get the opportunity to work with clients of all sizes and across all industries. And we celebrate all of our successes together!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The opportunity for possibility. We want to enable you to do what you do best and help you develop your skills further with training, development and certifications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Global annual &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.deptagency.com/dept-cares-day-2023/&quot;&gt;DEPT® Cares Month&lt;/a&gt; in which employees come together and donate their skills to support local charities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why DEPT®?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are a Growth Invention company built to help the world’s most ambitious brands grow faster. Operating at the intersection of technology and marketing, we create what is next by pioneering ideas, acting fast, and moving further because standing still just is not in our DNA.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are drawn to people who stay curious, move with intent, and never stop inventing. Our culture runs on three values: better together, relentlessly curious, and get sh*t done. It is how we work, how we grow, and how we make things that matter.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At DEPT®, you will find the freedom to explore, the space to collaborate, and the trust to make a real impact for our clients, for each other, and for the world we are helping to build..&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity, Equity &amp;amp; Inclusion&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At DEPT®, we take pride in creating an inclusive workplace where everyone has an equal opportunity to thrive. We actively seek to recruit, develop, nurture, and retain talented individuals from diverse backgrounds, with varying skills and perspectives.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Not sure you meet all qualifications? Apply, and let us decide! Research shows that women and members of underrepresented groups tend not to apply for jobs when they think they may not meet every requirement, when in fact they do. We believe in giving everyone a fair chance to shine.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We also encourage you to reach out to us and discuss any reasonable adjustments we can make to support you throughout the recruitment process and your time with us.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Want to know more about our dedication to diversity, equity, and inclusion? Check out our efforts&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.deptagency.com/the-good-company/&quot;&gt; here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hi 👋 we’re Genio. We create beautifully simple learning tools that boost knowledge, skills, and confidence.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We’re a SaaS scale up and one of the fastest growing tech companies in the North.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;There’s 90+ of us around the UK with our HQ in Leeds.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Our software is award-winning and used by 100,000s of students at over 1,000 universities &amp;amp; colleges worldwide.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We’re growing so we can achieve our mission to support 1 million students to become better learners by 2030.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🚀 About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Career track:&lt;/strong&gt; IC4&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Unit:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Shared services&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Platform Engineer, you help set the strategy for Genio&#39;s infrastructure end-to-end — from design through to running it in production. You work with squads on feature work to advise/set direction, and ensure reliability, security, and cost efficiency. You drive the design and implementation of best-practice cloud infrastructure, automation frameworks, and tooling that enable scalability, reliability, and efficiency for engineering teams in both business units. Working closely with engineers, testers, and data colleagues, you lead initiatives to enhance platform capabilities, optimise performance, and champion DevOps principles.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Evolving Genio&#39;s cloud infrastructure:&lt;/strong&gt; Architect and optimise cloud infrastructure to ensure scalability, security, and resilience. Shape long-term infrastructure strategy and apply Infrastructure as Code and CI/CD best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Maintaining and improving observability of Genio&#39;s applications:&lt;/strong&gt; Implement comprehensive monitoring, alerting, and distributed tracing capabilities. Champion the adoption of SLOs, SLAs, and SLIs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Leading incidents and post-incident learning:&lt;/strong&gt; Support as an incident lead for PlatformOps, coordinate the response, run blameless post-incident reviews, and track actions to completion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Driving automation of repetitive tasks:&lt;/strong&gt; Develop scalable automation frameworks to streamline engineering workflows and improve efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Raising the technical capability of other teams:&lt;/strong&gt; Act as a technical advisor, provide guidance and upskilling support for platform tooling, and mentor engineers across engineering teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;👥 Meet the team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will report to the &lt;strong&gt;Principal Platform Engineer&lt;/strong&gt; and work most closely with:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Principal Platform Engineer (Operations)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Platform Engineer (Operations)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engineering teams in both business units&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Production Support Engineer (Operations)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Senior Data Engineer (Operations)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;👤About you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Essential:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Systems design and judgement:&lt;/strong&gt; Takes an ambiguous problem, defines options, makes trade-offs explicit, and writes clear design documents.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Programming Skills:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong experience in scripting and programming with Python and/or Bash for automation and tooling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Infrastructure as Code:&lt;/strong&gt; Proficient with Terraform for infrastructure automation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cloud Platforms:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong experience with AWS or Google Cloud.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Kubernetes in production:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience operating, upgrading, networking, and debugging Kubernetes clusters under load.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reliability Engineering &amp;amp; Security:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven ownership of production service reliability (defining SLIs, incident response) and implementing security practices (access control, secrets management, patching, backup/recovery).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus / Nice to have:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI-Assisted Development:&lt;/strong&gt; Comfortable and proficient with AI development tools as part of everyday engineering.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cost Awareness:&lt;/strong&gt; Understanding of infrastructure costs and the ability to build cases for spending changes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaboration &amp;amp; Adaptability:&lt;/strong&gt; Ability to mentor others, foster trust, make pragmatic technology choices, and communicate with &quot;passionate views, loosely held&quot;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;💰Salary and benefits:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;💸£70,000- £76,000 per annum dependent on experience&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🏖️ 33 days annual leave (Inclusive of bank holidays)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🎄 3 gifted days off at Christmas&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;💰 EMI Share Options Scheme&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🎓 Generous individual learning and training allowance&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;⌚ Truly flexible hours to suit when you work best&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;💻 Full home working set up and beautiful collaborative office space&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🚗 Free Leeds City Centre office parking&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌴 Nomad working policy with family travel insurance&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🍼 Enhanced 26 weeks maternity and 4 weeks paternity (fully paid)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🤍 Health cash plan (from glasses to massages)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;💸 6% employer pension contribution&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;📍Location:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our beautiful office space in Leeds is our key hub for collaboration, and we love to get together in person. We operate a flexible hybrid working model, including supporting our Genios who are based remotely across the UK. If you are more than 50 miles away from the office, we offer full remote working support within the UK, with the opportunity to join colleagues for in-person collaboration several times a year.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We will discuss ways of working with you at interview however if you have any questions before you apply please reach out to &lt;a ----------
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;💡 What to expect next:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’ll review your application and provide a response within 1 week. Even if it’s not the news you’d hoped for, we appreciate it’s good to know either way.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If we invite you to meet with us for interview, here’s an overview of what the process will look like:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Screening interview with our Recruitment Business Partner&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A take-home technical test for you to complete offline and submit back to us&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A technical interview with Mark, Staff Platform Engineer and an Engineer from the Platform Operations team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A CV review and Cultural &amp;amp; Values interview with Mark and our Head of Engineering, Mala&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ahead of your interview you will receive a confirmation email outlining who you’ll be meeting and when, anything you’ll need to prepare in advance and any resources we think you might find helpful.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;👀 Interested in learning more about a career at Genio?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Here are a few further resources:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://genio.co/about&quot;&gt;About Genio&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://genio.co/about/careers/life-at-genio&quot;&gt;Life at Genio&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://genio.co/resources/case-studies-and-user-stories&quot;&gt;Case studies and user stories&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;💌 Not quite the right role for you however you’d love to be a part of Genio’s journey?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Let’s connect! Reach out to &lt;a ---------- and we’ll add you to our network, to keep you updated with any future opportunities we think you might be interested in.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;📄 Applicant Privacy Notice&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We think it’s important that you understand how we use and handle your personal information, so here’s a link to our &lt;a href=&quot;https://glean.co/glean-applicant-privacy-notice&quot;&gt;privacy notice.&lt;/a&gt; By submitting your application, you’re confirming that you’ve read and understood this notice.&lt;/p&gt;
