&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Translate complex ambiguity into clear execution plans&lt;/strong&gt;, ensuring the team remains focused on the highest-leverage opportunities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
