&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Ogilvy &amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ogilvy has been creating impact for brands through iconic, culture-changing, value-driving ideas since the company was founded by David Ogilvy more than 75 years ago. It builds on that rich legacy through Borderless Creativity—innovating at the intersection of intelligence, imagination and influence, with experts across advertising, sports &amp;amp; entertainment, PR &amp;amp; social, consulting, and health collaborating seamlessly across more than 120 offices spanning 90 countries. Ogilvy was named &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.ogilvy.com/ideas/ogilvy-brings-home-network-year-2026-cannes-lions-international-festival-creativity&quot;&gt;Network of the Year&lt;/a&gt; at the 2026 Cannes Lions International Festival of Creativity and&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.ogilvy.com/ideas/ogilvy-tops-warc-effective-100-creative-100-4th-straight-year&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;e2c78315-ff05-4544-925f-9288319dea2c&quot;&gt;ranks&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;as the #1 global agency network for creative excellence and effectiveness by WARC for the fourth consecutive year, signifying its ability to deliver creative solutions that drive unreasonable impact for clients and communities. Ogilvy is part of WPP, the trusted growth partner for the world&#39;s leading brands. Powered by exceptional talent and our agentic marketing platform WPP Open, WPP unites cutting-edge media intelligence and data solutions, creativity, production, enterprise solutions and expert strategic counsel.&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.ogilvy.com/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;39833259-880d-4fd8-930f-0d84b1c14850&quot;&gt;Ogilvy.com&lt;/a&gt;, and follow us on&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/ogilvy/&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;735e393e-6e8a-4ca8-804a-74f1bd8166b6&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://twitter.com/ogilvy&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;d10960ce-761b-48c5-81d5-0a7c4cc6013a&quot;&gt;X&lt;/a&gt;,&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/ogilvy/&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;92ffcb70-6ca7-4d9a-88d5-c130e36e6c4f&quot;&gt; Instagram&lt;/a&gt;, and&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.facebook.com/ogilvy/&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;3bd2010d-00a2-401b-8cfb-7e8c24deac52&quot;&gt; Facebook.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. We unite&amp;nbsp;cutting-edge media intelligence and data solutions, world-class creativity, next-generation production, transformative enterprise solutions and expert strategic counsel&amp;nbsp;in a single company –&amp;nbsp;powered by exceptional talent and our agentic marketing platform, WPP Open,&amp;nbsp;to help our clients navigate change, capture opportunity and deliver transformational growth. For more information, visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://wpp.com/&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;7f087527-f491-4cb6-a79d-3b4a67d1ec89&quot;&gt;WPP.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qui sommes-nous ?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nous sommes une agence de publicité, de marketing et de communication.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ogilvy est une des filiales du Groupe WPP, ce qui fait de nous la plus internationale de toutes les agences de communication françaises.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;David Ogilvy, notre fondateur, a un parcours atypique et peu scolaire. Entrepreneur dans l’âme, c’est son travail, son talent et sa vision qui lui ont permis de devenir l’un des plus grands communicants des années 60. Il a, d’ailleurs, beaucoup inspiré la série Mad Men.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Il a fondé la maison Ogilvy en 1948, en plein cœur de New-York avant de se développer aux États-Unis et à l’international.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;En plus d’avoir bâti un empire, il a aussi réussi à transcender notre vision des produits, des marques et notre façon de les raconter.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;70 ans plus tard, nous continuons de transmettre son héritage avec un seul but : « &lt;em&gt;Making brands matter ».&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;TA DREAM TEAM &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🌈&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Au sein de l’équipe Créative et sous la responsabilité du Directeur de Création, &lt;strong&gt;tu travailleras aux côtés de directeurs artistiques et de créatifs confirmés qui t&#39;accompagneront dans ton développement. &lt;/strong&gt;Tu participeras à la conception et à la réalisation de projets créatifs 360°.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nous recherchons avant tout un profil avec une vraie sensibilité artistique, un regard graphique affirmé et une forte appétence pour la création d&#39;images.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;À ce titre, tu auras pour missions :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participer aux réunions de travail : briefs, moodboards, points créa, PPM, présentations clients, etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participer directement au processus de création sur plusieurs projets publicitaires : élaboration de campagnes print, TV, web, déclinaisons graphiques multi-supports, mises en page, identités visuelles, etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Imaginer et développer des concepts visuels et des univers graphiques singuliers sur différents supports : key visuals, outdoor, brand content, social media, etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Explorer, proposer et développer des pistes artistiques, des partis pris graphiques, des références et des territoires iconographiques.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Concevoir et réaliser des visuels en maîtrisant toute la chaîne de création : recherche, composition, génération d&#39;images par IA, retouche et finalisation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expérimenter les nouveaux outils d&#39;intelligence artificielle générative pour repousser les possibilités de création visuelle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Atouts du stage :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Tu travailleras sur une très grande variété de grandes marques françaises et internationales.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Tu seras impliqué(e) dans toutes les étapes de la création, de la recherche artistique à la réalisation des visuels, avec la possibilité d&#39;explorer de nouvelles approches créatives et de nouveaux outils.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WANTED&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;💎&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;De formation supérieure en arts graphiques, direction artistique, design ou beaux-arts, bac +3 à bac +5.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Une vraie fibre artistique, un œil, une sensibilité graphique et une envie de créer des images.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Une solide culture visuelle, artistique, photographique et publicitaire.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Curiosité, ouverture d&#39;esprit.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Envie de challenges et audace créative.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellente maîtrise des logiciels de PAO : Photoshop, Illustrator, InDesign.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Très bonnes bases en création de visuels par IA générative : maîtrise des outils, capacité à orienter les résultats, affiner les images et obtenir un rendu visuel abouti.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bonne maîtrise des techniques de retouche, de composition et de traitement de l&#39;image.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;La maîtrise de l&#39;anglais est un plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Un portfolio présentant tes réalisations est indispensable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nous serons particulièrement attentifs à ton univers graphique, à ton regard et à ta capacité à créer des images.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;NOTRE PROCESS&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🤝🏻&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Un entretien avec le Directeur de Création et/ ou 1 ou 2 membre(s) de l’équipe.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Un catch up call RH : Validation des key points et culture fit&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Un conseil pour tes entretiens : sois toi-même !&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;At Ogilvy, our people are at the heart of what we do: a creative agency that sparks game-changing ideas across culture and business through collaboration, integrity, and a celebration of self-expression.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe in building powerful teams with purpose - and we relentlessly curate transformative initiatives that make our commitment to fairness, and equity a reality.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our ultimate mission is to leave a positive impact on the world, creating a better future for all, while supporting and uplifting the global communities we serve.&amp;nbsp; This is central to our mantra of Borderless Creativity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Ogilvy is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to particular characteristics. We are committed to fostering a culture of respect in which everyone feels they belong and has the same opportunities to progress in their careers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you need any assistance seeking a job opportunity, or if you need reasonable accommodation with the application process, please contact us at ----- Please note that this contact is only for candidates who are requesting accommodation. Emails for other purposes, including application status requests, will not receive a response.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About AlixPartners&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At AlixPartners, we solve the most complex and critical challenges by moving quickly from analysis to action — when it really matters.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We create value that has a lasting impact on companies, their employees and their communities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By understanding, respecting and acknowledging the needs of our employees, clients and communities, AlixPartners actively fosters an inclusive environment. We firmly believe in the value that diversity of experience brings, and we are committed to continuously improving our initiatives, policies and practices. We commit to creating space for authenticity, growth and equality for everyone.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;AlixPartners has adopted a hybrid working model to offer flexibility and support our employees&#39; work-life integration.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role as Strategic Finance Business Partner (France), you can expect a fast-paced, hands-on position in finance, working with the local French Leadership on driving the country’s performance as well as with the wider strategic finance team for the EMEA region.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be a trusted strategic finance partner to the French Country Leader and Managing Director &amp;amp; Partner group, translating financial data into actionable insights and proactively challenging business decisions to support sustainable and profitable growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In supporting the finance function, you will work closely with colleagues in accounting and other Corporate Services functions (HR, Legal, IT, Business Development, etc.) in our fast-moving, rapidly growing company.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ideally, you are an experienced business partner with a strong customer focus and the ability to build and maintain interpersonal relationships. You will work closely with the French leadership team and the wider Managing Director &amp;amp; Partner group and successfully handle demanding financial topics.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You are joining at an exciting time and will help modernize the finance function and support the company&#39;s long-term success. This role plays an important part in our strong growth, and you will have the opportunity to help shape it and build your own finance career at AlixPartners.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Strategic Finance Business Partner – France is a full-time position with hybrid working arrangements, based in our Paris office. The role reports to the EMEA Head of Strategic Finance. Your responsibilities also include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Proactive coordination with the French Country Leader and Managing Director &amp;amp; Partners to provide financial expertise and support, focusing on company growth, improving profitability and strengthening working capital management to reduce DSOs&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Acting as a trusted advisor to senior leadership, offering proactive financial insights, recommendations and constructive challenge on key business and operational decisions&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Preparation and ownership of annual budgets and monthly forecasting processes&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Supporting business planning and capacity planning, including financial analysis to improve resource allocation and profitable revenue growth&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Providing the financial resources needed to ensure strategic business development, client retention and increased client profitability within country, service and industry groups&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Close collaboration with the engagement analyst team to ensure a continuous flow of information on project-related challenges, or specific issues, and to support their resolution and discussion&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Identifying revenue risks arising from significant working capital or engagement challenges and responding appropriately&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Supporting the Managing Director &amp;amp; Partner group on the running of their projects, including pricing, project set-up, WIP and AR management&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Proactively challenging stakeholders on engagement economics, fee structures, profitability and financial risks, and driving appropriate corrective actions&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Preparing the monthly financial management information (MI), including insightful commentary and analysis&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Developing and implementing dashboards, KPIs and regular performance-review routines across clients, engagements and Managing Director &amp;amp; Partners, translating analysis into clear business recommendations&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Monitoring performance against long-term strategic and short-term operational plans and supporting the Country Leader in defining the measures needed to achieve agreed financial targets&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Carrying out ad hoc analyses as needed to maximize profitability in terms of revenue and working capital&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll need&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience in strategic finance, FP&amp;amp;A or finance business partnering with senior stakeholders, ideally in the professional services or consulting sector&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A strong foundation in accounting and financial controlling, combined with relevant professional experience; seniority and scope of experience will be assessed against the role requirements&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Advanced proficiency in MS Office, with a particular focus on Excel and PowerPoint&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication skills&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The ability to stay calm and focused under pressure&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strong analytical and organizational skills with great attention to detail&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Proven ability to influence and constructively challenge experienced stakeholders, including senior business leaders&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strong commercial acumen, with the ability to turn complex financial analyses into practical, actionable recommendations&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A proactive, hands-on, solutions-oriented mindset and the confidence to take ownership of financial performance topics&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A mindset that prioritizes continuous improvement, supporting personal development, colleague development and the optimization of business processes and interactions&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The ability to grasp the big picture while considering company-wide implications&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A collaborative team player who values transparency and takes a straightforward approach&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Knowledge of SAP S/4 HANA Cloud, SAP Analytics Cloud (finance systems) or a similar ERP system for enterprise services is preferred&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The ability to build a comprehensive understanding of the company over time and find new ways to expand value creation for our firm&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In addition to a positive work environment, the company offers a comprehensive compensation package with an excellent performance program. AlixPartners is an equal opportunity employer. All qualified applicants will be considered for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, national origin, age, veteran status or disability.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. With exceptional talent, trusted data and intelligence, and world-class partnerships – all united by our pioneering agentic marketing platform, WPP Open – we help clients navigate change, capture opportunity, and deliver transformational growth. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is WPP&#39;s AI-driven media operating unit, bringing together media, data, and partnerships to deliver creative personalisation at scale. Connected through WPP Open and powered by Open Intelligence, clients see exactly where, how, and why their media investment is working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;wppmedia.com&quot;&gt;wppmedia.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;À propos de WPP Media&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP est le leader mondial des services de communication et de transformation créative pour les plus grandes marques.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media est l&#39;unité opérationnelle média de WPP, réunissant médias, data, technologies et partenariats pour délivrer une personnalisation créative à grande échelle. Connectés via notre plateforme d&#39;IA marketing pionnière &lt;strong&gt;WPP Open&lt;/strong&gt; et alimentés par &lt;strong&gt;Open Intelligence&lt;/strong&gt;, nos collaborateurs permettent aux annonceurs de comprendre avec précision l&#39;impact et la performance de leurs investissements médias.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Pour des raisons de clarté et d&#39;accessibilité, nous avons choisi de ne pas utiliser l&#39;écriture inclusive dans nos communications. WPP Media est fermement engagé en faveur de la diversité : nous valorisons l&#39;inclusion et l&#39;égalité des chances, en considérant l&#39;ensemble des candidatures sans distinction d&#39;identité de genre, d&#39;origine ethnique, de religion ou de handicap.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nos valeurs fondamentales :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Be Extraordinary :&lt;/strong&gt; Cultiver un leadership collectif qui inspire des idées transformatrices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Create an Open environment :&lt;/strong&gt; Créer un équilibre fondé sur la confiance mutuelle, l&#39;écoute et l&#39;épanouissement des équipes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead with Optimism :&lt;/strong&gt; Stimuler activement l&#39;apprentissage et le développement pour faire grandir l&#39;organisation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Le Rôle:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Au sein de l’entité &lt;strong&gt;Data, Tech &amp;amp; Analytics (DTA)&lt;/strong&gt; de WPP Media, vous rejoignez le pôle Consulting, une équipe agile dédiée à l&#39;accélération technologique et à la valorisation de la data au service des stratégies marketing de nos clients.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;En tant que &lt;strong&gt;Manager Data &amp;amp; Tech Consulting&lt;/strong&gt;, vous jouez un rôle pivot à la croisée du conseil stratégique, de l&#39;avant-vente et de l&#39;innovation. Véritable pont entre les enjeux business des annonceurs et l&#39;expertise technique, votre mission est d&#39;écouter, diagnostiquer, vulgariser et prescrire les meilleures solutions data &amp;amp; tech.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Vous intervenez comme un partenaire stratégique de confiance auprès des directeurs marketing clients ainsi que des équipes conseil et expertises médias internes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Vos Missions Principales:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;1. Diagnostic stratégique &amp;amp; Conseil client :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyser les besoins marketing et médias des clients (annonceurs nationaux et internationaux) et identifier leurs opportunités de transformation data (activation, mesure, attribution, qualification d&#39;audience).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduire des diagnostics de maturité data et recommander des feuilles de route adaptées aux objectifs business des marques.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vulgariser des concepts techniques complexes auprès d&#39;interlocuteurs non spécialistes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;2. Avant-vente, Prescription &amp;amp; Développement d&#39;offres :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Détecter proactivement les opportunités de valorisation des expertises DTA auprès des équipes conseil de l&#39;agence et lors de briefs clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Concevoir les propositions de valeur adaptées en piochant dans le catalogue de solutions technologiques WPP (notamment la suite WPP Open et les agents IA) ou en élaborant des offres de conseil sur-mesure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Rédiger les propositions commerciales, cadrer les devis (temps de conseil, outils) et porter la soutenance en clientèle lors de pitchs et de rendez-vous stratégiques.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;3. Coordination transverse &amp;amp; Synergie technique :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assurer la passerelle entre le besoin d&#39;affaires du client et les équipes techniques internes (Data Scientists, ingénieurs et développeurs de l&#39;équipe DTA).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cadrer les projets en phase d&#39;initiation et veiller à ce que les solutions déployées répondent parfaitement aux attentes initiales de l&#39;annonceur.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborer étroitement avec les équipes d&#39;activation média (Search, Social, Display, Programmatique) pour interconnecter la data et la performance de campagne.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Profil Recherché:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Expérience :&lt;/strong&gt; 5 à 8 ans d&#39;expérience dans une fonction de conseil data, de chef de projet digital/martech, de consultant avant-vente ou de stratégie média, idéalement acquise en cabinet de conseil digital, en agence média ou chez un acteur adtech.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Posture Conseil &amp;amp; aisance relationnelle :&lt;/strong&gt; Excellentes capacités d&#39;écoute, de pédagogie et de conviction. Vous savez instaurer une relation de confiance avec des interlocuteurs de niveau Direction et porter un discours commercial à forte valeur ajoutée.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Culture Data &amp;amp; Marketing Digital :&lt;/strong&gt; Très bonne compréhension globale de l&#39;écosystème de la data publicitaire. Vous maîtrisez le vocabulaire sans avoir besoin de manipuler les outils techniques au quotidien.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Esprit de synthèse &amp;amp; présentation :&lt;/strong&gt; Maîtrise avancée de la conception de présentations percutantes pour traduire des problématiques techniques en opportunités business concrètes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Langues :&lt;/strong&gt; Français courant et pratique professionnelle fluide de l&#39;anglais à l&#39;écrit comme à l&#39;oral (échanges réguliers avec nos réseaux internationaux et certains clients paneuropéens).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Avantages &amp;amp; vie chez WPP Media:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cadre de travail :&lt;/strong&gt; Un campus moderne et dynamique à Levallois-Perret, doté d&#39;espaces collaboratifs, d&#39;espaces extérieurs et de services de restauration d&#39;entreprise.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Organisation du travail :&lt;/strong&gt; Politique hybride flexible (jusqu&#39;à 2 jours de télétravail par semaine).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Accès aux technologies de pointe :&lt;/strong&gt; Accès direct et formation aux innovations de pointe du groupe (suite WPP Open, solutions d&#39;IA générative).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Engagement solidaire :&lt;/strong&gt; Possibilité de participer à des missions d&#39;intérêt général via notre programme &lt;em&gt;We care and we act&lt;/em&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Processus de recrutement:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Premier Contact (RH) :&lt;/strong&gt; Échange préliminaire téléphonique ou visio avec l&#39;équipe Talent Acquisition pour faire le point sur votre parcours et vos attentes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Entretien Métier :&lt;/strong&gt; Rencontre approfondie avec le Responsable du pôle Data &amp;amp; Tech Consulting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mise en situation &amp;amp; Entretien Direction :&lt;/strong&gt; Cas pratique axé sur la posture de conseil, la pédagogie et la compréhension business, suivi d&#39;un échange avec la Direction DTA.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Promoted&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;Please read our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy#:~:text=WPP%20Media%20Privacy%20Notice%20for%20Recruitment&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 300; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Samsara (NYSE: IOT) is the pioneer of the Connected Operations™ Cloud, which is a platform that enables organizations that depend on physical operations to harness Internet of Things (IoT) data to develop actionable insights and improve their operations. At Samsara, we are helping improve the safety, efficiency and sustainability of the physical operations that power our global economy. Representing more than 40% of global GDP, these industries are the infrastructure of our planet, including agriculture, construction, field services, transportation, and manufacturing — and we are excited to help digitally transform their operations at scale.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 300; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Working at Samsara means you’ll help define the future of physical operations and be on a team that’s shaping an exciting array of product solutions, including Video-Based Safety, Vehicle Telematics, Apps and Driver Workflows, and Equipment Monitoring. As part of a recently public company, you’ll have the autonomy and support to make an impact as we build for the long term.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an Account Development Representative (ADR) at Samsara, you will be trained — both on the job and through formal programs led by a world-class Sales team — to take on your next role as a closing Account Executive.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;On a daily basis, you will build and work a portfolio of target accounts for our EMEA business in France: researching each account for commercial signal, prioritising which contacts to approach and in what order, and running a connected, multi-touch outbound motion that generates qualified pipeline rather than one-off meetings.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This is a remote position open to candidates based in France and the United Kingdom. This position requires working hours in CET. Relocation assistance will not be provided for this role.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You should apply if:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You want to impact the industries that run our world:&lt;/strong&gt; your efforts will result in real-world impact — helping to keep the lights on, get food into grocery stores, and ensure workers return home safely.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You are the architect of your own career:&lt;/strong&gt; if you put in the work, this role won&#39;t be your last at Samsara. Successful ADRs can see promotion to a closing role in two years or less.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You’re excited by AI:&lt;/strong&gt; you’ll use cutting-edge AI tools every day and sell some of the most advanced AI in the physical operations space.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You think several moves ahead:&lt;/strong&gt; you&#39;d rather build a real relationship across an account than force a single contact to a decision they&#39;re not ready to make.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You have an innate curiosity about how businesses work:&lt;/strong&gt; one day you&#39;ll be researching a transport operator, the next a food distribution centre. Our best reps dig into the businesses they support to make a sharper case for why Samsara matters to them specifically.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You treat rejection as a learning experience:&lt;/strong&gt; in this role you will get hung up on and told no. You need the resilience to prepare, call again, and adjust.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You want to be with the best:&lt;/strong&gt; Samsara&#39;s high-performance Sales culture means you&#39;ll be surrounded by the best and challenged to go further than you have before.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In this role, you will:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Research target accounts before outreach — pulling commercial signal out of public information (financials, news, hiring activity, compliance or safety pressure) to build a specific, defensible point of view on where Samsara adds value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and prioritise an account-level contact plan, identifying who to approach first across a range of stakeholders (e.g. MD, Operations/Transport Manager, Compliance/H&amp;amp;S, Finance) and being able to justify that choice.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run a connected, multi-touch outbound motion across phone, email and LinkedIn — using early conversations to gather information and multi-thread the account, not just to book a meeting at any cost.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write personalised, researched outreach (including cold emails) that carries a specific point of view into every call, rather than working from a generic script.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Read what a contact gives you on the call and adapt in real time — including recognising when the right move is to gather information and position a follow-up with someone else, rather than push for a meeting the contact can&#39;t actually commit to.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Keep meticulous account and contact records in Salesforce.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Become a product expert and represent the Samsara brand at trade shows and events.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum requirements for the role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;1–3 years professional experience, ideally in customer-facing roles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6–12 months&amp;nbsp; experience in a sales or equivalent target driven role&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly motivated and committed, with a strong desire to work in target-driven sales&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of consistently meeting or exceeding targets in previous roles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills, both verbal and written&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Curious, and able to ask insightful questions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A champion of a Growth Mindset&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly proficient in English and fluent in French&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AI literacy and ability to showcase examples of leveraging AI in your work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;An ideal candidate also has:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort turning unstructured information (an annual report, a website, a news article) into a clear commercial argument&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience multi-threading or navigating multiple stakeholders within a single sale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A genuine willingness to prepare — to research and write — before a call, rather than relying on improvising well under pressure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in closing-sales roles or similar target driven environment&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proven track record of achievement beyond work (e.g. academics, sports, charity)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to collaborate and influence in a &quot;win as a team&quot; environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excitement about solving new problems in innovative ways&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Motivation to help build a fast-growing business in the IoT and SaaS space.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ADR pathways&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Through Samsara&#39;s ADR program, there are always opportunities to move to the next level and take on more responsibility. With emphasis on continued professional development, training doesn&#39;t stop after onboarding — we provide opportunities to expand ADRs&#39; understanding of the market and competitors, develop hard skills, and work with mentors to progress through three levels:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ADR I&lt;/strong&gt; — focus on inbound leads: a high volume of conversations, sharing the ins and outs of our products, and fostering relationships with interested prospects. Learning opportunities include call sessions with senior Sales team members, tool training (Salesforce, Salesloft, Lusha), product knowledge, and objection handling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ADR II&lt;/strong&gt; — work on top-of-funnel movement, creating high-quality sales engagements, and supporting Account Executives. Enrolled in specialised training including professional writing, persona-based messaging, cold calling 2.0, and AE collaboration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ADR III&lt;/strong&gt; — work hand-in-hand with field Account Executives and Enterprise Regional Sales Managers. Partner on large accounts, implement territory plans, join weekly strategy meetings, and schedule/attend customer demos, alongside a mentorship program ahead of an AE interview.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Please submit an English CV with your application.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Total Rewards&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Samsara, we build for the people who keep the global economy moving. We want owners, not passengers, which is why &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.samsara.com/company/careers/benefits&quot;&gt;our rewards&lt;/a&gt; are designed to fuel high-impact builders. Our compensation program delivers above-market total compensation through a combination of base salary, performance-based bonus/variable pay, and equity (for eligible roles) in a high-growth public company. We meaningfully differentiate pay for our top performers, who have the opportunity to earn above-market compensation that can outpace the broader market over time.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Beyond compensation, we provide the foundations that enable long-term success: a flexible, employee-led remote model, a professional development stipend, comprehensive health and parental leave plans, and more. If you’re ready to build for the long term and own the outcome, your journey starts here.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flexible Working&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At Samsara, we embrace a flexible working model that caters to the diverse needs of our teams. Our offices are open for those who prefer to work in-person and we also support remote work where it aligns with our operational requirements. For certain positions, being close to one of our offices or within a specific geographic area is important to facilitate collaboration, access to resources, or alignment with our service regions. In these cases, the job description will clearly indicate any working location requirements. Our goal is to ensure that all members of our team can contribute effectively, whether they are working on-site, in a hybrid model, or fully remotely. All offers of employment are contingent upon an individual’s ability to secure and maintain the legal right to work at the company and in the specified work location, if applicable.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Belonging at Samsara&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Samsara, we welcome everyone regardless of their background. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, national origin, sex, gender, gender identity, sexual orientation, protected veteran status, disability, age, and other characteristics protected by law. We depend on the unique approaches of our team members to help us solve complex problems and want to ensure that Samsara is a place where people from all backgrounds can make an impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Accommodations&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Samsara is an inclusive work environment, and we are committed to ensuring equal opportunity in employment for qualified persons with disabilities. Please email &lt;a ---------- or &lt;a href=&quot;https://forms.gle/DrM6DFQUiSgfPtCVA&quot;&gt;click here&lt;/a&gt; if you require any reasonable accommodations throughout the recruiting process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Commitment to Authenticity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We use &lt;a href=&quot;https://hiretofu.com/privacyPolicy&quot;&gt;Tofu&lt;/a&gt;, a fraud detection tool, to validate the authenticity of applications and protect against identity fraud. This ensures we are connecting with real people and allows us to prioritize genuine candidates. Please see Samsara’s &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.samsara.com/legal/candidate-privacy-notice&quot;&gt;Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt; for more information.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fraudulent Employment Offers&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Samsara is aware of scams involving fake job interviews and offers. Please know we do not charge fees to applicants at any stage of the hiring process. Official communication about your application will only come from emails ending in ----- ----- or ----- For more information regarding fraudulent employment offers, please visit our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://samsara.com/blog/avoiding-fake-job-offers&quot;&gt;blog post here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h3 data-section-id=&quot;1l4u08w&quot; data-start=&quot;957&quot; data-end=&quot;977&quot;&gt;About Constructor&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;979&quot; data-end=&quot;1260&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://constructor.org/&quot;&gt;Constructor&lt;/a&gt; is an international ecosystem spanning education, research, and technology. It includes &lt;a href=&quot;https://constructor.university/&quot;&gt;Constructor University Bremen&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a&gt;Constructor Tech&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://constructor.org/knowledge&quot;&gt;Constructor Knowledge&lt;/a&gt;, and partner entities such as EBAC, working together to advance how knowledge is created, taught, and applied.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1262&quot; data-end=&quot;1417&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://constructor.org/knowledge&quot;&gt;Constructor Knowledge&lt;/a&gt; sits at the heart of this ecosystem — connecting students, faculty, partners, media, and industry across our entities and programmes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;About the Role&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for a hands on Senior Marketing Manager to own campaign strategy and execution across our multi channel, multi platform marketing operations. This is not a strategy only or purely managerial role; we need someone who can plan a campaign from scratch, build the tracking and data infrastructure behind it, and execute alongside the team. Strong technical fluency, structured thinking, and a bias toward doing over discussing are essential, along with the confidence to present campaign strategies and budgets to stakeholders and defend them.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Campaign Strategy &amp;amp; Execution&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build multi channel, multi platform campaign and marketing plans from the ground up: audience, budget, channel mix, creative direction&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Execute hands on across performance channels (Google, Meta, LinkedIn, TikTok, etc.), not just oversee execution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run and interpret A/B tests, budget allocation, and continuous optimization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plan and adapt campaigns across international markets, different countries, audiences, and budgets, spanning both B2B and B2C contexts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical &amp;amp; Data Infrastructure&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set up and maintain campaign tracking (pixels, UTMs, attribution) across platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to building data warehouse / reporting infrastructure for campaign and budget analytics across channels&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own reporting dashboards and translate data into clear, actionable recommendations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Creative &amp;amp; Brand&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring a strong eye for design; able to produce basic ad creatives independently, not just brief a designer&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure creative and messaging consistency across campaigns and channels&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Ownership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Propose and take ownership of campaign plans and marketing initiatives with minimal oversight&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with a wide range of requesters and stakeholders: management, design, CRM, website, PR, events, and student recruitment teams, among others&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adapt quickly to shifting priorities typical of a startup or scale up environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Requirements&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years in performance marketing / campaign management, ideally with agency experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated hands on technical skill: platforms management (Google, Meta, LinkedIn, TikTok, etc.), tracking setup, analytics, data infrastructure for campaign reporting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in startups or small, fast-moving teams; comfortable with ambiguity and multitasking&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience running international campaigns across multiple countries/continents simultaneously, and working in a multicultural, cross-country team environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong structured, analytical mindset; execution oriented over purely conceptual&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Basic creative production skills (Canva, CapCut, Figma, or similar)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-driven learner who stays current on marketing technology and industry trends independently.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 data-section-id=&quot;moji85&quot; data-start=&quot;5656&quot; data-end=&quot;5672&quot;&gt;What we offer&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;5674&quot; data-end=&quot;5985&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;s0didp&quot; data-start=&quot;5734&quot; data-end=&quot;5835&quot;&gt;A central role in a growing international ecosystem connecting education, research, and technology.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;17wt33h&quot; data-start=&quot;5836&quot; data-end=&quot;5926&quot;&gt;Direct exposure to senior leadership, world-class academics, and international partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Charles River Associates&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.crai.com/&quot;&gt;Charles River Associates&lt;/a&gt; is a leading global consulting firm that offers economic, financial, and strategic expertise to major law firms, corporations, and governments around the world. Since 1965, CRA experts have combined rigorous cutting-edge research, state-of-the-art methodology, and proven experience to address our clients’ most complex challenges.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;CRA&#39;s &lt;a href=&quot;https://ecp.crai.com/&quot;&gt;European Competition practice&lt;/a&gt; specialises in providing economic advice on matters of competition policy and regulation.&amp;nbsp;We assist firms and their legal advisors in all types of competition proceedings before competition authorities and courts: mergers and acquisitions, abuse of dominance allegations, cartels, restrictive commercial agreements, market investigations, litigation and disputes, intellectual property or state aid. We also provide advice to regulatory authorities in similar matters.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Learn more about our work by reviewing our Services and Industries on our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.crai.com/&quot;&gt;website&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.crai.com/antitrust-competition-economics-practice/&quot;&gt;Antitrust &amp;amp; Competition Economics&lt;/a&gt; is hiring for the following European Union offices in Brussels, Belgium; Dusseldorf and Munich, Germany; Paris, France.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;line-height: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: &#39;Arial&#39;,sans-serif;&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Position Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Senior Associates work closely with senior consultants on project teams and will have the opportunity to immediately work on some of the largest, high profile and most significant competition cases in Europe, playing a key role in shaping the economic analysis and thinking of these cases. Successful candidates have a strong knowledge of economic concepts and a range of research and quantitative skills. A typical Senior Associate would:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and conceptualise issues, specifying rigorous economic models to analyse market issues and data, undertaking statistical and econometric estimation, and managing the work of research associate staff and colleagues;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Supervise, train and mentor research associate staff;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist in the development and presentation of client deliverables, including expert reports and white papers summarising opinions, conclusions, and recommendations using market, industry or client-proprietary data;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a primary point of contact for lawyers and other industry or government clients on a variety of practice-relevant issues;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Program, build models and/or perform regression analyses in statistical analysis programs (such as Stata, Python, R, SAS, Matlab, and Mathematica), including large data projects requiring use of cloud computing;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure the integrity and accuracy of analyses and opinions; and&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to practice-building activities (training, recruiting, publication, expertise sharing, etc.).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Explore how CRA can help you&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.crai.com/careers/accelerate&quot;&gt;launch your career&lt;/a&gt; and learn &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UJXu817TIZw&quot;&gt;why PhDs choose CRA&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Desired Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;PhD degree in economics with a completion date of December 2026/Summer 2027 and an academic focus on Applied Microeconomics or Applied Microeconometrics, with specializations like industrial organization, labor, health, behavioural and public economics, or other quantitative areas;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in Excel, Stata, Python, R, SQL, SAS, ArcGIS/ArcPy, or Cloud computing (Databricks/Spark, Google Cloud, Azure, AWS);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated understanding of, and ability to explain, economic, financial and/or accounting concepts, and quantitative and qualitative analysis methods;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Curious and analytical thinkers who bring creative approaches to non-standard problems;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Effective written and oral communication skills;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Eagerness to learn new skills and programming languages;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated high level of initiative and leadership;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong teamwork and collaboration capabilities;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent time management and task prioritization skills; and&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear and demonstrated interest in consulting through coursework, work experience, activities, or attendance at CRA recruiting events.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;As much of our work occurs in our offices, minimal travel is required.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;To Apply&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To be considered for a &lt;strong&gt;position in Europe, submit through this posting&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Resume/CV&lt;/strong&gt; – please include current address, email and telephone number;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Covering letter&lt;/strong&gt; – please describe your interest in CRA and how this role matches your goals. Also, please note if you have a location preference;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Research/Job market paper&lt;/strong&gt; – please submit your original research or dissertation;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Letters of Recommendation&lt;/strong&gt; – please have three (3) LORs submitted directly to -----
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To apply for one of our &lt;strong&gt;other global locations&lt;/strong&gt;, please visit our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.crai.com/cra-careers/&quot;&gt;Careers Site&lt;/a&gt; to view available jobs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Interviews will be conducted on a rolling basis. Candidates focusing their search on industry and consulting who need to be considered early should indicate that in the CRA online application and submit all materials as early as possible.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Career Growth and Benefits&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;CRA’s robust &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.crai.com/cra-careers/talent-development/&quot;&gt;skills development programs&lt;/a&gt;, including both formal and informal programs, encourage you to thrive as an individual and team member. Beginning with project management skills, training continues with team management/development, client presentation skills, internal seminars, and career mentoring and performance coaching from an assigned senior colleague. Additional leadership and collaboration opportunities exist through internal firm development activities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We offer a comprehensive total rewards program including a competitive salary and superior benefits package (plus a sizeable performance bonus), &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.crai.com/benefits/&quot;&gt;wellness programming&lt;/a&gt; to support physical, mental, emotional and financial well-being, and in-house &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.crai.com/cra-careers/immigration-global-mobility/&quot;&gt;immigration support&lt;/a&gt; for foreign nationals and international business travelers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work Location Flexibility&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;CRA creates a work environment that enables our colleagues to benefit from being together in the office to best deliver on our promise of career growth, mentorship and inclusivity. At the same time, we recognize that individuals realize a range of benefits when working from home periodically. We currently expect that individuals spend at least 3 to 4 days a week working in the office (which may include traveling to another CRA office or to client meetings), with specific days determined in coordination with your practice or team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsible AI Use in Recruiting&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe that recruiting is fundamentally a human process, and we are committed to a hiring process that is consistent, transparent, and people-focused. While AI and other technology-enabled tools help our team operate more efficiently, we strive to provide every candidate with a personalized, thoughtful, and high-touch experience. As CRA invests significant human effort to find qualified members for our teams, we expect candidates to invest corresponding human effort to learn about CRA, prepare thoughtful application materials, and engage with our interviewers. Read more about appropriate hiring manager, recruiting team, and candidate AI at CRA &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.crai.com/cra-careers/ai-recruiting/&quot;&gt;on our website&lt;/a&gt;. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Commitment to Diversity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Charles River Associates is an equal opportunity employer. As part of our focus on equity and inclusion, we work to ensure a fair and consistent hiring process. We celebrate diversity and we are committed to an inclusive work environment.&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Help make the world more hospitable &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The hospitality industry is uniquely human, and it deserves technology that’s just as inspiring as the people behind it. At Mews, we’re transforming the industry with a platform that helps hotels run smarter, move faster and create better guest experiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll work with smart, curious people who care deeply about what they do. You’ll have autonomy and the trust to make good decisions and move quickly. And you’ll enjoy a real sense of purpose as you see the impact of what we’re building.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re motivated by ownership, curiosity and meaningful impact, and are driven to deliver consistent high performance, you’ll feel at home here.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Let&#39;s get into the specifics. It’s impossible to capture every nuance of a role – especially at a rapidly growing company like Mews – but if we had to distil it into a job description (which we do because this is a job description), it would be this:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;11&quot; data-local-id=&quot;93795b139292&quot;&gt;We&#39;re looking for a Senior Analytics Engineer to lead the data architecture behind our most business-critical financial work: billing, regulatory reporting (&lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_1mT5xdRAKS&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_0nmozVaHVx _2V7sgO2M4S _3BoeIDwZ7G _30zrXRyxdf _0ReiIH7zJH&quot; data-testid=&quot;definition-highlighter&quot;&gt;EMI&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;), &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_1mT5xdRAKS&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_0nmozVaHVx _2V7sgO2M4S _3BoeIDwZ7G _30zrXRyxdf _0ReiIH7zJH&quot; data-testid=&quot;definition-highlighter&quot;&gt;SOX&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; compliance, financial forecasting and executive reporting. You&#39;ll design the data solutions that finance, payments and audit teams depend on, set the standards for how analytics work ships, and mentor others on the team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;400&quot; data-local-id=&quot;04e5a5743e87&quot;&gt;This is a shape-the-team role. You&#39;ll have real influence over how we work, what we build and the pace we move at. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We expect you to use AI fluently where it adds leverage in modeling, code review and debugging, and to apply clear judgment on where it doesn&#39;t.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;663&quot; data-local-id=&quot;8a127a4eec79&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ak-ul&quot; data-local-id=&quot;69983cc5-7a69-4c5e-8cb0-2d1476fbd536&quot; data-indent-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;683&quot; data-local-id=&quot;f86dd91255b3&quot;&gt;Lead the architecture and development of high-impact data models in dbt.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;759&quot; data-local-id=&quot;637843ae65c8&quot;&gt;Architect data solutions across business-critical financial workflows, including billing, regulatory reporting (&lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;EMI&lt;/span&gt;), &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;SOX&lt;/span&gt; compliance, financial forecasting and executive reporting.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;943&quot; data-local-id=&quot;328036a130de&quot;&gt;Mentor analytics engineers and review code to uphold standards across the team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1026&quot; data-local-id=&quot;3cadb74519a9&quot;&gt;Find and fix performance bottlenecks across the data stack.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1089&quot; data-local-id=&quot;ea6a753ebf9a&quot;&gt;Translate business problems into clean, efficient data solutions in close partnership with stakeholders.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1197&quot; data-local-id=&quot;6ac1ef55faf8&quot;&gt;Set team-wide standards for documentation, CI/CD, observability and testing.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1277&quot; data-local-id=&quot;84f45985e13a&quot;&gt;Set the team&#39;s norms for where AI belongs in our workflow, from model development to code review, and where human oversight stays non-negotiable.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1426&quot; data-local-id=&quot;bfbd44915343&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ak-ul&quot; data-local-id=&quot;31d514bd-be3b-41a0-8411-e3530a1faabd&quot; data-indent-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1442&quot; data-local-id=&quot;ebab218e4ac8&quot;&gt;5+ years in analytics engineering or a similar role, with a track record of designing data models that hold up to cross-functional use.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1581&quot; data-local-id=&quot;cf5dc9cd98d7&quot;&gt;Deep, hands-on expertise with dbt, SQL and Python on a modern data platform (Databricks or equivalent).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1688&quot; data-local-id=&quot;5907f55d915c&quot;&gt;Strong grasp of pipeline orchestration, testing frameworks and the practices that keep them healthy at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1801&quot; data-local-id=&quot;766324799f66&quot;&gt;Comfortable setting technical direction, mentoring engineers and working closely with finance, payments and audit stakeholders. You can explain a trade-off clearly and influence the decision that follows.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2009&quot; data-local-id=&quot;94d52040e4ec&quot;&gt;You use AI hands-on in your day-to-day technical work and can show specific examples of how it has changed the way you build, review or debug data models.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2167&quot; data-local-id=&quot;d29af94c37b5&quot;&gt;You catch AI&#39;s errors before anything ships, including hallucinations, overconfident answers and plausible-but-wrong code, and you have a clear sense of where human oversight stays non-negotiable.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Spain&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€65.000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€85.000 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Czechia&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;1 008 000 Kč&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;1 320 000 Kč CZK&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;UK&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;£60,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;£72,000 GBP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;France&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€54.500&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€65.000 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pay Transparency at Mews&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Salary ranges are provided in good faith and reflect current market conditions and internal pay structures. Final compensation may be adjusted based on funding, budget constraints, or exceptional candidate qualifications, but will remain within reasonable proximity to the stated range.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This salary disclosure is provided in compliance with applicable pay transparency legislation. We are committed to equal pay practices and prohibit salary history inquiries during our recruitment process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If the location you&#39;re applying from wasn&#39;t originally advertised for this role, salary range information is available upon request at any point during the application/interview process - your recruiter will be able to help.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What’s in it for you?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our success is powered by our incredible people, supported by benefits that help them thrive.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Global benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;No matter where you’re based, you’ll enjoy:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Unlimited paid holiday (yes, really)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participation in our company share program&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paid parental leave (6 months fully paid for primary caregivers, 2 months for secondary, available after one year of service)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An annual Learning budget of €300 (and more for high performers) to support your development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monthly &quot;EDGE&quot; time to Explore, Develop, Grow, and Elevate yourself&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A work from anywhere policy with flexibility to work abroad for a few weeks each year&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Relocation options, available after one year&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible, hybrid working options&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A home office setup budget to make your workspace your own and a monthly work-from-home allowance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Claude tokens, so you can automate workflows and build smarter, more efficient ways of working&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Local benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll receive additional benefits that vary by location, from healthcare and retirement plans to team events, socials and other perks. Ask us about it during your interview process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Life at Mews&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re an equal opportunities employer. We value teams that reflect the diversity of the customers and communities we serve. Different perspectives make better ideas, stronger products and a more welcoming company.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We also believe transparency is important when deciding if you&#39;re the right fit. Mews is an ambitious, high-pressure environment of continuous learning and high standards. Success here requires resilience, adaptability and a willingness to solve difficult problems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A few things that define how we work:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High autonomy means high responsibility. People are expected to take ownership and drive outcomes. There isn’t a detailed playbook for everything, and that’s part of what makes the work challenging – and rewarding.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Change is constant. We’re growing quickly and adapting as we scale. Teams, processes and priorities continue to evolve, and only people who stay curious and agile will thrive.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We’re remote-first, not relationship-free. Flexibility is core to how we work, but strong relationships still matter. Our teams are global, so we need expert collaborators and communicators to help us move forward together.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AI is an integral part of our processes. It’s not here to steal people’s jobs, but to amplify efficiency and productivity. We’re motivated to proactively use the technology to seek out better ways of working and share our findings with the rest of the company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If there&#39;s anything we can do to support you during the application process, let us know.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We don&#39;t discriminate on the basis of race, religion, colour, nationality, gender, sexual orientation, age, marital status, veteran status, disability or any other protected characteristic.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;One final thing: don&#39;t hold back. If you don&#39;t meet 100% of the criteria in this job description but you&#39;re certain you could make a big impact, apply. Everyone should have equal access to opportunities, and we&#39;re committed to providing an inclusive experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If Mews sounds like the kind of environment where you&#39;d thrive, we&#39;d love to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;About Clear Street: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Clear Street is modernizing the brokerage ecosystem. Founded in 2018, Clear Street is a diversified financial services firm replacing the legacy infrastructure used across capital markets.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We started from scratch by building a completely cloud-native clearing and custody system designed for today’s complex, global market. Clear Street’s proprietary prime brokerage platform adds significant efficiency to the market, while focusing on minimizing risk, redundancy, and cost for clients. Our goal is to create a single source-of-truth platform for every asset class, in every country, and in any currency.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;By combining highly-skilled product and engineering talent with seasoned finance professionals, we’re building the essentials to compete in today’s fast-paced markets.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;The Role:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We are seeking an experienced Tax Associate Director (or Director) to lead tax matters across our UK, EMEA, and APAC operations. Based out of our London office in the United Kingdom, this is a high-impact individual contributor role within a fast-growing fintech business and will report locally to the UK Finance Director. The individual will act as a strategic leader responsible for managing corporate tax compliance and reporting, transfer pricing, planning and advisory and risk management across the UK, EU and APAC regions to strengthen the overall global tax and, more broadly, finance functions for the Company and support the needs of a rapidly growing organization.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We are looking for someone who is excited to join a fast-paced organization and contribute to building a best-in-class Tax function as the Company continues to scale across businesses and geographies.&amp;nbsp; The team is lean and the scope of the role is broad and so the position offers significant opportunities for leadership and growth.&amp;nbsp; You will serve as the primary tax authority for a complex, multi-jurisdictional enterprise, advising senior business leaders, managing external advisors, and partnering with financial, legal, HR, and product teams to ensure tax efficiency, compliance and strategic alignment.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Tax compliance and reporting:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;7&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Manage end-to-end tax compliance cycle including, but not limited to, the preparation and/or review and filing of corporate income tax returns, VAT/GST and/or withholding taxes using local external advisors, where appropriate.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;7&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Oversee the calculation and review of current and deferred tax provisions under IFRS / US GAAP for regional entities. &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;7&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Ensure timely and accurate tax disclosures in statutory financial statements. &lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Tax planning and advisory:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;7&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;4&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Collaborate with Head of Tax on global tax strategy ensuring regional alignment with overall group-wide objectives.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;7&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;4&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Assist with development and implementation of tax planning initiatives, identifying opportunities to optimize effective tax rate and maximize efficiency and tax savings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;7&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;4&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Assist with M&amp;amp;A tax due diligence and post-acquisition tax integration and legal entity rationalization workstreams, including holding structures and IP ownership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;7&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;4&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Act as internal tax advisor for various business units and stakeholders, including, but not limited to, finance, legal, operations and HR.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;7&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;4&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Monitor legislative and regulatory developments in UK, EMEA, and APAC jurisdictions (including Pillar Two / BEPS) and assess impact on the business.&amp;nbsp;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Tax Risk Management:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;7&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;9&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Support global transfer pricing policies, including local file requirements and ensuring intercompany agreements are properly documented.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;7&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;9&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Identify and assess issues and tax implications across UK, EMEA and APAC subsidiaries; maintain robust internal controls are in place to ensure compliance and mitigate tax risk. &lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;7&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;9&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Manage relationship with tax authorities (i.e., HMRC) and assist with support for tax controversy and audits/examinations.&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Other:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;7&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;12&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Assist with the design and implementation of technology automation initiatives with respect to financial reporting and tax compliance.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;7&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;12&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Assist in operational aspects of the tax function to support tax needs. Gain a deep understanding of the company’s operations, businesses and develop a strong network beyond the tax department. &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;7&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;12&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Assist with special projects and initiatives, as necessary, including systems implementation and automation processes. &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;7&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;12&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Support other tax workstreams, if needed (e.g., FATCA/CRS).&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Skills &amp;amp; Attributes:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;7&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;16&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Significant hands-on tax experience and in-depth understanding of UK, EMEA and Asia corporate tax gained in-house at a multinational company.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;7&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;16&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Exceptional technical knowledge of international tax principles &lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;7&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;16&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;ACA, CTA, or equivalent professional qualification preferred (or international equivalent). &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;7&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;16&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Deep expertise in UK corporate tax is essential; strong knowledge of EMEA and APAC tax regimes strongly preferred. &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;7&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;16&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Proven track record managing transfer pricing frameworks in a multi-jurisdictional setting &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;7&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;16&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Experience supporting new business development and M&amp;amp;A transactions, including due diligence, structuring and integration. &lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;7&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;16&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Background in financial services and/or fintech and understanding of the securities industry and broker-dealer businesses including understanding of financial products is highly desired &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;7&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;16&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Strong project management, planning, and organizational skills including the ability to prioritize multiple projects simultaneously in a fast-paced environment. &lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;7&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;16&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Self-starter with the ability to work well independently as well as within a team environment with excellent interpersonal skills.&amp;nbsp; &lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;7&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;16&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Collaborative working style with cross functional/business segment teams across geographies.&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We Offer:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Clear Street, we offer competitive compensation packages, company equity, pension, gender neutral parental leave, and full medical and dental insurance. Our belief has always been that we are better as a business when we are all together in person. As such, we are requiring employees to be in the office a minimum of three days per week.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our top priority is our people. We’re continuously investing in a culture that promotes collaboration. We help each other through challenges and celebrate each other&#39;s successes. We believe that modern workplaces succeed by virtue of having high-performance workforces that are diverse in ideas, cultures and experiences. We put in the effort to make such a workplace a daily reality and are proud to be an equal opportunity employer.&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We are the UK&#39;s leading premium publisher, home to iconic and influential media brands including Esquire, Men&#39;s &amp;amp; Women&#39;s Health, ELLE, Good Housekeeping, Harper&#39;s Bazaar, Digital Spy, Cosmopolitan, Red and more. At Hearst UK, we don&#39;t just create content – we shape culture.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Our workplace is driven by passion, shaped by authenticity and powered by creativity. We back bold ideas, act with an entrepreneurial mindset and continually evolve to meet the moment – while respecting the legacy that&#39;s brought us here. We believe in each other&#39;s potential and push boundaries together to create meaningful impact, both across the media landscape and in people&#39;s lives.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We&#39;re proud of our heritage – but even more excited about making history.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Hearst UK operates an in-office policy with flexible Fridays. Our office is based at &lt;strong&gt;House of Hearst, 30 Panton Street, St James&#39;s, London, SW1Y 4AJ&lt;/strong&gt;, where teams collaborate in person and connect across brands and functions.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Salary - Circa £55,000 - &lt;/strong&gt;Salary is dependent on experience and will be assessed in line with the candidate&#39;s skills, knowledge and relevant expertise.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As our QA Engineer, you’ll play a key role in making sure Hearst’s websites and apps deliver a seamless, reliable experience for millions of users across the UK. Working closely with Product, Design, Engineering and Editorial teams, you’ll test new features, challenge how things work, uncover issues and help bring great digital experiences to life.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll work across our global platforms, making sure new developments are not only technically robust, but work brilliantly for our UK audiences. From new product launches to everyday improvements, you’ll help set the standard for quality at every stage of the journey.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Main Duties…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plan and carry out testing for website and app features across different devices, browsers and operating systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Check that changes meet agreed requirements and work well for people using our products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Report bugs clearly, including steps to reproduce them, and work with engineers to confirm fixes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run regression tests to check that new releases have not affected existing features.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to test plans and release checks throughout the development process.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with engineering teams on optimising automated testing by identifying suitable test cases.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use AI enabled testing tools and workflows to help identify risks, improve test coverage and make quality checks more efficient.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Raise usability, accessibility and performance concerns with the relevant teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Are Looking For…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience testing websites and mobile apps, with a clear understanding of functional and regression testing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confidence using different devices, browsers and operating systems to identify and investigate issues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to write clear bug reports and communicate findings to technical and non-technical colleagues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A methodical approach, good attention to detail and the judgement to prioritise issues by their impact on users.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with test management or bug tracking tools, such as Jira.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Some experience with test automation tools or basic scripting; this is desirable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A collaborative mindset and interest in improving the quality and accessibility of digital products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits…&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;(Your benefits at Hearst UK are more than just extras—they are tools to help you thrive in every part of life.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hearst Exclusives - Only for You!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Get adventurous with Good Housekeeping Taste and Beauty Testing Panels - yes, you could be trying the next big thing in beauty, food &amp;amp; drink.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Snag luxe beauty steals at our legendary office sample sales - score big on top brands without breaking the bank!&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Inclusion, Health &amp;amp; Wellbeing: Feel Your Best&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay healthy with Specsavers eye care, a company-funded Health Cash Plan, and access to mental health support.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Get active and stress-free with discounted gym memberships and the Cycle to Work scheme.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Embrace flexibility with a Location Flex and Holiday Exchange to take time when you need it.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take time to give back with a Charity Day and access wellbeing resources whenever you need them.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Join one of our Hearst ERG Groups.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Financial Wellness - Boost Your Budget&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plan ahead with a generous Workplace Pension, Income Protection, Life Assurance and Season Ticket Loan for easier commuting.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Make smarter money moves using Salary Finance tools, Financial Wellbeing sessions, and Home Tech benefits to spread costs.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Treat yourself with major discounts across London plus everyday savings via the HAPI at Hearst app&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hearst UK is deeply committed to using our influential brands to reflect the world we want to live in – one that respects, protects, represents and uplifts the voices and opinions of all people. As a business, we recognise the significant benefits of creativity, collaboration and innovation that comes with diverse teams. Not only is diversifying the voices in our organization the right thing to do, but it also helps us to make powerful and exciting content that can be enjoyed by many more people. This is why we’re working to build a sense of true belonging within our business and foster a culture in which everyone feels heard.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;Product Manager&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; UK (remote)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Description&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Reachdesk is the first truly end-to-end global SaaS gifting and swag platform, helping B2B companies create meaningful connections with prospects, customers, and employees, while driving measurable ROI.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe gifting is more than just a transaction: it’s about building genuine human connections that fuel business growth. Whether it’s engaging prospects, celebrating customers, or recognizing employees, our platform makes it easy to deliver personalized gifts, branded swag, and unforgettable event &amp;amp; brand experiences at scale through automated sourcing, storage, and global delivery.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Trusted by many of the most recognized names in technology and SaaS, Reachdesk integrates effortlessly with marketing, sales, and HRIS tech stacks and is powered by our world-class team across New York, London, and Lisbon.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re growing, and we’re currently looking for a Product Manager to join us.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Product Manager at Reachdesk, you’ll play a pivotal role in shaping the Reachdesk Platform. You will be accountable for turning complex customer and business problems into software products that deliver measurable impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Reporting to the Chief Product Officer, you’ll lead product initiatives end-to-end,&amp;nbsp; from identifying and deeply understanding the right problems to solve, through discovery and delivery, to launch, adoption, and continuous improvement.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll operate with a high degree of autonomy, proactively building context across customers, the market, internal stakeholders, data, and technology to understand what Reachdesk needs to achieve its goals. You’ll also make sound decisions when the path forward isn’t obvious.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll partner closely with Engineering and Design and work across the wider business to create alignment, communicate decisions clearly, and ensure what we build is successfully launched, adopted, and delivers the outcomes we set out to achieve.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you enjoy solving difficult problems, taking ownership, and moving comfortably between customer, technical, and business conversations, you’ll thrive in this role.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Set product direction and priorities&lt;/strong&gt;, bringing together company goals, internal stakeholder needs, customer insight, market context, data, and technical considerations to focus on the highest-impact opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Define problems and experiences before solutions&lt;/strong&gt;, creating clear stories, journeys, and shared context so the Design and Engineering teams understand the problem and intended outcomes before determining the solution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead product initiatives end-to-end&lt;/strong&gt;, from discovery and solution definition through delivery, rollout, and iteration, partnering with Engineering to manage scope, make pragmatic trade-offs, and deliver valuable solutions at pace.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Make sound product decisions and trade-offs&lt;/strong&gt;, balancing customer and business needs, commercial impact, user experience, and technical considerations while aligning the wider business on compromises, priorities, and expectations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Develop product opportunities with external partners&lt;/strong&gt;, building relationships with technology partners to uncover mutual opportunities, shape integrations, align roadmaps, and navigate the product and commercial considerations required to bring them to market.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Orchestrate successful launches and adoption&lt;/strong&gt;, working across Sales, Marketing, Customer Success, Services, Logistics, Finance, Legal, and other teams to ensure the business is ready and customers realise value from what we build.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communicate with clarity throughout&lt;/strong&gt;, ensuring leadership and teams across Reachdesk understand product decisions, progress, risks, changes, and results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a strong track record of &lt;strong&gt;owning B2B SaaS products end-to-end&lt;/strong&gt;, from identifying the right problems through delivery, adoption, and measurable customer and business outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re a &lt;strong&gt;strong problem solver&lt;/strong&gt; who gets to the root of complex problems, brings structure to ambiguity, and uses evidence and judgement to determine the right path forward.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You operate with &lt;strong&gt;independence and initiative&lt;/strong&gt;: you seek out the customers, stakeholders, data, and context you need rather than waiting for direction, while staying anchored to Reachdesk’s goals and priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have &lt;strong&gt;strong business and commercial awareness&lt;/strong&gt; and are curious about how the wider company operates, allowing you to understand competing needs and make pragmatic decisions beyond the boundaries of Product.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re &lt;strong&gt;technically fluent enough to work effectively with Engineering&lt;/strong&gt;, understand systems, integrations, and constraints, ask the right questions, and contribute meaningfully to solution and scope decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re an &lt;strong&gt;exceptional communicator&lt;/strong&gt;, able to create clarity, influence decisions, surface difficult trade-offs, and adapt how you communicate across customers, engineers, leadership, and teams throughout the business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re comfortable &lt;strong&gt;operating externally as well as internally&lt;/strong&gt;, building productive relationships with technology partners, uncovering shared opportunities, influencing without authority, and navigating product, technical, and commercial conversations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a strong sense of &lt;strong&gt;product and user experience&lt;/strong&gt;, caring about the coherence and quality of the complete experience rather than whether individual requirements or features have simply been delivered.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive salary with generous stock options&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pension with employer contributions (NEST)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Affordable Private Medical Insurance, including mental health support and fast access to care&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible PTO that increases the longer you’re with us, plus extra flexibility for life’s unexpected moments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A genuinely collaborative culture with innovative, fun, and ambitious people&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Reachdesk believes that a diverse team helps us achieve our mission faster, and so we welcome applicants from all backgrounds.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;Privacy Policy: We process personal information submitted as part of your application in accordance with the Reachdesk Candidate Privacy Notice. Please review Reachdesk’s Privacy Policy here: &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.reachdesk.com/candidate-privacy-policy&quot;&gt;www.reachdesk.com/candidate-privacy-policy&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;At Real Chemistry, making the world a healthier place isn’t just an aspiration—it’s our everyday reality. Our drive to transform healthcare is informed by our blend of deep scientific expertise, human-centred creativity, and AI-driven insights, fostering a unique environment where innovation thrives and our people are impact-obsessed. As a global agency, we provide a full suite of services across healthcare communications and marketing to our clients, including top players in the pharmaceutical and biotech industries.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our #LifeatRealChem culture is rooted in our people—we believe we are best together and are committed to excellence for both our clients and colleagues. Whether you&#39;re a seasoned professional or just starting your career, if you share our passion for healthcare and connection, we invite you to explore our opportunities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Discover your purpose. Embrace innovation. Experience #LifeatRealChem.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Real Chemistry is looking for driven, savvy game changers who are ready to dive into the trenches and make an immediate impact. We are currently seeking a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Account Executive&lt;/strong&gt; with client services experience in a healthcare communications agency. The position offers a great opportunity for an individual with a passion for healthcare to work with leading clients in the pharmaceutical, biotechnology, medical devices and health IT fields, across a range of global PR and communications accounts to support our growing team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take responsibility for exceptional client service and account management activities for 2-3 accounts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In collaboration with junior team members and supported by senior management and our internal team, drive flawless and timely project execution and high-touch client communication&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in development of clients’ marketing strategies and tactics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support overall account development, resourcing fiscal performance and growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support day-to-day client contact in executing ad hoc requests and delivering planned activities and materials&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop draft scope of works, contracts, presentations, creative briefs, PR and marketing materials and other internal/external communications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure client feedback is gathered, understood and addressed as appropriate across deliverables and internally&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Document status and otherwise communicate need-to-know information to all project stakeholders to ensure progression along critical path&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sets meetings, provides agendas and contact reports&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to run client calls or meetings independently&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage account finances; must be able to track budget, raise invoices and POs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who are you?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working at an Account Executive or Senior Account Executive level in a healthcare PR/Communications agency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly organized with a mindfulness of deadlines, the ability to manage multiple tasks based on priorities and a strong attention to detail&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Independent thinker confident in taking ownership of assets and material development, but a team player who enjoys collaboration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High energy, able to effectively operate in fast-paced, growing and evolving environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Has good understanding of social media vehicles and is comfortable managing and drafting communications around them&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong written and oral communication and presentations skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to devise and articulate solutions to problems on an ongoing basis&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to develop project scopes and client and vendor contracts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience with media monitoring, research and taking on projects with limited supervision&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Real Chemistry is proud to be Great Place to Work®&amp;nbsp;certified; check out what our people shared about our culture and workplace on our Great Places to Work Profile&amp;nbsp;&lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://nam11.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.greatplacetowork.com%2Fcertified-company%2F7038366&amp;amp;data=05%7C02%7Cclehmar%40realchemistry.com%7C1f18aaed4326491b3efc08ddd690f025%7C6fa5bfc4f95843f8bb395d382689654b%7C0%7C0%7C638902640185888156%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;amp;sdata=pwvaCn37QXkjVQ0p6u92Oz4FA4j5NQZoNJL0ffy01qs%3D&amp;amp;reserved=0&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe we can do our best when feeling our best, which is why we’ve put together a benefits program designed to give you the support you and your family need at every stage of life. Real Chemistry offers a comprehensive benefit program and perks, tailored to your region. Globally, this includes offices in our key markets with free snacks to keep you running all day long, generous holiday and paid time off, options for private medical, dental, and vison plans, and support in saving for the future. Other perks include mental wellness coaching and support&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;access to more than 13,000 online classes with LinkedIn Learning.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Learn more about our great benefits and perks and search specific offerings in your region at:&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.realchemistrybenefits.com&quot;&gt;www.realchemistrybenefits.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;At Real Chemistry, we believe we&#39;re at our best when we&#39;re connected. Our Real Hybrid and Regional Teams (Real HART) approach is designed to foster collaboration, learning, innovation, and meaningful relationships while providing flexibility where appropriate.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;Because our workforce spans multiple countries, regions, and client needs, work arrangements may vary by role and location. Some positions offer hybrid or remote flexibility, while others require regular in-office presence. For example, certain teams and regions, including some of our UK operations, have office-based requirements. Your recruiter will discuss the specific expectations for the role you&#39;re pursuing during the interview process and keep you informed throughout the hiring journey.&amp;nbsp;For employees located within a one-hour commute of a Real Chemistry office, we require in-person attendance two days per week, either from a Real Chemistry office or when working onsite with clients. Employees in regions without a nearby office may work remotely and come together throughout the year for collaboration, culture-building, learning, and team connection opportunities.&amp;nbsp;While these guidelines reflect our current workplace model, we understand that everyone’s circumstances are unique. If you require additional flexibility, we welcome an open conversation with your recruiter and our HR team to discuss your needs and determine what may be possible.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Real Chemistry is an Equal Opportunity employer. We continually strive to build and sustain an inclusive and equitable work environment where our employees feel empowered to leverage all they bring from their personal lived experience and professional expertise, to make our team the best in the industry. We encourage motivated and qualified applicants to apply without regard to race, color, religion, sex (including pregnancy), sexual orientation, gender identity/expression, ethnic or national origin, age, physical or mental disability, genetic information, marital information, or any other characteristic protected by federal, state, or local employment discrimination laws where Real Chemistry operates. Should you require accommodations throughout the interview process please let your recruiter know.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;*Notice: Real Chemistry and its affiliates&#39; names are being misused by scammers through messaging services, fake websites, and apps. Do not share personal or financial information or make payments to any unverified sources claiming to be connected to Real Chemistry. We are working to stop these unauthorized activities and protect our community. Read more&amp;nbsp;&lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://nam11.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.realchemistry.com%2Fscam-alert&amp;amp;data=05%7C02%7Cclehmar%40realchemistry.com%7C1f18aaed4326491b3efc08ddd690f025%7C6fa5bfc4f95843f8bb395d382689654b%7C0%7C0%7C638902640185967986%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;amp;sdata=vBa1KYjD6TUHgTF3FdPRQZvM8E8WUgHZqu9yHevh1%2BI%3D&amp;amp;reserved=0&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;At Real Chemistry, making the world a healthier place isn’t just an aspiration—it’s our everyday reality. Our drive to transform healthcare is informed by our blend of deep scientific expertise, human-centred creativity, and AI-driven insights, fostering a unique environment where innovation thrives and our people are impact-obsessed. As a global agency, we provide a full suite of services across healthcare communications and marketing to our clients, including top players in the pharmaceutical and biotech industries.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our #LifeatRealChem culture is rooted in our people—we believe we are best together and are committed to excellence for both our clients and colleagues. Whether you&#39;re a seasoned professional or just starting your career, if you share our passion for healthcare and connection, we invite you to explore our opportunities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Discover your purpose. Embrace innovation. Experience #LifeatRealChem.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Real Chemistry is a global health innovation company with offices across EMEA, APAC and the US. We believe that the way to real, transformative change is through the uncommon combination of disciplines, technologies, and our greatest asset – our people. We are currently looking to add to our alchemic mix of more than 2,000 talented professionals. This is a great opportunity to join a dynamic, fast-growing global company committed to making the world a healthier place for all.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Summary:&amp;nbsp; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Real Chemistry is currently seeking a&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Senior &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Group Director&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;(Director or Senior Director level)&amp;nbsp;with solid client services experience with pharmaceutical clients, specifically in scientific comms (data milestones and regulatory communications) who can lead client strategy engagements and oversee project execution across different communication platforms as well as drive new business opportunities.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities: &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leading on the scientific comms part of one of our largest global accounts, with a focus in oncology.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and maintain strong client relationships through exceptional client relationship skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee the distribution of client announcements via the appropriate regulatory channels and follow up with media in a timely manner&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop high-level and persuasive communications plans to meet the clients business objectives&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead operational efforts and be accountable for the financial performance of engagements through close management of budgets and team members&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure the quality of the account team(s) is held to the highest standard and that all client requests are handled in a strategic and timely manner&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with shared service leads to run and grow integrated business, and to develop new business opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Directly supervise account staff and promote continuous learning and development to help build a high performing culture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Skills &amp;amp; Experience: &lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience as a Director or Senior Director, in a health PR agency&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive experience working with clients within the life sciences industry (particularly pharma/biotech)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;For this role we are looking for experience with oncology.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in data/regulatory communications and scientific comms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of the everchanging digital landscape&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional presentation skills — both verbal and written, formal and informal&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly organized, proactive and a solution-oriented thinker under pressure&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Project management experience, demonstrated ability to meet deadlines, prioritize and manage detailed budgets&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Supervisory skills, with ability to manage and cultivate junior staff&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Positive, team-oriented attitude&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience developing direct reports and influence-managing matrixed teams a must&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional organizational skills leading to flawless execution of tactical plans is required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Real Chemistry offers a comprehensive benefit program and perks. Learn more about our great benefits and perks at&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.realchemistry.com/&quot;&gt;: &lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.realchemistry.com/&quot;&gt;http://www.realchemistry.com/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.realchemistry.com/&quot;&gt; &lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Real Chemistry is committed to being an Equal Opportunity employer. As such, we seek motivated and qualified applicants without regard to race, color, religion, sex (including pregnancy), sexual orientation, gender identity/expression, ethnic or national origin, age, physical or mental disability, genetic information, marital information, or any other characteristic protected by federal, state, or local employment discrimination laws where Real Chemistry operates. We strive to employ, motivate, advance and reasonably accommodate any qualified employees and applicants. We believe diversity of persons and ideas forms the most comprehensive, forward-looking company.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Real Chemistry is proud to be Great Place to Work®&amp;nbsp;certified; check out what our people shared about our culture and workplace on our Great Places to Work Profile&amp;nbsp;&lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://nam11.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.greatplacetowork.com%2Fcertified-company%2F7038366&amp;amp;data=05%7C02%7Cclehmar%40realchemistry.com%7C1f18aaed4326491b3efc08ddd690f025%7C6fa5bfc4f95843f8bb395d382689654b%7C0%7C0%7C638902640185888156%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;amp;sdata=pwvaCn37QXkjVQ0p6u92Oz4FA4j5NQZoNJL0ffy01qs%3D&amp;amp;reserved=0&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
