&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Grafana Labs is the company behind Grafana Cloud, the fully managed observability platform trusted by more than 10,000 organizations to ensure reliability, resolve incidents faster, and optimize telemetry at scale. Built on open source and open standards and designed for interoperability across any stack, Grafana Cloud brings AI to observability and observability to AI, giving teams (and their agents) unified visibility so they can see, understand, and act on all their disparate data, wherever it lives, and move at the speed of their ambitions. Customers, including Anthropic, Bloomberg, NVIDIA, Microsoft, and Salesforce, rely on Grafana Labs. We are a 100% remote company with team members across 40+ countries, backed by leading investors including Lightspeed Venture Partners, Sequoia Capital, GIC, Coatue, J.P. Morgan, CapitalG, and Lead Edge Capital. Learn more at &lt;u&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://grafana.com&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;grafana.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/u&gt; and follow us on &lt;u&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/grafana-labs/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/u&gt; and &lt;u&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://twitter.com/grafana&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;X&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;u&gt;.&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re scaling fast and staying true to what makes us different: an open-source legacy, a global collaborative culture, and a passion for meaningful work. Our team thrives in an innovation-driven environment where transparency, autonomy, and trust fuel everything we do.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You may not meet every requirement, and that’s okay. If this role excites you, we’d love you to raise your hand for what could be a truly career-defining opportunity.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This is a remote opportunity and we would be interested in applications from the UK, Ireland, Spain and Germany.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Grafana Cloud Observability&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Grafana Cloud is our fully managed observability platform that integrates metrics, logs, and traces with Grafana. It allows our customers to use the best open source observability software, including Prometheus, Mimir, Loki, and Tempo, without the overhead of installing, maintaining and scaling their own observability stack.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Within the Observability department, we build products that help customers understand and troubleshoot their applications and infrastructure. We work closely with product management, design and other engineering squads to provide seamless and highly curated experiences for our customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The squad: Database Observability&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We build and evolve Grafana Cloud Database Observability. We want to help users understand the health and performance of their databases, identify slow queries and troubleshoot issues through clear, actionable insights.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a frontend engineer on the squad, you’ll build experiences that make complex database telemetry easy to explore and understand. You’ll work closely with backend engineers, product management and design to take ideas from early exploration through to production and improve them based on customer feedback.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our frontend stack is primarily TypeScript and React, interacting with backends written in Go. Your primary focus will be frontend engineering, with opportunities to work across the stack, contributing to APIs and backend functionality to deliver complete customer experiences. Frontend engineers at Grafana also have opportunities to contribute to open source communities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The opportunity:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own technical projects from problem framing through rollout, including getting user feedback and measuring whether what you shipped actually worked.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Product Management, Product Design and backend engineers to build intuitive user experiences using clean, reusable components, contributing to supporting APIs and backend functionality where needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor and collaborate with other engineers. Raise the engineering bar through code review, design feedback, pairing on hard problems, and writing that leaves the team better than you found it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in on-call for the software you help build, contributing to incident response and learning from incidents.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide technical support in customer escalations and help us identify areas of high friction to address.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with other squads on shared dependencies, contribute to design proposals, and share the team’s work through demos and technical discussions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We invest heavily in developer productivity. You can use modern AI coding assistants as part of your daily workflow (your choice of tools, within security guidelines), backed by a company-funded usage budget so you can iterate quickly without unnecessary friction. We encourage pragmatic AI-assisted development: faster prototyping, test generation, refactors, documentation, and incident follow-ups, always with strong code review and quality standards. You&#39;ll also have access to the latest frontier models from OpenAI, Anthropic, and Google.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What makes you a great fit:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We highly value those who are &lt;strong&gt;intellectually curious&lt;/strong&gt;, who &lt;strong&gt;default to transparency&lt;/strong&gt;, possess a high &lt;strong&gt;bias towards action&lt;/strong&gt;, and who are also &lt;strong&gt;kind and enjoy working as a team&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong frontend engineering experience, with experience across the stack.&lt;/strong&gt; You have experience building and maintaining production web applications with React and TypeScript, and are comfortable contributing to backend services and APIs. You value maintainability, readability, automated testing and secure development practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical ownership.&lt;/strong&gt; You have solid experience delivering complex projects, mentoring other engineers and helping teammates work more effectively. You communicate clearly in a fully remote, asynchronous environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You &lt;strong&gt;take responsibility for operating the software you have built&lt;/strong&gt;. You have experience being on-call, supporting software in production, ensuring reliability and responding to incidents as needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You &lt;strong&gt;enjoy working on complex solutions&lt;/strong&gt;, building production software systems. You’re a self-starter, capable of tackling complex engineering problems with minimal supervision.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;User focus and pragmatism.&lt;/strong&gt; You break complex problems into short feedback loops: analyze, design, deliver an MVP, learn, iterate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI experience with a practical mindset.&lt;/strong&gt; You use AI coding tools thoughtfully to improve productivity and quality, validate their output, and share useful practices with teammates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You &lt;strong&gt;care about our community&lt;/strong&gt; of users and contributors and are keen to be an active Grafana Community Contributor.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus Points for&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Open-source contribution or maintainership, and comfort engaging a community in the open.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An active interest in observability (metrics, logs and traces) and experience with tools like Grafana, Prometheus or other observability platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with databases, SQL or database performance monitoring.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building backend services in Go.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience as an on-call user of Grafana, Prometheus, Loki or Tempo in a previous role (or on a homelab).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in a fully remote, globally distributed team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation &amp;amp; Rewards:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In the UK, the base compensation range for this role is £94&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;,000 - £118,000&lt;/span&gt;. Actual compensation may vary based on level, experience, and skillset as assessed throughout the interview process. All of our roles include Restricted Stock Units (RSUs), giving every team member ownership in Grafana Labs&#39; success. We believe in shared outcomes—RSUs help us stay aligned and invested as we scale globally.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;*Compensation ranges are country specific. If you are applying for this role from a different location than listed above, your recruiter will discuss your specific market’s defined pay range &amp;amp; benefits at the beginning of the process.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why You’ll Thrive at Grafana Labs:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;100% Remote, Global Culture -&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;As a remote-only company, we bring together talent from around the world, united by a culture of collaboration and shared purpose.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scaling Organization&lt;/strong&gt; – Tackle meaningful work in a high-growth, ever-evolving environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Transparent Communication&lt;/strong&gt; – Expect open decision-making and regular company-wide updates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Innovation-Driven&lt;/strong&gt; – Autonomy and support to ship great work and try new things.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Open Source Roots&lt;/strong&gt; – Built on community-driven values that shape how we work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Empowered Teams&lt;/strong&gt; – High trust, low ego culture that values outcomes over optics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Career Growth Pathways&lt;/strong&gt; – Defined opportunities to grow and develop your career.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Approachable Leadership&lt;/strong&gt; – Transparent execs who are involved, visible, and human.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Passionate People&lt;/strong&gt; – Join a team of smart, supportive folks who care deeply about what they do.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In-Person onboarding &lt;/strong&gt;- We want you to thrive from day 1 with your fellow new ‘Grafanistas’ to learn all about what we do and how we do it.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Balance is Key&lt;/strong&gt; - We operate a global annual leave policy of 30 days per annum. 3 days of your annual leave entitlement are reserved for Grafana Shutdown Days to allow the team to really disconnect. &lt;em&gt;*We will comply with local legislation where applicable.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal Opportunity Employer:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;em&gt;Grafana Labs is an equal opportunities employer. We welcome applications from everyone regardless of race, colour, nationality, origin, caste, sex, gender reassignment identity or expression, sexual orientation, age, religion or belief, disability, veteran status, genetic information, pregnancy, maternity, marital, family or carer status, or any other characteristic which is protected by local law. We believe that equality and diversity build a strong organisation, and we work hard to ensure that is the foundation of our organisation as we grow.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;Grafana Labs may utilize AI tools in its recruitment process to assist in matching information provided in CVs to job postings. The recruitment team will continue to review inbound CVs manually to identify alignment with current openings.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Remote&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;em&gt;For information about how your personal data is used once you’ve applied to a job, check out our &lt;a href=&quot;https://grafana.com/legal/applicant-and-candidate-privacy-policy/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;privacy policy&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Allow us to introduce ourselves&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Hello there! We’re Appinio, a global market research company that combines an AI-powered insights platform with expert consultancy. On a mission to make the world a little more fact-based, we help companies understand how consumers think and make smarter decisions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We started out in Hamburg back in 2014, but we’re now humbled to call the world our playground, with over &lt;strong&gt;260 employees&lt;/strong&gt; spread across &lt;strong&gt;13 countries &lt;/strong&gt;(we’re remote-first), 2600+ international clients, delivering research from &lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;+190 markets,&lt;/strong&gt; globally.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Want to be a part of the Appinio movement? &lt;strong&gt;🚀&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-preserver-spaces=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Here at Appinio, we value &lt;strong&gt;transparency&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;in our recruitment process&lt;/strong&gt;, and we&#39;ve created a blog to share what to expect during each step of our journey together:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-preserver-spaces=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-preserver-spaces=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link c-link--focus-visible&quot; href=&quot;https://www.appinio.com/en/blog/life-at-appinio/appinio-recruitment-process&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://www.appinio.com/en/blog/life-at-appinio/appinio-recruitment-process&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your mission as a (Senior) Research Consultant&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a &lt;strong&gt;(Senior)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Research Consultant (m/f/d) &lt;/strong&gt;with a strong quantitative market research background to join our newly dedicated B2B research team in the DACH region.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This specialized unit focuses on research projects that specifically survey B2B target groups, professional decision-makers, and niche business audiences (rather than only standard B2C consumer panels). You will work closely with leading global strategy and management consultancies as well as major international corporates, supporting high-stakes projects where research needs to be delivered quickly, precisely, and with a clear focus on the business question.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll be doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;End-to-End B2B Project Lead: Manage quantitative research projects end-to-end, including B2B screening design, questionnaire drafting, platform setup, fieldwork monitoring, and data delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Methodology &amp;amp; Study Design: Optimise bespoke study designs across core use cases (e.g., Target Group Analysis, U&amp;amp;A, Pricing studies, Concept Testing) mainly tailored to hard-to-reach professional audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Senior Client Sparring &amp;amp; Advisory: Act as a trusted research partner to leading global consulting firms and major corporate clients. Work directly with experienced consultants and senior stakeholders to translate business questions into robust research approaches, advise on sample feasibility and survey methodology, and make pragmatic decisions when timelines are tight.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commercial &amp;amp; Scoping Collaboration: Partner closely with Sales and Account Management on project scoping, feasibility checks, and methodology definition for complex project requests.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Process &amp;amp; Quality Enhancement: Contribute to standardizing B2B screening protocols, sampling frameworks, and best practices to coach other researcher and safeguard delivery speed and research quality across the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You will thrive in this role if&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have 5+ years of experience in quantitative market research with a distinct focus on surveying B2B target groups and professional decision-makers (agency or consulting background required; pure academic or non-client backgrounds will not fit this role).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have hands-on experience designing studies, writing questionnaires, and executing quantitative projects across core B2B use cases (e.g., U&amp;amp;A, Pricing studies, Concept Testing, Target Group Analysis).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You bring proven experience creating executive-ready reports and presenting complex data through clear, compelling storytelling to senior client-side stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You possess a strategic, commercially minded approach with the self-confidence to guide clients and defend research decisions under pressure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You excel in high-velocity environments, with a demonstrated ability to juggle multiple concurrent projects, prioritize effectively, and stay calm under tight deadlines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are proficient in German (C2 level required) and English, with outstanding written and verbal communication skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You bring a pragmatic, proactive, and resilient mindset with a passion for data quality and innovation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What’s in it for you?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-preserver-spaces=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Flexibility&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-preserver-spaces=&quot;true&quot;&gt; Policy&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-preserver-spaces=&quot;true&quot;&gt; - Our flexibility policy means there is no hard cap on the number of vacation days you can take&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-preserver-spaces=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Temporary work from abroad - &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-preserver-spaces=&quot;true&quot;&gt;If you&#39;re based in the EU, you can work outside your country of residence for up to 180 days per year&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-preserver-spaces=&quot;true&quot;&gt;All the hardware you need and&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-preserver-spaces=&quot;true&quot;&gt;your own MacBook&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-preserver-spaces=&quot;true&quot;&gt;If you are located in Hamburg or Berlin, you&#39;ll get a&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-preserver-spaces=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Deutschland ticket&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-preserver-spaces=&quot;true&quot;&gt; or access to a mobility budget with the&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-preserver-spaces=&quot;true&quot;&gt;NAVIT app&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-preserver-spaces=&quot;true&quot;&gt; to get you to and from the office space&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Subsidised &lt;strong&gt;Urban Sports Club &lt;/strong&gt;or &lt;strong&gt;ClassPass&lt;/strong&gt; membership based on location&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-preserver-spaces=&quot;true&quot;&gt;In case&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-preserver-spaces=&quot;true&quot;&gt; you’re located in one of the cities where most of our fellow Appinioneers are (Hamburg, Berlin, Munich, London, Madrid, Barcelona, or New York), you can get access to our&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-preserver-spaces=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Co-working spaces&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;job-ad-editable job-ad-editable job-ad-editor&quot; data-content=&quot;6454846&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;role&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;job-ad-editable job-ad-editable job-ad-editor&quot; data-content=&quot;6454830&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Kind reminder:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Please ensure that your application is submitted in English.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;This post not only outlines our ideal candidate but also serves as an inspiration for what this role can evolve into. Even if you consider yourself an 80% fit but have a genuine passion for this position, we encourage you to apply. We&#39;re eager to hear from individuals who share our enthusiasm.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Appinio is an equal-opportunity employer. All applicants will be considered for employment without attention to race, colour, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, national origin, veteran, or disability status.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Please read our privacy policy &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.appinio.com/en-gb/privacy&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
