&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About IonQ:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cts.businesswire.com/ct/CT?id=smartlink&amp;amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fionq.com%2F&amp;amp;esheet=54451094&amp;amp;newsitemid=20260316477473&amp;amp;lan=en-US&amp;amp;anchor=IonQ%2C+Inc&amp;amp;index=7&amp;amp;md5=0818ffbedc6dbad8c4d1611ac94c2a0f&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;IonQ, Inc&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;. [NYSE: IONQ] is the world’s leading quantum platform and merchant supplier - delivering integrated quantum solutions across computing, networking, sensing, and security. IonQ’s newest generation of quantum computers, the IonQ Tempo, is the latest in a line of cutting-edge systems that have been helping customers and partners including &lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cts.businesswire.com/ct/CT?id=smartlink&amp;amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fionq.com%2Fnews%2Fionq-speeds-quantum-accelerated-drug-development-application-with&amp;amp;esheet=54451094&amp;amp;newsitemid=20260316477473&amp;amp;lan=en-US&amp;amp;anchor=Amazon+Web+Services%2C&amp;amp;index=8&amp;amp;md5=a7f94ee9b71a392dca3cd6c413722e51&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Amazon Web Services, &lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cts.businesswire.com/ct/CT?id=smartlink&amp;amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fionq.com%2Fnews%2Fionq-speeds-quantum-accelerated-drug-development-application-with&amp;amp;esheet=54451094&amp;amp;newsitemid=20260316477473&amp;amp;lan=en-US&amp;amp;anchor=and&amp;amp;index=9&amp;amp;md5=2bed627b388878763f41ffe0e4edb16c&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;and &lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cts.businesswire.com/ct/CT?id=smartlink&amp;amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fionq.com%2Fnews%2Fionq-speeds-quantum-accelerated-drug-development-application-with&amp;amp;esheet=54451094&amp;amp;newsitemid=20260316477473&amp;amp;lan=en-US&amp;amp;anchor=AstraZeneca&amp;amp;index=10&amp;amp;md5=757c1f2c2ec94cf3982700106122164f&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;AstraZeneca&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt; achieve 20x performance results and accelerate innovation in drug discovery, materials science, financial modeling, logistics, cybersecurity, and defense. In 2025, the company achieved 99.99% two-qubit gate fidelity, &lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cts.businesswire.com/ct/CT?id=smartlink&amp;amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fionq.com%2Fnews%2Fionq-achieves-landmark-result-setting-new-world-record-in-quantum-computing&amp;amp;esheet=54451094&amp;amp;newsitemid=20260316477473&amp;amp;lan=en-US&amp;amp;anchor=setting+a+world+record+in+quantum+computing+performance&amp;amp;index=11&amp;amp;md5=32e9cb88afbd439026a352666cc72c91&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;setting a world record in quantum computing performance&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Headquartered in College Park, Maryland, IonQ has operations in California, Colorado, Massachusetts, Tennessee, Washington, Italy, South Korea, Sweden, Switzerland, Canada, and the United Kingdom. Our quantum computing services are available through all major cloud providers, while we also meet the needs of networking and sensing customers across land, sea, air, and space. IonQ is making quantum platforms more accessible and impactful than ever before. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Role Overview&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Role:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;IonQ is hiring a Senior Quantum Sales Director to drive new and expansion revenue for Capella Data as a Service (DaaS) and satellite systems across EMEA. You will own a portfolio of strategic enterprise, defence and government accounts, selling SAR imagery and analytics subscriptions, tasking capacity and complete satellite systems, and you will report to Garrick Ballantine.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a quota carrying, hunter oriented role for a seller who can run long cycle capital programmes alongside faster moving data subscriptions, and who can translate space based sensing into mission and business outcomes. The role is remote, employed through an IonQ entity in the UK (Oxford) or Switzerland, with travel of up to 20%.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will own an annual new business and expansion quota across Capella DaaS subscriptions, tasking capacity and satellite system sales within an assigned enterprise, defence and civil government territory in EMEA. You will build and execute account plans for a named portfolio, mapping stakeholders across mission, programme, procurement and technical functions and building executive relationships at several levels in each account.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will sell the full value chain, from SAR data and analytics subscriptions and recurring tasking commitments to ground segment integration and dedicated or jointly owned satellite systems. Working with product, engineering and mission solutions teams, you will bring customer requirements back into the roadmap and represent IonQ at industry, defence and geospatial conferences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Key responsibilities include:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run complex, consultative sales cycles from prospecting through to close, including discovery, technical validation with solutions engineering, pricing, contracting and negotiation of subscription and system purchase agreements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Respond to RFIs, RFPs and government tenders in partnership with capture, proposal and contracts teams, and support prime and subcontractor teaming strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Forecast accurately in CRM, keep disciplined pipeline hygiene and deliver reliable monthly and quarterly commits.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop executive relationships across mission, programme, procurement and technical stakeholders in each account.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent IonQ at industry, defence and geospatial events across EMEA, and feed customer requirements back to product and engineering.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Requirements:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will bring substantial enterprise sales experience in geospatial data, earth observation, satellite systems, defence technology or adjacent data and SaaS markets, with a consistent record of exceeding quota. You will have closed both recurring data or subscription contracts and large capital or programme based hardware sales, and you will have sold to EMEA and allied government, defence and security customers, with a working knowledge of their procurement frameworks and contracting cycles.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will have command of a structured sales methodology such as MEDDICC or Challenger, with disciplined CRM and forecasting rigour, and the ability to engage credibly with technical and mission stakeholders on remote sensing, SAR, tasking and data delivery workflows. A bachelor&#39;s degree in business, engineering or a related field, and willingness to travel up to 20%, are also required.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;You’d be a great fit with:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Direct experience selling SAR, optical imagery or RF sensing data and analytics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A background in satellite systems, ground segment or space mission integration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in early market development or category creation for an emerging technology.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to obtain the relevant national security clearance in your country of employment, such as UK SC or NATO clearance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Established relationships with EMEA government, defence or security customers, including NATO and allied programmes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The total compensation package includes base salary, bonus, equity, and a range of benefits available on our career site.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Compensation will vary based on individual factors such as education, qualifications, and experience of the final candidate(s), specific office location, and calibration against relevant market data and internal team equity. Posted base salary figures are subject to change as new market data becomes available. Our benefits include comprehensive medical, dental, and vision plans, matching 401(k), unlimited PTO and paid holidays, parental/adoption leave, legal insurance, and a home technology stipend. Details of participation in these benefit plans will be provided when a candidate receives an offer of employment.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At IonQ, we believe in fair treatment, access, opportunity, and advancement for all while striving to identify and eliminate barriers. We empower employees to thrive by fostering a culture of autonomy, productivity, and respect. We are dedicated to creating an environment where individuals can feel welcomed, respected, supported, and valued.&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;We are committed to equity and justice. We welcome different voices and viewpoints and do not discriminate on the basis of race, religion, ancestry, physical and/or mental disability, medical condition, genetic information, marital status, sex, gender, gender identity, gender expression, transgender status, age, sexual orientation, military or veteran status, or any other basis protected by law. We are proud to be an Equal Employment Opportunity employer.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;US Technical Jobs.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;The position you are applying for will require access to technology that is subject to U.S. export control and government contract restrictions.&amp;nbsp; Employment with IonQ is contingent on either verifying “U.S. Person” (e.g., U.S. citizen, U.S. national, U.S. permanent resident, or lawfully admitted into the U.S. as a refugee or granted asylum) status for export controls and government contracts work, obtaining any necessary license, and/or confirming the availability of a license exception under U.S. export controls.&amp;nbsp; Please note that in the absence of confirming you are a U.S. Person for export control and government contracts work purposes, IonQ may choose not to apply for a license or decline to use a license exception (if available) for you to access export-controlled technology that may require authorization, and similarly, you may not qualify for government contracts work that requires U.S. Persons, and IonQ may decline to proceed with your application on those bases alone.&amp;nbsp; Accordingly, we will have some additional questions regarding your immigration status that will be used for export control and compliance purposes, and the answers will be reviewed by compliance personnel to ensure compliance with federal law.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;US Non-Technical Jobs.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Due to applicable export control laws and regulations, candidates must be a U.S. citizen or national, U.S. permanent resident (i.e., current Green Card holder), or lawfully admitted into the U.S. as a refugee or granted asylum. Accordingly, we will have some additional questions regarding your immigration status that will be used for export control and compliance purposes, and the answers will be reviewed by compliance personnel to ensure compliance with federal law.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you are interested in being a part of our team and mission, we encourage you to apply!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We are Ocado Commercial,&lt;/strong&gt; and we are revolutionising online grocery. We partner with the world&#39;s leading retailers, providing our innovative Ocado Smart Platform (OSP) – a powerful blend of automation and software – to elevate their e-commerce capabilities. Join us and be part of a team that&#39;s shaping the future of retail, working with global giants from Kroger to AEON.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Senior Partner Growth Manager role is an exciting opportunity in our Partner Success Team to directly influence the commercial success of our partners, some of the largest retailers in EMEA. This position will require reasonable travel to Saudi Arabia and/or Europe.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Businesses that partner with Ocado come in all shapes and sizes, and leverage our technology in different ways.&amp;nbsp; In this role, you will combine your knowledge of ecommerce, grocery retail, and online marketing with communication skills and analytical abilities to shape and influence how our partners grow online.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Partner Growth Manager will work with the Ocado Partner Account team to drive the growth agenda in our partner’s business, enabling our partners to improve commercial outcomes, grow their customer base, order volume, and overall profitability.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will build effective relationships with key commercial, marketing, and ecommerce stakeholders in our partners’ businesses. You will leverage knowledge of customer objectives, strategic know-how, knowledge of the Ocado Smart Platform (OSP), as well as the expertise of our central growth subject matter experts to create and implement successful growth strategies. You will become a first line of e-commerce growth support, leveraging our team of central subject matter experts for more in-depth support. You will support your internal stakeholders in the region with insights and reporting on growth topics, as well as be a source of information and support for your partners.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As part of the Partner Success Team you will be responsible for&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;supporting our partners in their day to day use of OSP, ensuring that their webshop is configured optimally, using the most impactful OSP features, to drive maximum customer acquisition, retention and basket size.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will consult with partners through both in-depth projects in close collaboration with our Central Growth and/or Technology teams, as well as ongoing optimisation forums aimed at improving their commercial performance. You will leverage data to drive recommendations that improve overall performance.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The Partner Growth Manager is accountable for shaping and delivering growth strategy for their assigned Partner(s), supporting improved commercial outcomes including customer acquisition, retention, order growth and profitability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Works closely with the Partner’s ecommerce, marketing and technology teams and cross-functional Ocado stakeholders to align growth priorities and execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Uses growth, trading and customer data and analytics to understand commercial performance, identify trends and opportunities, and deliver clear, actionable recommendations to Partners and internal stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Accountable for translating Partner growth objectives into clear, prioritised growth initiatives and optimisation opportunities that support long-term commercial success, maximising the potential of the OSP platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Acts as Ocado’s primary growth and ecommerce subject matter expert for the Partner, using deep knowledge of OSP capabilities and growth / go-to-market expertise to shape recommendations on ecommerce configuration, trading, monetisation and customer experience, as well as sustainable marketing and communications adapted to the local competitive landscape&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Owns the Partner relationship for e-commerce and growth OSP roadmap engagement, acting as the named point of contact for, trading, monetisation, customer experience roadmap topic, and, in general, any non-operational topic.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represents Partner growth and ecommerce requirements and priorities into Ocado’s roadmap governance processes, supporting feature discovery with clear problem definition, context and Partner business case and value articulation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitors delivery and adoption of growth-critical features and capabilities, working with internal teams and Partners to maximise realised commercial value and improve utilisation of growth-enabling functionality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identifies and escalates risks, dependencies or delivery issues that may impact the Partner’s ability to realise growth from OSP capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Languages: Fluency in English is essential. Arabic and European languages are highly desirable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bias to action, capable of designing data-driven strategies but also secure implementation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stakeholder, relationship building and networking skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A team player who’s comfortable interacting with Partner teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-motivated with an ability to deliver to deadlines and multi-task under pressure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable dealing with ambiguity and uncertainty&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to handle difficult situations, facing challenges with positivity, confidence and pragmatism&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in one or several of the following fields:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Performance marketing within a direct to consumer business (grocery ecommerce experience a plus)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commercial or trading experience in a direct to consumer business ( grocery ecommerce experience a plus)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Retail management consulting&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity and passion for data-driven marketing, consumer insight, and ecommerce&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with or experience with measuring and optimizing key growth metrics including user growth, conversion, LTV&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe in supporting our people with meaningful, flexible benefits that prioritise well-being and work-life balance. Here’s a snapshot of what you can expect:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Time to recharge&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;br&gt;25 days annual leave (rising to 27 after 5 years), plus the option to buy more – and 30 days a year to work from anywhere in the world.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Health &amp;amp; wellbeing&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;br&gt;Private Medical Insurance from your first month, wellbeing support through specialist apps and EAP, plus Income Protection and Life Assurance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Family-first policies&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;br&gt;22 weeks paid maternity/primary carer leave and 6 weeks paid paternity leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Financial support&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;br&gt;Pension with employer matching up to 7%, share schemes (Sharesave &amp;amp; BAYE), and interest-free loans for train tickets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Commuter perks&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;br&gt;Cycle to Work Scheme and free shuttle buses to/from Hatfield and Welwyn Garden City stations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Exclusive discounts&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;br&gt;15% off at Ocado.com with free delivery (starting in your first month).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Ocado Group is an equal opportunities employer and as such makes every effort to ensure that all potential employees are treated fairly and equally, regardless of their sex, sexual orientation, marital status, race, colour, nationality, ethnic or national origin, religion or belief, age, or disability or union membership status.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h2&gt;About The Opportunity&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our Solution Engineers (f/m/d) are close partners of our sales team and own key components of the sales process, including infrastructural/architectural discovery, collaborative solution design, and technical validation. Solution Engineers may travel up to 50% of the time and will have the opportunity to work with teams worldwide, from visionary brands to innovative digital agencies.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What To Expect?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work directly with our Account Executives to support DACH customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support our sales team in helping prospects understand what’s possible with Contentful and how it compares to older legacy technologies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understand prospects&#39; project requirements, help prospects validate these requirements against our platform, identify and mitigate technical and business risks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create product demonstrations and assist with technical evaluations to demonstrate how our platform solves identified business problems and integrates into a prospect’s technology stack&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate prospect and customer needs and product feedback to product management, marketing, and sales.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Solution Architects and Customer Success Managers to ensure that newly-signed customers successfully implement and launch their projects with Contentful&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What You Need To Be Successful&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in English and German are required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The desire to work in a fast-paced environment, across multiple opportunities and teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3-5 years experience as a Sales/Solution Engineer/Architect or Solution Consultant for a cloud-based, growth-oriented PaaS or SaaS company; or 5-10 years experience as a developer working on digital experience delivery utilising marketing technology platforms focused on CMS, Commerce, Personalisation, etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong presentation skills that demonstrate the ability to clearly and sympathetically convey business and technical knowledge to our varying personas that are both marketing-focused and technical-focused.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience with current web technologies (JavaScript frameworks, static site generators, REST APIs, CDNs, CI/CD, etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A high degree of emotional intelligence to help navigate meetings with multiple customer stakeholders with varying degrees of engagement and influence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A natural curiosity for how technology drives change and how that transfers into business value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Nice To Have&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with a Content Management Platform or similar technology (MarTech).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior experience with solution selling methodologies and/or value-based selling techniques.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding the core concepts of MACH products and Composable architectures and how they relate to Contentful’s product and market position.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;More details about our company benefits can be found at the following link:&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;link__new-tab&quot; href=&quot;https://www.salesforcebenefits.com/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;https://www.salesforcebenefits.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Contentful is now officially part of Salesforce.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Unleash Your Potential&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;When you join Salesforce, you’ll be limitless in all areas of your life. Our benefits and resources support you to find balance and be your best, and our AI agents accelerate your impact so you can do your best. Together, we’ll bring the power of Agentforce to organizations of all sizes and deliver amazing experiences that customers love. Apply today to not only shape the future — but to redefine what’s possible — for yourself, for AI, and the world.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;More details about company benefits can be found at the following link: &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.salesforcebenefits.com&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;https://www.salesforcebenefits.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;If you need reasonable accommodations at any point during the application or interview process, please let your Recruiter know.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Equal Opportunity Statement&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Salesforce is an equal opportunity employer and maintains a policy of non-discrimination with all employees and applicants for employment. What does that mean exactly? It means that at Salesforce, we believe in equality for all. And we believe we can lead the path to equality in part by creating a workplace that’s inclusive, and free from discrimination.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.eeoc.gov/know-your-rights-workplace-discrimination-illegal&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Know your rights: workplace discrimination is illegal.&lt;/a&gt; Any employee or potential employee will be assessed on the basis of merit, competence and qualifications – without regard to race, religion, color, national origin, sex, sexual orientation, gender expression or identity, transgender status, age, disability, veteran or marital status, political viewpoint, or other classifications protected by law. This policy applies to current and prospective employees, no matter where they are in their Salesforce employment journey. It also applies to recruiting, hiring, job assignment, compensation, promotion, benefits, training, assessment of job performance, discipline, termination, and everything in between. Recruiting, hiring, and promotion decisions at Salesforce are fair and based on merit. The same goes for compensation, benefits, promotions, transfers, reduction in workforce, recall, training, and education.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #3e3e3e;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Please be aware of scammers who may fraudulently claim to be from Contentful. These types of fraud can occur through copycat websites, fake email addresses claiming to be from our company, or social media. We do not ask for your personal information, such as bank account numbers, identification numbers, etc., through social media or chat-based apps, nor do we request or send money to purchase business equipment. If you suspect fraud, please report it to your local authorities and contact us at &lt;a ----- ----- &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #3e3e3e;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;with any information you may have.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;By clicking “Apply for this job,” I acknowledge that I have read the “&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.contentful.com/legal/privacy-and-data-protection/privacy-notice-to-candidates/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Contentful’s Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;” and hereby consent to the collection, processing, use, and storage of my personal information as described therein.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;CSQ427R397&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Sr Forward Deployed Engineer (FDE) you will work with customers to build and productionize solutions to their data &amp;amp; AI challenges using the Databricks platform. You will own the architecture, lead design decisions, and implement end-to-end systems spanning data engineering, AI, and application development. We work cross-functionally to shape long-term strategic priorities and initiatives alongside engineering, product, and developer relations. FDEs deliver with customer empathy, integrating with client systems, training, and other technical needs to help customers get most value out of their data.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a hands-on, customer-facing role for builders who thrive at the intersection of technology and business impact. The ideal candidate combines engineering expertise with adaptability, curiosity, and a passion for working with customers and teammates to solve complex problems that drive measurable outcomes. FDEs are billable and know how to complete projects according to specification with exceptional customer empathy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The impact you will have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Production Solution Delivery: Lead impactful customer technical projects by delivering production-grade systems, designing and building reference architectures, custom applications and data ingestion and ML/AI model integration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Transformational Impact: Guide strategic customers as they implement transformational big data projects including end-to-end design, build and deployment of industry-leading big data and AI applications. Work with engagement managers to scope technical delivery work with input from the customer&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Empower Customers: Guide customers on architecture and design; bootstrap or implement customer projects which leads to a customers&#39; successful understanding, evaluation and adoption of Databricks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the Architecture: Lead architecture and design decisions, ensuring solutions are secure, scalable, and aligned with both customer needs and Databricks best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with the Databricks technical team, Project Manager, Architect and Customer team to ensure the technical components of the engagement are delivered to meet customer&#39;s needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with Engineering and Databricks Customer Support to provide product and implementation feedback and to guide rapid resolution for engagement specific product and support issues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Customer Immersion: Embed with customer teams, engaging with stakeholders from technical ICs to executives to deeply understand challenges and deliver impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reusable Assets &amp;amp; Scale: Contribute accelerators, frameworks, and best practices that scale impact across accounts and influence the Databricks product roadmap.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we look for:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6+ years experience in data engineering, data platforms &amp;amp; analytics, or software engineering&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable writing code in either Python, Scala, JavaScript/TypeScript, and modern frameworks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of two or more common Cloud ecosystems (AWS, Azure, GCP) with expertise in at least one&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep experience with distributed computing with Apache Spark™ and knowledge of Spark runtime internals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with CI/CD for production deployments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of MLOps, ML/AI models and AI APIs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and deployment of performant production end-to-end data architectures and applications that combine data pipelines, ML/AI models, and user-facing interfaces.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with technical project delivery - managing scope, timelines and measurable outcomes, translating complex concepts into actionable solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Documentation and white-boarding skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with enterprise clients and managing conflicts across a broad stakeholder range&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build skills in technical areas, and demonstrate curiosity, adaptability, and eagerness to explore new technologies which support the deployment and integration of Databricks-based solutions to complete customer projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Travel to customers 20% of the time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Databricks Certification&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Databricks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Databricks is the Data and AI company. More than 20,000 organizations worldwide — including adidas, AT&amp;amp;T, Bayer, Block, Mastercard, Rivian, Unilever, and 70% of the Fortune 500 — rely on the Databricks Data + AI Platform to build and scale data and AI apps, analytics and agents. Headquartered in San Francisco with 30+ offices around the globe, Databricks offers a unified platform that includes Genie, Lakebase, Agent Bricks, Lakeflow, Lakehouse, and Unity Catalog. To learn more, follow Databricks on &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/databricks&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://x.com/databricks&quot;&gt;X&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/@Databricks&quot;&gt;YouTube&lt;/a&gt;, and &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/databricksinc/?hl=en&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;At Databricks, we strive to provide comprehensive benefits and perks that meet the needs of all of our employees. For specific details on the benefits offered in your region click &lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.google.com/document/d/154un3e8Xav4BceOSlcYFZRGEuQI54xMxVydRwQn54eQ/edit?usp=sharing&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Commitment to Diversity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Databricks, we are committed to fostering a diverse and inclusive culture where everyone can excel. We take great care to ensure that our hiring practices are inclusive and meet equal employment opportunity standards. Individuals looking for employment at Databricks are considered without regard to age, color, disability, ethnicity, family or marital status, gender identity or expression, language, national origin, physical and mental ability, political affiliation, race, religion, sexual orientation, socio-economic status, veteran status, and other protected characteristics.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compliance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;If access to export-controlled technology or source code is required for performance of job duties, it is within Employer&#39;s discretion whether to apply for a U.S. government license for such positions, and Employer may decline to proceed with an applicant on this basis alone.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;FEQ128R99&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; Germany (remote or from a Databricks office – anywhere in Germany) &lt;strong&gt;Languages:&lt;/strong&gt; Fluent German and business-level English&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Databricks, we build the platform that makes data and AI usable across an entire organization. More and more of our customers in Germany – public sector, critical infrastructure (KRITIS), financial services, healthcare, defence and industry – need to keep control over where their data lives and who can access it. They want the full power of the Databricks Data Intelligence Platform without giving up data residency, jurisdictional control or the option to switch providers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Solutions Architect for Digital Sovereignty, you are the technical lead for this motion in Germany. You design sovereign data and AI architectures with customers, run proofs of concept end to end, and help our sovereign cloud partners and account teams turn a proven pattern into production workloads.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;The impact you will have&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the trusted technical advisor on digital sovereignty for strategic and regulated customers across Germany, from the first conversation with the CIO/CISO through to production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and validate sovereign reference architectures&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run complex proofs of concept and pilots – performance, scalability, security and network connectivity tests with different data volumes – and translate the results into clear go/no-go recommendations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work hand in hand with sovereign cloud and storage partners: joint solution design, enablement of partner technical teams, co-selling and joint customer workshops.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Position Databricks clearly in the sovereignty discussion – CLOUD Act, GDPR, NIS2, DORA, BSI C5, EU Data Act, open formats and exit strategies – and articulate how our open architecture reduces lock-in compared with competing approaches.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Feed field requirements back to Databricks Product and Engineering, and collaborate with Legal, Security and Compliance on customer questions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build repeatable assets: reference architectures, demos, PoC playbooks, Terraform/automation templates and customer-facing collateral in German and English.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build Databricks&#39; visibility on sovereignty in the German market through workshops, meetups, webinars and conference talks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Turn customer conversations into working prototypes fast, using AI-assisted development to build demos in hours rather than weeks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What we look for&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent German and business-level English. Both are used daily with customers, partners and internally.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Substantial experience in technical pre-sales, solution architecture or consulting, including complex enterprise customer interactions across the full sales lifecycle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with data platforms in at least one major public cloud (Azure, AWS or GCP), ideally including Apache Spark and/or Databricks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid understanding of cloud infrastructure: networking (private connectivity, VPN, private endpoints), identity and access management, encryption and key management (BYOK/HYOK).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with object storage and open table formats (S3-compatible storage such as MinIO, Delta Lake, Apache Iceberg) and with secure data sharing patterns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good working knowledge of the regulatory and sovereignty landscape in Germany and the EU (e.g. GDPR, CLOUD Act implications, NIS2, DORA, BSI C5, KRITIS) and the ability to discuss it confidently with CISOs, data protection officers and procurement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to drive technical and business conversations with C-level executives, orchestrate cross-functional and partner teams, and influence outcomes toward long-term customer success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on coding ability in Python and SQL; infrastructure-as-code experience (e.g. Terraform) is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Daily, fluent use of AI tools in your own work. Coding assistants and agents are part of how you operate, not something you try out occasionally.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to vibe-code a demo: assemble a credible, working prototype for a specific customer problem with AI assistance, and recognize where the output still needs your own judgment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with or for European / sovereign cloud providers, public sector or regulated industries is a strong plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Judgment to prioritize the right use cases and investments, and to navigate a competitive landscape.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to travel within Germany for customer and partner meetings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Why this role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will shape a new, strategically important motion for Databricks in Germany and EMEA – building on a proof of concept that has already delivered results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will work at the intersection of data and AI, cloud infrastructure, regulation and partnerships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will collaborate closely with Field Engineering leadership, Product, and our partner ecosystem.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Databricks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Databricks is the Data and AI company. More than 20,000 organizations worldwide — including adidas, AT&amp;amp;T, Bayer, Block, Mastercard, Rivian, Unilever, and 70% of the Fortune 500 — rely on the Databricks Data + AI Platform to build and scale data and AI apps, analytics and agents. Headquartered in San Francisco with 30+ offices around the globe, Databricks offers a unified platform that includes Genie, Lakebase, Agent Bricks, Lakeflow, Lakehouse, and Unity Catalog. To learn more, follow Databricks on &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/databricks&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://x.com/databricks&quot;&gt;X&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/@Databricks&quot;&gt;YouTube&lt;/a&gt;, and &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/databricksinc/?hl=en&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;At Databricks, we strive to provide comprehensive benefits and perks that meet the needs of all of our employees. For specific details on the benefits offered in your region click &lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.google.com/document/d/154un3e8Xav4BceOSlcYFZRGEuQI54xMxVydRwQn54eQ/edit?usp=sharing&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Commitment to Diversity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Databricks, we are committed to fostering a diverse and inclusive culture where everyone can excel. We take great care to ensure that our hiring practices are inclusive and meet equal employment opportunity standards. Individuals looking for employment at Databricks are considered without regard to age, color, disability, ethnicity, family or marital status, gender identity or expression, language, national origin, physical and mental ability, political affiliation, race, religion, sexual orientation, socio-economic status, veteran status, and other protected characteristics.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compliance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;If access to export-controlled technology or source code is required for performance of job duties, it is within Employer&#39;s discretion whether to apply for a U.S. government license for such positions, and Employer may decline to proceed with an applicant on this basis alone.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. With exceptional talent, trusted data and intelligence, and world-class partnerships – all united by our pioneering agentic marketing platform, WPP Open – we help clients navigate change, capture opportunity, and deliver transformational growth. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is WPP&#39;s AI-driven media operating unit, bringing together media, data, and partnerships to deliver creative personalisation at scale. Connected through WPP Open and powered by Open Intelligence, clients see exactly where, how, and why their media investment is working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;wppmedia.com&quot;&gt;wppmedia.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;WPP steht für kreative Transformation. Mit der Kraft von Kreativität gestalten wir eine bessere Zukunft für unsere Mitarbeitenden, unsere Kunden, unsere Gemeinschaften und unseren Planeten. Genau hier setzt WPP Media an: Als globales Mediennetzwerk von WPP vereinen wir die besten Plattformen, Talente und Partner, um in einer vernetzten Medienwelt neue Chancen für grenzenloses Wachstum zu schaffen.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Das bieten wir dir:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work-Life-Balance&lt;/strong&gt;: Dank flexibler Arbeitszeiten mit Schwerpunkt auf dem persönlichen Austausch im Office und ergänzender Remote Work passt sich dein Job deinem Leben an. Überstunden kannst du flexible ausgleichen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vacation mode on&lt;/strong&gt;: Du erhältst 30 Urlaubstage plus einen flexiblen Tag – zusätzlich sind der 24. und 31.12. frei.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wellbeing first:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Gesundheitsleistungen, attraktive Altersvorsorge sowie Mental Health Awareness Days stellen deine Gesundheit in den Mittelpunkt.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Practice makes perfect&lt;/strong&gt;: Entfalte dich mit unseren vielfältigen Weiterbildungen und nutze unsere internen Karriereprogramme für deine Entwicklung im WPP-Netzwerk.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;More than just a job&lt;/strong&gt;: Dich erwarten unvergessliche Events, Mitarbeitendenrabatte und weitere Highlights wie das Job Ticket, Wellhub oder das Job Bike.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Be yourself&lt;/strong&gt;: Bei uns ist jede:r herzlich willkommen - Vielfalt und Chancengleichheit liegen uns am Herzen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Das bewegst du:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Als &lt;strong&gt;Werkstudent (Mensch)&lt;/strong&gt; für unseren Kunden &lt;strong&gt;Google&lt;/strong&gt; tauchst du tief in die Welt der Daten ein, unterstützt unser Team bei wichtigen Routineaufgaben und lernst dabei von Grund auf, wie das Media-Geschäft funktioniert – idealerweise hast du noch einige Semester vor dir und Lust auf eine langfristige Zusammenarbeit.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reportings &amp;amp; Templates:&lt;/strong&gt; Routiniert pflegst und erstellst du umfangreiche Auswertungen in Google Sheets (ähnlich wie Excel)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Zahlen im Fokus:&lt;/strong&gt; Tagtäglich arbeitest du mit großen Datenmengen und stellst sicher, dass alle Informationen für unseren Kunden Google präzise und aktuell erfasst sind.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualitätssicherung:&lt;/strong&gt; Gewissenhaft übernimmst du das Gegenlesen von Dokumenten und sorgst durch deine Detailverliebtheit für fehlerfreie Ergebnisse im Team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Media-Wissen:&lt;/strong&gt; Schritt für Schritt erhältst du durch deine täglichen Aufgaben Einblicke in die Mediaplanung und Optimierung der Kampagnen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Präsentationssupport:&lt;/strong&gt; Zudem unterstützt du bei der Erstellung von Präsentationsunterlagen, damit das Team im direkten Kundenkontakt perfekt aufgestellt ist.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Routine mit System:&lt;/strong&gt; Verlässlich wickelst du standardisierte Prozesse ab und bildest mit deiner extrem genauen Arbeitsweise das wichtige Rückgrat für das Tagesgeschäft.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Das zeichnet dich aus:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Studium:&lt;/strong&gt; Du bist eingeschriebene:r Student:in, idealerweise in den Bereichen Marketing, Medien, Wirtschaftswissenschaften oder Informatik.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Datenliebe:&lt;/strong&gt; Eine große Leidenschaft für Zahlen und Analysen bringst du mit, was dir den Umgang mit umfangreichen Datensätzen und Reportings spürbar leicht macht.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Akribische Arbeitsweise:&lt;/strong&gt; Sehr genaues, strukturiertes und detailorientiertes Arbeiten ist für dich selbstverständlich.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Studienzeit:&lt;/strong&gt; Idealerweise hast du noch einige Semester in deinem Studium vor dir, sodass wir langfristig für 20 Stunden pro Woche aufeinander zählen können.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sprachtalent:&lt;/strong&gt; Verhandlungssicheres Englisch ist für diesen Kunden ein Muss.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tool-Kenntnisse:&lt;/strong&gt; Gutes Vorwissen in Microsoft Excel und ein Verständnis für Formeln bringst du bereits mit, verbunden mit der Lust, dich in Google Sheets einzuarbeiten.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Darüber hinaus bist du: &lt;strong&gt;#zahlenaffin #akkurat #zuverlässig #strukturiert&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Wenn du diesen Job spannend findest, dann ermutigen wir dich ausdrücklich zur Bewerbung, auch wenn du nicht jede oben gelistete Qualifikation aufweisen kannst.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Arbeiten bei WPP Media:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Als WPP Media gestalten wir die Zukunft der Medien und investieren dabei konsequent in unsere Mitarbeiter:innen. Jede:r Kolleg:in genießt die Vorteile des globalen Netzwerks von WPP Media und WPP, um sich weiterzuentwickeln&amp;nbsp;und an der Spitze von Marketing und Werbung zu lernen. Vielfalt und Zusammenhalt leben wir durch zahlreiche Employee Resource Groups und regelmäßige interne Events - zum Austausch, zur Inspiration und zum gemeinsamen Feiern unserer Erfolge.&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;WPP Media ist ein Arbeitgeber, der Chancengleichheit fördert. Wir berücksichtigen alle Bewerber:innen für alle Positionen ohne Diskriminierung. Unser Ziel ist eine Kultur des Respekts und der Zugehörigkeit, in der jede:r die gleichen Möglichkeiten hat, sich einzubringen und beruflich zu wachsen. (ID: 12581)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bitte lies unsere &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy&quot;&gt;Datenschutzerklärung&lt;/a&gt; für Deutschland, Österreich und die Schweiz, um weitere Informationen darüber zu erhalten, wie wir die von dir bereitgestellten Daten verarbeiten.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;Please read our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy#:~:text=WPP%20Media%20Privacy%20Notice%20for%20Recruitment&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. With exceptional talent, trusted data and intelligence, and world-class partnerships – all united by our pioneering agentic marketing platform, WPP Open – we help clients navigate change, capture opportunity, and deliver transformational growth. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is WPP&#39;s AI-driven media operating unit, bringing together media, data, and partnerships to deliver creative personalisation at scale. Connected through WPP Open and powered by Open Intelligence, clients see exactly where, how, and why their media investment is working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;wppmedia.com&quot;&gt;wppmedia.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Wir bei T&amp;amp;P verstehen uns als datengetriebene Kommunikationsagentur, deren Mission es ist, Kreativität, Technologie und Daten auf neue, aufregende und effektive Weise zu verknüpfen. Wir nennen es das &amp;amp;Modell und die Prämisse ist einfach: Kreation, Strategie, Media und Daten/CRM arbeiten Hand in Hand und lösen Herausforderungen als ein Team, das nah und partnerschaftlich mit dem Kunden zusammenarbeitet.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Das bieten wir dir:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work-Life-Balance&lt;/strong&gt;: Dank flexibler Arbeitszeiten mit Schwerpunkt auf dem persönlichen Austausch im Office und ergänzender Remote Work passt sich dein Job deinem Leben an. Überstunden kannst du flexible ausgleichen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vacation mode on&lt;/strong&gt;: Du erhältst 30 Urlaubstage plus einen flexiblen Tag – zusätzlich sind der 24. und 31.12. frei.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wellbeing first:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Gesundheitsleistungen, attraktive Altersvorsorge sowie Mental Health Awareness Days stellen deine Gesundheit in den Mittelpunkt.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Practice makes perfect&lt;/strong&gt;: Entfalte dich mit unseren vielfältigen Weiterbildungen und nutze unsere internen Karriereprogramme für deine Entwicklung im WPP-Netzwerk.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;More than just a job&lt;/strong&gt;: Dich erwarten unvergessliche Events, Mitarbeitendenrabatte und weitere Highlights wie das Job Ticket, Wellhub oder das Job Bike.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Be yourself&lt;/strong&gt;: Bei uns ist jede:r herzlich willkommen - Vielfalt und Chancengleichheit liegen uns am Herzen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Das bewegst du:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;x_elementToProof&quot; data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;Als &lt;strong&gt;Senior Social Media Manager &lt;/strong&gt;übernimmst du den strategischen Lead für die Kanäle etablierter Marken: Von der Redaktionsleitung über zielgerichtete Kampagnen bis zur fachlichen Führung deines Accounts verwandelst du Ideen in reichweitenstarken Content mit messbarem Impact.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Content-Lead &amp;amp; Redaktionsplanung:&lt;/strong&gt; Du entwickelst kanalübergreifende Social Media-Strategien und Content-Konzepte.&amp;nbsp;Die übergeordnete redaktionelle Verantwortung liegt in deinen Händen. Von strategischen Themenplänen und Kanal-Positionierungen bis hin zu Content-Pillars steuerst du Workflows und verantwortest die kanalübergreifende Qualitätssicherung (Meta, TikTok, LinkedIn, YouTube etc.).&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Kreativ-Lead &amp;amp; Brand Voice: &lt;/strong&gt;Als Expert:in für alle Plattformen arbeitest du im engen Sparring mit Art &amp;amp; Copy. Du führst und entwickelst die Kanäle in der passenden Tonalitäten, bringst komplexe Themen treffsicher auf den Punkt und gibst als Reviewer wertvolles Feedback.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Plattform-Trends &amp;amp; First-Mover:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Du hast ein Gespür für Plattform-Updates, Algorithmen, Sounds und Popkultur-Trends, &amp;nbsp;antizipierst sie vorausschauend und integrierst sie strategisch in die Redaktionsplanung. Du leitest relevante First-Mover-Konzepte ab und machst markenadäquates Trend-Jacking zur strategischen Stärke.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Community-Strategie: &lt;/strong&gt;Neben der Konzeption professioneller Community-Guidelines begleitest du anspruchsvolle Markendialoge mit diplomatischem Fingerspitzengefühl und baust gezielt Brand-Communities auf.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Performance &amp;amp; Paid Social: &lt;/strong&gt;Du übernimmst die End-to-End-Verantwortung für deine Social KPIs, übersetzt Daten in klare strategische Handlungsempfehlungen für Kundentermine und stimmst Kampagnen sowie Budgets auf Meta, TikTok oder LinkedIn gemeinsam mit den Media-Teams ab.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;x_elementToProof&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mentoring &amp;amp; Team-Development: &lt;/strong&gt;Mit deiner Erfahrung leitest du Junior- und Mid-Level Kolleg:innen fachlich an, begleitest ihr Onboarding und förderst den kontinuierlichen Wissenstransfer.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Das zeichnet dich aus:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;Fundierte Berufserfahrung:&lt;/strong&gt; Mindestens 4–6 Jahre Erfahrung im Social Media Management und in der Content-Strategie (von Vorteil: Agenturumfeld o. auf etablierter Markenseite) sowie nachweisbare Erfolge in der Führung reichweitenstarker Multichannel-Accounts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategie- &amp;amp; Redaktionssicherheit:&lt;/strong&gt; Routinierter und strukturierter Umgang mit komplexen Redaktionsabläufen, kanalübergreifenden Workflows und anspruchsvollen Freigabeprozessen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Kreativgespür &amp;amp; Sparring:&lt;/strong&gt; Führungs- und Moderationsstärke, ausgeprägte Kooperationsfähigkeit sowie ein Gespür für Storytelling und integrierte Kampagnenansätze.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Kommunikationsstärke:&lt;/strong&gt; Stilsicheres Text- und Schreibtalent mit verhandlungssicherem Deutsch (C1-C2-Niveau) und fließendem Englisch (C1) sowie viel Feingefühl im Markendialog.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Plattform- &amp;amp; Tool-Know-how: &lt;/strong&gt;Ausgeprägte Expertise im Umgang mit Meta Business Suite sowie gängigen Social Media Marketing Tools. Tiefes Verständnis der Plattformlogiken von TikTok, Instagram, Facebook, LinkedIn und YouTube sowie deren Auswirkungen auf Content-Strategie und Performance.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analytics &amp;amp; Paid-Social-Know-how: &lt;/strong&gt;Starkes Zahlenverständnis, sichere Anwendung gängiger Social-Analytics-Tools und C-Level-Präsentationen sowie ein fundiertes Verständnis für das Zusammenspiel von Paid und Organic für einen smarten Budgeteinsatz.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mentoring-Mindset:&lt;/strong&gt; Motivation und Freude daran, Kolleg:innen fachlich zu coachen und zu fördern.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Darüber hinaus bist du:&lt;strong&gt; #proaktiv #kommunikativ #motiviert&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Wenn du diesen Job spannend findest, dann ermutigen wir dich ausdrücklich zur Bewerbung, auch wenn du nicht jede oben gelistete Qualifikation aufweisen kannst.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Arbeiten bei WPP Media:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Als WPP Media gestalten wir die Zukunft der Medien und investieren dabei konsequent in unsere Mitarbeiter:innen. Jede:r Kolleg:in genießt die Vorteile des globalen Netzwerks von WPP Media und WPP, um sich weiterzuentwickeln&amp;nbsp;und an der Spitze von Marketing und Werbung zu lernen. Vielfalt und Zusammenhalt leben wir durch zahlreiche Employee Resource Groups und regelmäßige interne Events - zum Austausch, zur Inspiration und zum gemeinsamen Feiern unserer Erfolge.&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;WPP Media ist ein Arbeitgeber, der Chancengleichheit fördert. Wir berücksichtigen alle Bewerber:innen für alle Positionen ohne Diskriminierung. Unser Ziel ist eine Kultur des Respekts und der Zugehörigkeit, in der jede:r die gleichen Möglichkeiten hat, sich einzubringen und beruflich zu wachsen.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bitte lies unsere &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy&quot;&gt;Datenschutzerklärung&lt;/a&gt; für Deutschland, Österreich und die Schweiz, um weitere Informationen darüber zu erhalten, wie wir die von dir bereitgestellten Daten verarbeiten.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Promoted 14125&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;Please read our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy#:~:text=WPP%20Media%20Privacy%20Notice%20for%20Recruitment&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. With exceptional talent, trusted data and intelligence, and world-class partnerships – all united by our pioneering agentic marketing platform, WPP Open – we help clients navigate change, capture opportunity, and deliver transformational growth. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is WPP&#39;s AI-driven media operating unit, bringing together media, data, and partnerships to deliver creative personalisation at scale. Connected through WPP Open and powered by Open Intelligence, clients see exactly where, how, and why their media investment is working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;wppmedia.com&quot;&gt;wppmedia.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;EssenceMediacom eine neue Art von Medienagentur und eine der führenden Marken der WPP Media. Auf der Grundlage von Analysen und Erkenntnissen und angetrieben durch Daten und Technologie glauben wir an die Kraft von Medien und Kreativität, um den besten Marken der Welt zum Durchbruch zu verhelfen. Wir sind für die neue Kommunikationswirtschaft konzipiert - für Menschen und Algorithmen, mit unterschiedlichen Denkansätzen, um in großem Maßstab zu testen und zu lernen, und vor allem, um sich weiterzuentwickeln.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Das bieten wir dir:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work-Life-Balance&lt;/strong&gt;: Dank flexibler Arbeitszeiten mit Schwerpunkt auf dem persönlichen Austausch im Office und ergänzender Remote Work passt sich dein Job deinem Leben an. Überstunden kannst du flexible ausgleichen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vacation mode on&lt;/strong&gt;: Du erhältst 30 Urlaubstage plus einen flexiblen Tag – zusätzlich sind der 24. und 31.12. frei.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wellbeing first:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Gesundheitsleistungen, attraktive Altersvorsorge sowie Mental Health Awareness Days stellen deine Gesundheit in den Mittelpunkt.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Practice makes perfect&lt;/strong&gt;: Entfalte dich mit unseren vielfältigen Weiterbildungen und nutze unsere internen Karriereprogramme für deine Entwicklung im WPP-Netzwerk.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;More than just a job&lt;/strong&gt;: Dich erwarten unvergessliche Events, Mitarbeitendenrabatte und weitere Highlights wie das Job Ticket, Wellhub oder das Job Bike.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Be yourself&lt;/strong&gt;: Bei uns ist jede:r herzlich willkommen - Vielfalt und Chancengleichheit liegen uns am Herzen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Das bewegst du:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Als &lt;strong&gt;Senior Media Consultant (Mensch)&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;bist du strategische:r Hauptansprechpartner:in und Sparringspartner:in für unsere Kundinnen und Kunden. Du übernimmst die Verantwortung für anspruchsvolle Mandate, steuerst komplexe Medienprojekte und treibst die strategische Weiterentwicklung unserer Kundenbeziehungen aktiv voran.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategische Kundenberatung:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Du berätst deine Kunden souverän auf Entscheiderebene, verstehst deren Business-Ziele tiefgreifend und etablierst langfristige, vertrauensvolle Partnerschaften.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategieentwicklung &amp;amp; Innovation:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Du verantwortest die Entwicklung maßgeschneiderter, datengestützter und zukunftsfähiger Omnichannel-Mediastrategien und setzt proaktiv Impulse bei Trend- und Fokusthemen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ganzheitliches Kampagnenmanagement:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Du steuerst und optimierst komplexe, medienübergreifende Werbekampagnen von der Konzeption über die Exekution bis hin zur Nachbereitung und Ableitung von Learning-Frameworks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Markt- &amp;amp; Wettbewerbsanalyse:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Du analysierst Markt- und Wettbewerbsdynamiken vorausschauend, identifizierst neue Marktchancen und übersetzt Insights in konkrete Wachstumspotenziale für deine Kunden.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Budgetverantwortung &amp;amp; Performance:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Du verantwortest und steuerst auch umfangreiche Werbebudgets zielgerichtet, um den ROI deiner Kunden kontinuierlich zu maximieren.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Schnittstelle &amp;amp; Mentoring:&lt;/strong&gt; Als zentrale Schnittstelle begleitest du Kampagnen über ihren gesamten Lifecycle hinweg, bringst interne Fachbereiche zusammen und stehst Nachwuchskräften im Team als Sparringspartner:in und Mentor:in zur Seite.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Das zeichnet dich aus:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mehrjährige Berufserfahrung:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Du bringst fundierte, mehrjährige Erfahrung (ca. 4+ Jahre) in der Mediaplanung, der Agenturwelt oder im Medienberatungsumfeld mit und verweist auf nachweisbare Erfolge in der eigenständigen Führung komplexer Etats.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Exzellentes Markt- &amp;amp; Trendverständnis:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Du kennst die Mediendynamiken (Digital &amp;amp; Klassik) im Detail, behältst neue Technologien im Blick und verstehst es, Marktveränderungen gewinnbringend zu nutzen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategische Beratungskompetenz:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Du überzeugst durch ausgeprägtes Business-Verständnis, Verhandlungsgeschick und die Fähigkeit, vielschichtige Kundenbedürfnisse in erfolgreiche Media-Roadmaps zu übersetzen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Starke Analytik &amp;amp; ROI-Fokus:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Der sichere Umgang mit komplexen Kennzahlen und Datenanalysen ist für dich selbstverständlich – du leitest daraus präzise Handlungsempfehlungen ab.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Überzeugende Präsentationsstärke:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Du pitchst und präsentierst souverän auf C-Level, fesselst dein Publikum mit starkem Storytelling und überzeugst durch deine authentische, gewinnende Art&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Darüber hinaus bist du:&lt;/strong&gt; #strategisch #lösungsorientiert #innovativ&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Wenn du diesen Job spannend findest, dann ermutigen wir dich ausdrücklich zur Bewerbung, auch wenn du nicht jede oben gelistete Qualifikation aufweisen kannst.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Arbeiten bei WPP Media:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Als WPP Media gestalten wir die Zukunft der Medien und investieren dabei konsequent in unsere Mitarbeiter:innen. Jede:r Kolleg:in genießt die Vorteile des globalen Netzwerks von WPP Media und WPP, um sich weiterzuentwickeln&amp;nbsp;und an der Spitze von Marketing und Werbung zu lernen. Vielfalt und Zusammenhalt leben wir durch zahlreiche Employee Resource Groups und regelmäßige interne Events - zum Austausch, zur Inspiration und zum gemeinsamen Feiern unserer Erfolge.&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;WPP Media ist ein Arbeitgeber, der Chancengleichheit fördert. Wir berücksichtigen alle Bewerber:innen für alle Positionen ohne Diskriminierung. Unser Ziel ist eine Kultur des Respekts und der Zugehörigkeit, in der jede:r die gleichen Möglichkeiten hat, sich einzubringen und beruflich zu wachsen.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bitte lies unsere &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy&quot;&gt;Datenschutzerklärung&lt;/a&gt; für Deutschland, Österreich und die Schweiz, um weitere Informationen darüber zu erhalten, wie wir die von dir bereitgestellten Daten verarbeiten. #LI-Promoted (ID: 14205)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;Please read our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy#:~:text=WPP%20Media%20Privacy%20Notice%20for%20Recruitment&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;elementToProof&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Veeam is the Data and AI Trust Company, specializing in helping organizations ensure their data and AI are fully understood, secured, and resilient to enable the acceleration of safe AI at scale. As the market leader in both data resilience and data security posture management, Veeam is built for the convergence of identity, data, security, and AI risk. Headquartered in Seattle with offices in more than 30 countries, Veeam protects over 550,000 customers worldwide, who trust Veeam to keep their businesses running. Join us as we go fearlessly forward together, growing, learning, and making a real impact for some of the world’s biggest brands.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Über die Position&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Als&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Account Executive Commercial&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;bist du dafür verantwortlich, in deinem zugewiesenen Markt Geschäftsmöglichkeiten im öffentlichen Sektort zu entwickeln und erfolgreich abzuschließen – in enger Zusammenarbeit mit unserem Partnervertrieb. Der Schwerpunkt liegt auf der Identifikation, Entwicklung und Beschleunigung von Vertriebschancen gemeinsam mit unseren Partnern sowie auf der erfolgreichen Realisierung von Abschlüssen und Up- und Cross-Selling-Potenzialen.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Standort: Raum Frankfurt &lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;oder&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt; Raum Hamburg&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Dein Tätigkeitsfeld&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Entwicklung und erfolgreicher Abschluss von Geschäftsmöglichkeiten mit definierten Kunden&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Zusammenarbeit mit Partnern zur erfolgreichen Umsetzung von Vertriebsabschlüssen bei deren Endkunden&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Aktive Neukundenansprache, einschließlich Kaltakquise, zur Entwicklung von Vertriebsaktivitäten mit einer Vielzahl neuer Endkunden im Mid-Market- und gehobenen Kundensegment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identifikation und Umsetzung von Up-Selling- und Cross-Selling-Potenzialen innerhalb des bestehenden Kundenstamms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pflege von Forecasts sowie Account- und Opportunity-Informationen in Salesforce&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vorschlag, Koordination und Teilnahme an Marketingaktivitäten im definierten Vertriebsgebiet&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;Dein Profil&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Erfahrung im direkten Vertrieb und in der Neukundengewinnung&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Erfahrung mit Anbietern aus den Bereichen Virtualisierung, Cloud und SaaS ist von Vorteil&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Erfahrung im Vertrieb über Partnerkanäle sowie im Direktvertrieb&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Nachweisbare Erfolge im Vertrieb an IT-Infrastruktur-Spezialisten&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ausgeprägte Fähigkeit, neue Vertriebschancen zu entwickeln&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Eigeninitiative sowie die Fähigkeit, sich schnell in neue Themen einzuarbeiten&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hohe Motivation, Energie und Abschlussorientierung im Vertrieb&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Freude an einem dynamischen Arbeitsumfeld, in dem sich Rollen und Verantwortlichkeiten schnell verändern können&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reisebereitschaft von mindestens 50 %&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gültiger Führerschein der Klasse B&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Verhandlungssichere Deutsch- und Englischkenntnisse&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Unsere Benefits:&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Umfassende finanzielle Absicherung&amp;nbsp;– Betriebliche Altersvorsorge, Lebensversicherung und Unfallversicherung zum Schutz für Sie und Ihre Familie&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Großzügige Auszeiten&amp;nbsp;– 30 Urlaubstage pro Jahr sowie unternehmensweite&amp;nbsp;VeeaMe Days&amp;nbsp;für Erholung, Wohlbefinden und Self-Care&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Unterstützung für Wohlbefinden und mentale Gesundheit&amp;nbsp;– Zugang zu vertraulicher Beratung und professionellen Unterstützungsangeboten im Rahmen unseres Employee Assistance Program für Mitarbeitende und deren Familien&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engagement über den Arbeitsplatz hinaus&amp;nbsp;– Bezahlte Freistellung für ehrenamtliches Engagement im Rahmen des&amp;nbsp;Veeam Cares&amp;nbsp;Programms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gesundheits- und Wellnessleistungen&amp;nbsp;– Angebote zur Unterstützung Ihrer Gesundheit und Ihres Wohlbefindens, damit Sie beruflich und privat erfolgreich sein können&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Weitere Lifestyle-Vorteile&amp;nbsp;– Zusätzliche Benefits und mitarbeiterfreundliche Angebote, die Ihr Wohlbefinden im Alltag unterstützen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;Please note: If an applicant is permanently located outside of Germany, Veeam reserves the right to decline the application for this position. #LI-CA1 #LI-REMOTE&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;div data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 [&amp;quot;ul&amp;quot;,null,&amp;quot;li&amp;quot;,{&amp;quot;style&amp;quot;:null,&amp;quot;checked&amp;quot;:null,&amp;quot;value&amp;quot;:null,&amp;quot;displayValue&amp;quot;:null,&amp;quot;backgroundColor&amp;quot;:null,&amp;quot;color&amp;quot;:null,&amp;quot;listStyleType&amp;quot;:null}]&quot; data-en-clipboard=&quot;true&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-local-id=&quot;56095010243a&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot; data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;mark&quot; data-prosemirror-mark-name=&quot;strong&quot;&gt;Veeam Software is an equal opportunity employer&lt;/strong&gt; and does not tolerate discrimination in any form on the basis of race, color, religion, gender, age, national origin, citizenship, disability, veteran status or any other classification protected by federal, state or local law. All your information will be kept confidential.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Personal data collected during the recruitment process will be processed in accordance with our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.veeam.com/legal/recruiting-privacy-notice.html&quot;&gt;Recruiting Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;, which explains how your information is collected, used, and handled in connection with hiring activities. By applying for this position, you consent to this processing.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By submitting your application, you confirm that the information provided, including any supporting documents, is complete and accurate to the best of your knowledge. Any misrepresentation, omission, or falsification may result in disqualification from consideration or, if discovered after employment begins, termination of employment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a id=&quot;app&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;sc-gEkIjz cjtSrT MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 sc-hoLEA&quot;&gt;Raisin is the world’s leading platform for savings and investment products. Founded in 2012, the&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;FinTech&lt;/strong&gt; connects consumers with banks in the EU, the UK and the US. This gives consumers &lt;strong&gt;better interest rates&lt;/strong&gt; and banks a &lt;strong&gt;diversified form of refinancing&lt;/strong&gt;. Our vision is to offer savings and investments without barriers and thus open up the global 160 trillion euro market.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;sc-gEkIjz cjtSrT MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 sc-hoLEA&quot;&gt;Raisin currently employs more than 800 people from over 75 countries worldwide. Today, the platform holds over 80 billion euros in assets from&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;more than one million investors&lt;/strong&gt; which have accrued over 5 billion euros in returns.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Raisin helps customers grow their wealth through savings and investments without barriers. But even the best products and the smoothest experience lose their value if customers pay more tax than they need to, or have to work out, declare and settle their taxes themselves. The Customer Taxation Team makes sure they don’t.&amp;nbsp; We design how tax works in Raisin’s tax-advantaged products, a growing part of our offer. Examples include the new Raisin Cash ISA in the UK and the Raisin Kinderdepot, a children’s investment account that uses the child’s tax allowances automatically. We also calculate and withhold tax on the interest and returns customers earn, handle their tax exemption orders and non-assessment certificates, and provide the annual tax documents they need for their tax return. And we send the tax reports that authorities require.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Raisin is available in many European countries, each with its own tax rules and reporting duties. As new regulations come to our platform, we make sure Raisin complies. You will lead a cross-functional team and work closely with Legal, Compliance, Country Management, Product Operations, Customer Service, Data, and external tax and banking partners. Our goal is for customers to trust that their tax is right, find it easy to manage, use the tax allowances they are entitled to, and have peace of mind.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will own a regulated domain that customers depend on every tax year. Working with an experienced Engineering Lead, you will become the go-to expert for customer taxation at Raisin.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own customer taxation end to end: Define the vision and roadmap together with Product and Engineering leadership. Take each topic from discovery to delivery to measured impact. Decide what we build first, and keep stakeholders aligned on priorities, risks and trade-offs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Keep tax accurate and reliable: Agree with Legal, Compliance and country managers on what correct looks like. Work with Engineering so calculation, documents and reporting stay stable and easy to extend.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Grow Raisin’s tax proposition: Shape how tax works when Raisin enters new markets, launches tax-advantaged products or brings on new partners. Find where we can take tax work off customers’ hands, so they don’t have to declare and settle it themselves.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Turn complex rules into simple experiences: Translate the &amp;nbsp;tax rules behind each launch into clear requirements with the edge cases covered. Design the customer experience and see the work through to delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hit the deadlines that cannot move: Make sure annual tax documents and statutory reports go out correct and on time, working with Product Operations. Plan backwards from fixed dates and monitor data quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Catch errors before they reach customers, and escalate early when a date is at risk.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Make tax effortless for customers: Keep self-service for tax exemption orders and non-assessment certificates intuitive, so customers get them right the first time. Give Customer Service the tools to answer tax questions fast, especially around tax season.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shape the team culture: Give and ask for feedback openly, share wins with the team, and treat mistakes as a reason to fix the process.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Profile&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Must haves:&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of product management experience, including ownership of a technical product such as a back-end, platform or data-heavy service.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading a cross-functional product team and getting engineers and stakeholders behind shared priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience launching new products or taking products into new markets, with the precision to get every edge case right, because one wrong tax rule can affect thousands of customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical skills and the habit of checking and reconciling numbers yourself.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Curiosity about tax and a drive to make it feel easy for customers, even when the rules behind it are not.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to learn fast, take feedback well and change course when new facts come in.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Energy, a strong work ethic and a hands-on attitude to detailed work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear, structured written English, and the confidence to explain trade-offs to senior leaders and say no with a reason.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Nice to haves:&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in a regulated field such as banking, payments, insurance or tax technology.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong knowledge of the tax regime in one or more of Raisin’s markets, for example Germany (Abgeltungsteuer, tax exemption orders), or of statutory reporting such as CRS. Tax knowledge is not required. We will teach you.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have built tools for operations or customer service teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Important attributes for this role:&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You bridge product and engineering. You are comfortable discussing data models and architecture trade-offs, and you push for practical solutions that scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join our mission, join our team – and grow with us!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Raisin, we care about each other and it is one of our top priorities to foster an open and caring environment in which everyone feels welcome and comfortable. Our culture is strongly driven by our ambitious team, which connects more than 75 different nationalities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As part of our team, you will benefit from&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee Development Budget of €2,000 and four full training days per year.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible working hours, home office and 30 vacation days.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A company pension scheme (Betriebliche Altersvorsorge), which we support with 20%.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy more than 50+ different sports with Urban Sports Club: We subsidize your membership with more than €20 per month.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Do you miss being in the office? The Deutschland Ticket gets you there, which we subsidize with €25 per month.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Love cycling? With JobRad, lease the bike of your choice and enjoy tax savings, plus Raisin covers your monthly insurance costs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hungry all the time? Snacks, daily fresh fruit as well as drinks provided at the office.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are moving from another country or city to join us? We may support your relocation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.raisin.com/corporate/raisin-applicant-privacy-policy/&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Raisin Applicant Privacy Policy&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;728&quot; data-end=&quot;900&quot;&gt;We value diversity and the unique experiences each individual brings. If you’re excited about this role but don’t meet every requirement, we still encourage you to apply.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;907&quot; data-end=&quot;1013&quot;&gt;We are an equal opportunity employer and are committed to creating an inclusive environment for everyone, regardless of race, colour, ancestry, religion, sex, national origin, sexual orientation, age, citizenship, marital status, disability, or gender identity.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Scientist | Semiconductor Metrology&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Abingdon, UK&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reward and Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;£42,000 - £55,000 (depending on experience)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Annual bonus, 3x salary death in service benefit and private health care BUPA, EMI Share scheme.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you are a Data Scientist who enjoys turning instrument data into proof of what is possible, why not join us in Abingdon, Oxfordshire, and help prove the analysis methods behind advanced semiconductor metrology systems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for an ambitious and adaptable Data Scientist to join our new Data Science team in the Technology department, reporting to the Data Science Lead and working closely with our Modelling Scientist. You will generate and curate data, develop and test new algorithms, and benchmark them against what the instrument can physically deliver. When a method proves itself, you will package it for the Data Analysis team in Engineering, who turn it into robust product software. You will work with real customer use cases and wafer data from Applications Development, and proof-of-concept data from R&amp;amp;D.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are an AI-first team, so you will use AI tools every day, while checking carefully what they produce. If your passion is speed, evidence and finding out what the data can really tell you, we’d love to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll be doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generate synthetic data, and build and maintain the demo and performance data libraries&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyse instrument data to quantify noise and limitations, and help establish the information limit, meaning what is physically extractable from the instrument&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and test new algorithms and analysis methods (for example PCA, percentile methods and machine learning) on real and synthetic data&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Benchmark methods against the information limit: achievable performance, measurement uncertainty, gauge R&amp;amp;R and drift contributors&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write clean, reproducible prototype code with test data and expected performance, ready to hand over to Data Analysis, and build analysis tools used across the Technology department&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use AI tools every day to code, explore, analyse and report faster, verify what they produce, and present your results to the team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Education and experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Degree or above in Physics, Data Science, Applied Mathematics, Engineering or a similar subject, or [2] years’ relevant experience in data science or quantitative research&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills and experience we’re looking for:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data analysis in Python (NumPy, SciPy, pandas, scikit-learn or similar)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Heavy, day-to-day use of AI tools in your technical work, such as coding assistants and LLMs, with the judgement to verify their outputs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Image or signal processing, ideally on data from scientific instruments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Statistics applied to measurement data: uncertainty, repeatability, noise and drift&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Machine learning methods, and how to validate them properly&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear, reproducible code and reports&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Explaining results to technical and non-technical colleagues&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Curious and adaptable, happy to work quickly and test ideas against the evidence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We’d love to see:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Atomic Force Microscopy or other nano-characterisation (SEM, FIB, profilometry), or semiconductor metrology&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Physics-based modelling or simulation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Version control (Git) and C#, and experience building agentic or AI-assisted analysis workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A bit about us:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Infinitesima is a privately owned company founded in 2001, as a spin-out of the University of Bristol, by CTO Professor Andrew Humphris. Our dynamic team of scientists and engineers is focussed on enabling the next generation of semiconductor devices through delivery of innovative products to customers around the world.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our strength lies in the varied perspectives that come from different cultures, experiences, and identities. We believe that true innovation is fuelled by collaboration, locally and globally. We strive to foster an environment where everyone can contribute meaningfully and thrive.&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;If you require adjustments to take part in the recruitment process, please let us know, we’ll do our best to support you.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:210,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:210,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:300}&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your recruitment journey:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:210,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:210,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:300}&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We will interview you: Monday to Friday UK Time 9am to 4.30pm and we&#39;ll be as flexible as we can with Global Scheduling&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:210,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:210,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:300}&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;1st stage:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;(45 minute) Remote meeting to evaluate your experience and technical ability&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;2nd stage:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;(2.5 hours) Face to face onsite evaluating technical, presentation and communication skills along with your ways of working and your opportunity to to know more about us&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;If you&#39;re not comfortable with eye contact, let us know at the start of your interview and if REMOTE, once we&#39;ve said hello, feel free to turn your camera off until the end.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We dress casually so informal attire is absolutely fine for onsite interviews. We want you to feel comfortable when you meet us and if there&#39;s anything else we can do to support your journey, just let us know.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A note on how we use AI:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;We use AI&amp;nbsp;&lt;em&gt;only&lt;/em&gt;&amp;nbsp;to transcribe our interviews so we can focus fully on you instead of scribbling notes. The AI does&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;not&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;take part in any decision making at any stage. All hiring decisions are made by real humans based on the conversation we have with you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location and working pattern:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;We recognise the value of flexibility and offer a hybrid working model wherever possible. Most employees work onsite three days per week, although some positions require a greater onsite presence due to the nature of the work and business need&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Recruitment agencies: Infinitesima Ltd only works with approved agencies and does not accept unsolicited agency CVs. Please do not submit candidate details in response to this advert or solicit any Infinitesima Ltd employees. Infinitesima Ltd is not responsible for any fees related to unsolicited CVs.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Science Lead | Semiconductor Metrology&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Abingdon, UK&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reward and Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;£70,000 - £85,000 (depending on experience)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Annual bonus, 3x salary death in service benefit and private health care BUPA, EMI Share scheme.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you are a Data Science Lead who enjoys turning measurement data into proof of what is possible, why not join us in Abingdon, Oxfordshire, and build and lead the Data Science team behind advanced semiconductor metrology systems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for an ambitious and adaptable Data Science Lead to set up a new Data Science team in our Technology department, reporting to the Technology Director. You will lead a small team, initially a Data Scientist and a Modelling Scientist, and stay hands-on as a working lead data scientist. You will explore and prove new analysis methods, from synthetic data and information-limit studies to modelling, machine learning and AI, to improve the performance of our Metron3D systems and draw more insight from our data.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will work hand in hand with the Data Analysis team in Engineering: you prove what is possible, they make it robust and shippable. You will also collaborate with R&amp;amp;D, System Design Engineering and Applications Development. We are an AI-first team, and you will set the standard for using AI tools well and safely. If your passion is speed, evidence and finding out what the data can really tell you, we’d love to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll be doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead, develop and mentor the Data Science team while staying hands-on, setting priorities and keeping a fast, evidence-based working rhythm&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and deliver the Data Science roadmap: synthetic data, modelling, information-limit studies, algorithm development and data analysis tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish the information limit, meaning what is physically extractable given instrument noise, limitations and tip geometry, and use it as the benchmark for every new method&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Explore, test and benchmark new algorithms (for example PCA, percentile methods and machine learning) on real and synthetic data, covering achievable performance, measurement uncertainty and gauge capability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define the handover to Data Analysis in Engineering (prototype code, test data, acceptance criteria and expected performance), and manage the demo and performance data libraries with Applications Development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use AI tools every day, set the team’s standards for using them well and safely, and track the state of the art in third-party and open-source methods&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Education and experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;MSc or PhD in Physics, Data Science, Applied Mathematics, Engineering or a similar subject, or [8] years’ relevant experience in data science or quantitative research, including some team leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills and experience we’re looking for:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading or mentoring a team of data scientists, scientists or engineers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on data science in Python (NumPy, SciPy, pandas, scikit-learn or similar), turning exploratory work into quantified results&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Heavy, day-to-day use of AI tools in your own technical work, such as coding assistants, LLMs and agentic workflows, with a critical eye for checking their outputs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Image processing, signal processing or statistical analysis of measurement data from scientific instruments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Statistical methods for measurement systems: uncertainty, repeatability, gauge R&amp;amp;R and drift&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Machine learning and/or physics-based modelling, with the judgement to pick the right tool for the problem&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear communication of results to technical and non-technical audiences, with evidence-based recommendations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable setting a roadmap and priorities, and knowing when a result is good enough to hand over&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We’d love to see:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Atomic Force Microscopy or other nano-characterisation (SEM, FIB, profilometry), or semiconductor metrology and process control&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Synthetic data generation or forward modelling of instruments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Building AI-assisted workflows or tooling for a team (agents, automated analysis pipelines, shared prompt libraries), and handing prototypes to software teams to productionise&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A bit about us:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Infinitesima is a privately owned company founded in 2001, as a spin-out of the University of Bristol, by CTO Professor Andrew Humphris. Our dynamic team of scientists and engineers is focussed on enabling the next generation of semiconductor devices through delivery of innovative products to customers around the world.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our strength lies in the varied perspectives that come from different cultures, experiences, and identities. We believe that true innovation is fuelled by collaboration, locally and globally. We strive to foster an environment where everyone can contribute meaningfully and thrive.&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;If you require adjustments to take part in the recruitment process, please let us know, we’ll do our best to support you.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:210,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:210,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:300}&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your recruitment journey:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:210,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:210,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:300}&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We will interview you: Monday to Friday UK Time 9am to 4.30pm and we&#39;ll be as flexible as we can with Global Scheduling&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:210,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:210,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:300}&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;1st stage:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;(45 minute) Remote meeting to evaluate your experience and technical ability&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;2nd stage:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;(2.5 hours) Face to face onsite evaluating technical, presentation and communication skills along with your ways of working and your opportunity to to know more about us&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;If you&#39;re not comfortable with eye contact, let us know at the start of your interview and if REMOTE, once we&#39;ve said hello, feel free to turn your camera off until the end.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We dress casually so informal attire is absolutely fine for onsite interviews. We want you to feel comfortable when you meet us and if there&#39;s anything else we can do to support your journey, just let us know.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A note on how we use AI:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;We use AI&amp;nbsp;&lt;em&gt;only&lt;/em&gt;&amp;nbsp;to transcribe our interviews so we can focus fully on you instead of scribbling notes. The AI does&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;not&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;take part in any decision making at any stage. All hiring decisions are made by real humans based on the conversation we have with you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location and working pattern:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;We recognise the value of flexibility and offer a hybrid working model wherever possible. Most employees work onsite three days per week, although some positions require a greater onsite presence due to the nature of the work and business need&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Recruitment agencies: Infinitesima Ltd only works with approved agencies and does not accept unsolicited agency CVs. Please do not submit candidate details in response to this advert or solicit any Infinitesima Ltd employees. Infinitesima Ltd is not responsible for any fees related to unsolicited CVs.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fospha is the measurement system enterprise retail and ecommerce brands run their business on. We give marketing teams one clear, daily view of what&#39;s actually working — across every channel and everywhere they sell, from their website to Amazon and TikTok Shop — down to the level of a single ad or piece of creative. It replaces guesswork and gut feel with a number marketing, finance and agencies can all trust and act on. Brands including Dyson, Gymshark, Lululemon and many more use Fospha up to 25 times a day to decide where budget should move next. We&#39;ve spent over a decade building this, with more than $40 billion in marketing spend now optimised through the platform - and we&#39;re scaling fast across London, Mumbai and Austin.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Graduate Opportunity at Fospha&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Joining Fospha’s graduate programme means stepping into a fast-paced environment where you’ll gain real responsibility and exposure from day one. In Partnerships, graduates work directly with some of the world’s biggest digital platforms - like TikTok, Meta, and Snapchat - playing a key role in strengthening relationships, enabling joint initiatives, and driving partner success.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hands-on exposure to our Partnerships:&lt;/strong&gt; Working directly with the platforms such as Tiktok, Meta and Snap, you will build commercial acumen, develop strategic communication skills, and gain a deep understanding of how the digital advertising ecosystem works.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Exposure&lt;/strong&gt;: With support, cross-functional collaboration, and the opportunity to make a visible impact early on, it’s the ideal launchpad for ambitious graduates looking to break into the world of ad tech and strategic partnerships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Comprehensive Training&lt;/strong&gt;: In addition to the extensive on-the-job learning opportunities, you&#39;ll receive a broad and blended in-person training curriculum covering essential topics such as Business Storytelling, Relationship Building, Market Research &amp;amp; Product and Financial Management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a &lt;strong&gt;Partnerships Executive&lt;/strong&gt;, you&#39;ll join a high-impact team focused on enabling, scaling, and deepening Fospha’s relationships with the platforms that power digital marketing.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a graduate-level role designed to develop future leaders. You’ll be hands-on with major ad platforms, supporting both strategic execution and day-to-day coordination. You’ll also work closely with internal teams - especially Marketing, Product and our Customer Teams - to make sure our partners have what they need to help customers grow.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Supporting our partner managers in coordinating with Google, Meta, TikTok, Snap and others&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Preparing decks, talking points and training sessions to enable partner sales teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tracking and reporting on partner performance and engagement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Liaising across internal teams to keep initiatives moving and aligned&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Owning communications or enablement efforts for specific territories or smaller partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Researching and initiating contact with emerging or long-tail partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In addition to your core responsibilities, we expect you to be excited by the opportunity Gen AI brings and find new ways of working utilising our Gen Ai hub!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What are we looking for?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We hire for potential – you don’t need a technical degree or marketing background. You should apply if you:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are an excellent communicator – written, verbal, and visual&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are highly organised and detail-oriented&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are curious about how marketing, measurement and partnerships work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Can handle multiple workstreams and work well under light-touch supervision&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Thrive in fast-moving, high-growth environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Want to make a real commercial impact from day one&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus Points For:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with TikTok Ads, Meta, or other digital marketing tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with platforms like Notion, HubSpot, Google Sheets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Any internship or part-time experience in partnerships, sales, marketing or client-facing roles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Like shopping and are a customer of retail brands&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Values and Principles&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be able to demonstrate examples of our core principles:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Seek inclusion &amp;amp; diversity:&lt;/strong&gt; We create an environment where everyone feels welcome, and people are encouraged to speak and be heard&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work Hard, Work Well, Work Together:&lt;/strong&gt; We take responsibility for making things happen, independently and together; we help colleagues in need and close loops, making sure our work is complete and has lasting impact&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Grow&lt;/strong&gt;: We are proactive, curious and unafraid of failure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customer at the heart&lt;/strong&gt;: We care about the customer, feel their pain and love building product that solves their biggest problems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Candour with caring:&lt;/strong&gt; We deliver candid feedback with kindness and receive it with gratitude&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we can offer you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A workplace pension, through Royal London, with Fospha matching your contributions up to 3%&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A £1,000/year flexible benefits allowance to put towards private medical insurance, dental cover, a health cash plan, gym membership, extra holiday, or a pension top-up - whatever suits you!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to Wellhub, giving you one membership across gyms, boutique studios, and wellbeing apps&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;25 days&#39; annual leave plus 8 UK bank holidays, an extra day off for your birthday! and more holiday the longer you stay (26 days after 3 years, 27 after 6)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Life assurance worth 4x your annual salary, from day one&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cycle to Work scheme, plus discounts on everyday spending through our benefits portal — Apple, Tesco, IKEA, M&amp;amp;S, Deliveroo, cinema tickets and more&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Quarterly one-to-one sessions with a financial adviser, plus access to payroll-deducted loans through Salary Finance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paid volunteering days each year&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Regular socials, free weekly snacks, and Lunch &amp;amp; Learn events at our Scale Space office, plus access to the wider Blenheim Chalcot community&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opportunities to travel — including to our India and North America offices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Process&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5-10 minute screening call with a member of the Talent Team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;30-minute Team Screen interview&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Task and Panel interview&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Final Exec interview&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Top tip: Make sure to thoroughly research Fospha and tell us why you would be a great fit for the role!&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;By submitting your CV you understand that we have a legitimate interest to use your personal data for the purposes of assessing your eligibility for this role.&amp;nbsp; This means that we may use your personal data to contact you to discuss your CV or arrange an interview, or transfer your CV to the hiring manager(s) of the role you have applied for.&amp;nbsp; You can ask us at any time to remove your CV from our database by emailing&amp;nbsp;&lt;a ---------- but please note that this means we will no longer consider you for the role you have applied for.&amp;nbsp;You can review our privacy policy&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.blenheimchalcot.com/recruitment-privacy-policy/&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ABOUT NEXGEN CLOUD&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;NexGen Cloud is a fast-growing GPU cloud and AI infrastructure business. We’re the company behind Hyperstack — a self-serve, on-demand cloud platform built for high-performance AI, HPC, and compute-heavy workloads. Powered by 100% renewable energy and NVIDIA architecture, Hyperstack gives teams from AI startups to enterprise the compute they need, without the cost or complexity of legacy cloud.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We move fast, solve hard problems, and build things that matter. If you want ownership, real impact, and a front-row seat to one of the most consequential infrastructure shifts of the decade — this is the place.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THE ROLE: PRODUCT ENGINEER&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our hardest problems don’t stay in one layer. A customer issue can start in a web app and end in a Kubernetes scheduler, a container runtime or a GPU driver. We need engineers who can build the products, APIs and tools our customers use, and who understand the systems underneath well enough to make them work reliably in production.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a role for someone who takes a loosely defined problem, works out what the user actually needs, and owns the solution end to end. That means designing it, writing the code, shipping it, and debugging it when it breaks, without handing it off at the first layer boundary.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU’LL BE DOING&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Rather than a checklist, here’s what success in this role actually looks like:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and drive user-facing products end to end, including web apps, APIs, backend services and CLI tools, mostly in Go. You’ll ship the simplest useful version first, then improve it based on how people actually use it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with Product, Engineering &amp;amp; DevOps, Infrastructure &amp;amp; Data Centre Operations, Security and Customer Support. You’ll turn real customer problems into practical solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain Kubernetes-based services, controllers and platform capabilities. This includes GPU scheduling and container runtimes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify repetitive operational work and replace it with automation, so software handles it instead of people.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Investigate production issues across application code, Kubernetes, containers, Linux, networking, drivers and hardware. Each incident should end in a lasting fix, a guardrail or better tooling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design services that behave well under load and during failure. You’ll instrument them so anyone can debug them, and give them secure defaults from day one.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute ideas and take ownership beyond your core remit. That includes product decisions on workflow and interface, such as whether a problem is best solved with a CLI, an API or a web experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ABOUT YOU&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We care more about how you think and work than a perfect CV. You’ll likely bring a combination of the following:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Essential:&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong professional experience building, debugging and operating production software in Go. Deep experience in another systems language also works, if you can show you’d become productive in Go quickly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with Kubernetes and containers, including how workloads are scheduled, how services communicate, and how to investigate when things misbehave.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confidence in Linux environments: systemd, processes, signals, filesystems, permissions, networking, and CPU and memory diagnostics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of systems, products or tools you personally designed and built.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid engineering fundamentals: concurrency, API and interface design, and failure modes. You’ll also have practical experience troubleshooting production systems with logs, metrics and system-level tooling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Nice to Have:&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with the NVIDIA GPU ecosystem, such as drivers, CUDA, nvidia-smi, GPU-enabled container runtimes or Kubernetes GPU scheduling. This isn’t essential: strong systems debugging and a genuine interest in learning this area count just as much.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with distributed and event-driven systems, such as queues, retries, idempotency and backpressure. Practical networking knowledge (DNS, TCP/IP, HTTP, load balancing) also helps.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building Kubernetes controllers or operators, or developer tooling used by other engineers. A security-minded approach to auth, secrets and attack surfaces is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT WE OFFER&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive salary and annual discretionary bonus scheme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee wellbeing benefits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;25 days holiday, plus public holidays&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Private Medical Insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enhanced Pension Scheme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible working arrangements (remote or hybrid, depending on role and location)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Real ownership and autonomy — the trust to take initiative and experiment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Visible, meaningful impact as we scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear career progression in a high-growth company&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A collaborative, international culture built on trust, transparency, and ownership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The chance to help shape NexGen Cloud’s team, culture, and future&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHY APPLY&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We welcome applications from all backgrounds. If you enjoy solving complex infrastructure problems and want to build something meaningful at scale, we’d like to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;MORE INFORMATION&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Visit our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.nexgencloud.com/careers&quot;&gt;careers page&lt;/a&gt; to learn more about us or follow us on &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/nexgen-cloud&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href=&quot;https://x.com/CloudNexgen&quot;&gt;X&lt;/a&gt; to learn more about our journey and keep up with our latest news and releases.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Mission: Why Lighthouse?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;At Lighthouse, we’re on a mission to revolutionize commercial strategy as hospitality’s most powerful AI platform. We take the world&#39;s largest hotel data network and transform it into real-time intelligence that drives action. We don&#39;t just deliver insights; we empower businesses to make decisions that move revenue.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;With $370M in Series C funding and over $100M in ARR, we are scaling at lightspeed. Our 850+ teammates across 35 countries aren&#39;t just building software—they are leveraging cutting-edge AI to help hoteliers be the first to act. Tens of thousands of hotels across 185 countries trust Lighthouse to execute their commercial strategy, including every one of the top 15 global chains and thousands of independent hotels that consistently outperform their markets. With Lighthouse AI, the intelligence gets deeper. Decisions get smarter. Actions get faster. We help hoteliers be first to act.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lighthouse Values: Our guiding light&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;We are&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(253, 130, 55);&quot;&gt;Lumineers&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;. Our shared values keep us on a collaborative path fostering a cultural and customer centric environment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(253, 130, 55);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pursuit of greatness&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;: We’re innovators who care deeply about our customers’ success. Our team brings their best work, stays curious, and delivers excellence through attention to detail&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(253, 130, 55);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Meaningful work matters&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;: We make every moment count by knowing what to deliver, why it matters, and how it drives Lighthouse forward&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(253, 130, 55);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Elevate each other&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;: We don’t just work together - we grow together. What unites us is understanding each other as people and working toward shared goals&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;We’re more than just a workplace – we’re a community. Collaborative, fun, and deeply committed, we work hard together to revolutionize the hospitality sector. Are you ready to join us and shine brighter in the industry’s most exciting rocket-ship? 🚀&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Details&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;💼 Revenue&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;📍 United Kingdom&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;🕜 Full-Time/Remote&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;You’ll be the face of Lighthouse for new customers, owning the full sales cycle from first cold touch to close. This is a hunter role: you carry a quota, you build your own pipeline, and you’re accountable to outcomes and success. No excuses, just results.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Your market is two-sided. You open net-new accounts that fit our ideal customer profile and have never spoken to us, and you turn low-adoption customers who use a single Lighthouse product into full-platform customers. In both cases the goal is the same: the whole commercial platform, not one module. Small, one-off transactions are not what this role is for. You think in terms of the full deal from the first conversation, and you have the patience and the process to run a complex, multi-stakeholder cycle to get there.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;What makes this different: you won’t do it alone. Lighthouse is deploying an agent AI infrastructure — Enablement, Pre-Sales, and Coaching agents — alongside a modern revenue stack. AI handles the prep, the sequencing, and the pattern recognition so you can focus on what matters — building relationships, running sharp discovery, and closing deals.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Where you will have impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own your territory and your number. &lt;/strong&gt;Build and execute a strategic territory plan to generate a net-new pipeline. Maintain 3x pipeline coverage, forecast honestly, and take full accountability for your results. Your quota is your commitment.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hunt into net-new accounts. &lt;/strong&gt;Cold, outbound prospecting into ideal customer profile accounts is the core of this role, not a supplement to inbound. Run an AI-first workflow: use our agents for account research, buying signals, sequencing and first-touch personalization, so your time goes into conversations rather than admin. Add Lighthouse Connect events and industry conferences on top. This is not an SDR-reliant role.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Expand low-adoption customers. &lt;/strong&gt;Identify customers who use a single Lighthouse product, or a fraction of what they bought, and turn them into full-platform accounts. Run this as a sales cycle, with discovery, a business case and a close, not as an adoption program. Work with Customer Success on the handover so the account is set up to keep growing.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Turn small deals into big deals. &lt;/strong&gt;Treat every opportunity as a platform deal. Qualify for the full scope early, bring in every stakeholder who has a say, and build the business case for the whole solution rather than settling for a trial or a single module. Protect pricing on value.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Run a disciplined sales process. &lt;/strong&gt;Using MEDDPICC to qualify and advance opportunities. Use the AI Pre-Sales Agent to identify gaps before every major call. Advance deals through stage gates with evidence, not optimism. Leverage AI to make your days easier and focus on more selling time.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Use AI as a force multiplier. &lt;/strong&gt;Leverage the Enablement Agent for call prep, discovery frameworks, and positioning. Use the Coaching Agent to surface patterns in your pipeline and win rate. Push back on the tools when they’re wrong — help make the system smarter.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Become a hospitality expert. &lt;/strong&gt;Understand the commercial challenges hotels face across pricing, distribution, and business intelligence. Position Lighthouse’s full platform as the integrated solution that replaces fragmented point tools. Know the competitive landscape inside out and run value based ROI conversations confidently.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build relationships at a distance. &lt;/strong&gt;Most of your buyers will never meet you in person. Earn trust over video, phone and email through sharp preparation, clear follow-through and a point of view on their business. Partner with Product to share market feedback and influence the roadmap, and represent Lighthouse at industry events to build the brand and your network.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About our team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;You’ll join a global Revenue team of 150+ sales professionals across 24 countries. The Acquisition team is where new revenue starts: we open the accounts the rest of the company grows. We work across the full Lighthouse product suite, helping hotels, chains, and hospitality groups achieve their commercial goals. It’s a collaborative, high-energy environment that celebrates wins loudly, with real opportunities for career growth and the chance to learn from experienced leaders.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What&#39;s in it for you?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Flexible working environment: Work from home or at one of our global offices.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Comprehensive health insurance: Private AXA coverage for you and your family.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Flexible time off: Autonomy to manage your work-life balance.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Competitive compensation: Proactively maintained to value your work.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Collaborative team: High-bar, friendly, creative, and passionate colleagues.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Career development: Workshops and frameworks to realize your full potential.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Impactful work: Shape products relied on by 85,000+ users worldwide.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Wellbeing support: Subsidized up to 80% ClassPass subscription.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Referral bonuses: Earn rewards for bringing in new talent.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Additional maternity leave compensation: For the first 12 weeks of Statutory Maternity Pay (SMP), we top-up your SMP so that your salary reaches 100%&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;2–5 years in a closing sales role, SaaS experience is a must but hunger and skill matters more than industry tenure.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;A hunter by instinct. You prospect cold, you get past no, and you would rather build your own pipeline than wait for it.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Working proficiency or fluency in Czech or Hungarian.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;You think big-deal first. You have turned a small opening into a larger, multi-product sale, and you know how to qualify for full scope without stalling the deal.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Self-directed, coachable, and driven to continuously improve. You seek feedback on your calls, your pipeline, and your positioning — and act on it within the next deal, not the next quarter.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;You treat AI tools as a core part of your selling motion, not a novelty. You adopt new tooling quickly and bend it to your style, and you expect AI to do your research and sequencing so your time goes into selling.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Fantastic communicator. You build trust with people you have never met in person, over video and phone, from GMs to the C-suite, and you keep several stakeholders aligned through a longer cycle.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Experience with MEDDPICC or similar qualification frameworks is a plus, not a requirement. What matters is that you bring discipline and structure to how you run deals.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s3&quot;&gt;E&lt;/span&gt;xceptional command of the English language.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Strong business acumen with the ability to sell on value, not price. Confident engaging stakeholders from GMs to C-suite.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;You want to win, and you like it when people notice. You celebrate your wins and your team’s, you prospect when it would be easier not to, you follow up one more time, and you’re not okay with a bad quarter.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity, equity, inclusion, and belonging&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Thank you for considering a career with Lighthouse. We are committed to fostering a diverse and inclusive workplace that values equal opportunity for all. We welcome candidates from all backgrounds, regardless of age, gender, race, religion, sexual orientation, and disability. Our commitment to equality is part of our culture. If you require reasonable accommodation at any point during the application or interview process, please notify your recruiter.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Not ticking every box? No problem! We value diverse backgrounds and unique skill sets, and we encourage individuals from all walks of life to apply. If your experience looks a little different from what we&#39;ve described, but you&#39;re passionate about what we do and are a quick learner, we&#39;d love to hear from you!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(253, 130, 55); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;a style=&quot;color: rgb(253, 130, 55);&quot; href=&quot;https://www.mylighthouse.com/company/careers&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Learn more about our careers and recruitment process&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;| &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a style=&quot;color: rgb(253, 130, 55);&quot; href=&quot;https://www.mylighthouse.com/company/about&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Our company and leadership team&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; | &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a style=&quot;color: rgb(253, 130, 55);&quot; href=&quot;https://www.mylighthouse.com/company/beware-of-recruitment-scams&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Beware of recruitment scams&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Anduril Industries is a defense technology company with a mission to transform U.S. and allied military capabilities with advanced technology. By bringing the expertise, technology, and business model of the 21st century’s most innovative companies to the defense industry, Anduril is changing how military systems are designed, built and sold. Anduril’s family of systems is powered by Lattice OS, an AI-powered operating system that turns thousands of data streams into a realtime, 3D command and control center. As the world enters an era of strategic competition, Anduril is committed to bringing cutting-edge autonomy, AI, computer vision, sensor fusion, and networking technology to the military in months, not years.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;At Anduril Australia we are developing unmanned systems for subsurface and other domains that will leverage unsupervised autonomy for the delivery of long endurance, multi-mission capability to our customers. These projects, including but not limited to the Extra Large Autonomous Undersea Vehicle (XL-AUV) Program, require Senior Systems Engineers with broad experience to drive the delivery a variety of software enabled hardware capabilities to our customers. Anduril Senior Systems Engineers rapidly develop expertise in new domains in order to architect, design, deliver, support, and evolve next generation capabilities through the entire product life-cycle.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;WHAT YOU&#39;LL DO&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own technology solutions that are deployed to customers, focussed on the delivery of value to the end-user&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a subject matter expert for your areas of expertise as they relate to the delivery of Anduril’s technology capabilities, including areas such as hardware selection and integration, testing and evaluation, robotic perception, engineering process or cybersecurity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Empathize with end-users and drive solutions that balance their needs with external constraints, restrictions and requirements in a multi-stakeholder environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, architect, and implement integrated systems, including advanced and sensitive platforms and payloads, that rapidly delivers capability beyond the scope of current systems, with a clear path for both architecture and capability evolution over time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to the design and development of technology components across Anduril, with the aim of developing components that are re-usable across multiple Anduril product lines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to the design, implementation and execution of development processes for the initial delivery and subsequent iteration of complex robotic systems, including full lifecycle testing, monitoring and operation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support vehicle and payload manufacturing, testing and deployment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Travel to co-locate with end-users up to 20% of the time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work as a member of a multi-disciplinary engineering team, including as a mentor for Engineers from differing backgrounds&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;REQUIRED QUALIFICATIONS&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in Robotics, Mechatronics, Computer Science, Engineering, a relevant field, or equivalent experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive professional experience working as an Engineer with one or more domains and/or technologies of expertise&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to exercise extremely high ownership over a complex system, including design, integration, test, and delivery of new capabilities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Capacity to work holistically on complex robotic systems across design, implementation, operation and sustainment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Capacity to act as the technical owner for a complex subsystem, including stakeholder engagement, requirements definition, roadmap management, team co-ordination, design, implementation, sustainment and evolution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Capacity learn and grow individually, while mentoring junior team members effectively, building team cohesion and capacity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to obtain and maintain an Australian Government Security Clearance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;PREFERRED QUALIFICATIONS&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with the design, implementation and support of robotic and/or autonomous systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working within the defence, maritime and/or aerospace domains&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience within the product delivery lifecycle including manufacturing, system acceptance, deployment, and sustainment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Desire to learn and grow in to other roles that require experience as a Senior Systems Engineer, such as Principal Systems Engineer and/or Engineering Manager&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Desire to grow in to a Tech-Lead-Manager role, with responsibility for line management of engineers, in addition to delivery&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Anduril is an equal-opportunity employer, and we encourage candidates from all backgrounds to apply. If you are someone passionate to work on problems that matter, we’d love to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;The salary range for this role is an estimate based on a wide range of compensation factors, inclusive of base salary only. Actual salary offer may vary based on (but not limited to) work experience, education and/or training, critical skills, and/or business considerations. Highly competitive equity grants are included in the majority of full time offers; and are considered part of Anduril&#39;s total compensation package. Additionally, Anduril offers top-tier benefits for full-time employees, including:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;detailElios&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;At Anduril, we invest in our people. Our comprehensive, competitive benefits package (available at little to no cost to employees) ensures you’re supported in health, recovery, and whatever comes next.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;For more information, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.anduril.com/careers&quot;&gt;Explore Our Benefits&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;RichText column1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;detailElios&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Protecting Yourself from Recruitment Scams&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;detailElios&quot;&gt;Anduril is committed to maintaining the integrity of our Talent acquisition process and the security of our candidates. We&#39;ve observed a rise in sophisticated phishing and fraudulent schemes where individuals impersonate Anduril representatives, luring job seekers with false interviews or job offers. These scammers often attempt to extract payment or sensitive personal information.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;RichText column2&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;detailElios&quot;&gt;To ensure your safety and help you navigate your job search with confidence, please keep the following critical points in mind:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;detailElios&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;No Financial Requests:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Anduril will never solicit payment or demand personal financial details (such as banking information, credit card numbers, or social security numbers) at any stage of our hiring process. Our legitimate recruitment is entirely free for candidates.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Please always verify communications:&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Direct from Anduril: If you receive an email from one of our recruiters, it will &lt;em&gt;only&lt;/em&gt; come from an ----- address.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Via Agency Partner: If contacted by a recruiting agency for an Anduril role, their email will clearly identify their agency. If you suspect any suspicious activity, please verify the agency&#39;s authenticity by reaching out to &lt;a ----------
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;detailElios&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Exercise Caution with Unsolicited Outreach:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;If you receive any communication that appears suspicious, contains grammatical errors, or makes unusual requests, do not engage. Always confirm the sender&#39;s email domain is ----- before providing any personal information or clicking on links.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;detailElios&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What to Do If You Suspect Fraud:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Should you encounter any questionable or fraudulent outreach claiming to be from Anduril, please report it immediately to&amp;nbsp;&lt;a ---------- Your proactive caution is invaluable in protecting your personal information and upholding the security and trustworthiness of our recruitment efforts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Privacy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;To view Anduril&#39;s candidate data privacy policy, please visit &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Hyperlink&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://anduril.com/applicant-privacy-notice/&quot;&gt;https://anduril.com/applicant-privacy-notice/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;By submitting your application, you consent to Anduril Industries using a third-party service provider to conduct pre-employment risk, integrity, and due diligence screening and assessing potential risks as part of your application process. This third-party service provider provides risk-intelligence services that may include analysis of sanctions and watchlists, adverse media, public-record information, and other lawful open-source or commercial data sources. This third-party service provider does not act as a consumer reporting agency. Use of this provider helps to ensure compliance with applicable laws and protect technology, intellectual property, and organizational security.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Anduril Industries is a defense technology company with a mission to transform U.S. and allied military capabilities with advanced technology. By bringing the expertise, technology, and business model of the 21st century’s most innovative companies to the defense industry, Anduril is changing how military systems are designed, built and sold. Anduril’s family of systems is powered by Lattice OS, an AI-powered operating system that turns thousands of data streams into a realtime, 3D command and control center. As the world enters an era of strategic competition, Anduril is committed to bringing cutting-edge autonomy, AI, computer vision, sensor fusion, and networking technology to the military in months, not years.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Anduril’s Quality organization is seeking a Quality Systems Engineer to join our London team and help develop future opportunities for our internal quality management system and digitization efforts. The Quality team works with our customers, internal teams, and suppliers to ensure the deployment of reliable products that meet all mission requirements. We develop cutting-edge Quality processes and methods to secure scalable, long-term business success.&lt;br&gt;We are growing and this role will focus on internal site growth and implementing a world-class quality management system, supporting our internal manufacturing sites, supplier sites, and allied facilities. This role carries responsibility for ensuring compliance with UK and European regulatory frameworks, NATO Standardization Agreements (STANAGs) for aerospace, and UK Ministry of Defense (MOD) requirements as part of our London operations.&lt;br&gt;The right person for this role has extensive knowledge in Quality Management System (QMS) systems, data analysis, and continuous improvement to help shape our internal systems, tools, procedures and the culture of quality at Anduril. If you are someone who loves to build world-class Quality processes, work hands-on, help others succeed on the quality journey, and be accountable for results, then this role is for you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Job&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Anduril Industries is a defense technology company with a mission to transform U.S. and allied military capabilities with advanced technology. By bringing the expertise, technology, and business model of the 21st century’s most innovative companies to the defense industry, Anduril is changing how military systems are designed, built and sold. Anduril’s family of systems is powered by Lattice OS, an AI-powered operating system that turns thousands of data streams into a real time, 3D command and control center. As the world enters an era of strategic competition, Anduril is committed to bringing cutting-edge autonomy, AI, computer vision, sensor fusion, and networking technology to the military in months, not years.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop, lead, and manage the execution of the QMS and its top-level processes. Coordinate resources and prioritization of tasks to complete internal and external audits of the QMS.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop, lead, and manage the execution of the QMS software implementation and adoption across Anduril sites, including the London facility. Coordinate resources and prioritization of tasks to complete implementation, internal and external audits of the QMS.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure full compliance with UK regulatory requirements, including UK MOD Defense Standards (DEF STANs), UKCA marking where applicable, and relevant UK Health &amp;amp; Safety Executive (HSE) regulations for defense manufacturing environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive compliance with NATO Standardization Agreements (STANAGs) for aerospace quality, including STANAG 4107 (Mutual Acceptance of Government Quality Assurance and Usage of the Allied Quality Assurance Publications), STANAG 4159 (NATO Quality Assurance Requirements for Design, Development and Production — AQAP-2110), and STANAG 4161 (NATO Quality Management System Requirements for Aviation, Space and Defense — AQAP-2310).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure conformance to STANAG 4404 and associated AQAPs for software-intensive aerospace systems, including AQAP-2210 (NATO Supplementary Software Quality Assurance Requirements) as applicable to Lattice OS and embedded mission systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support implementation of STANAG 4685 (Airworthiness) requirements as they relate to quality assurance processes for unmanned aerial systems and aerospace components.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Liaise with the UK MOD Quality Assurance representatives, the Defence Quality Assurance (DQA) organisation, and NATO Quality Assurance authorities to support Government Quality Assurance (GQA) activities and audits.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with business systems team, product quality engineers and manufacturing engineers to help prepare new processes, digital tools, and sites to meet QMS requirements, develop new capabilities to meet existing QMS requirements and conduct internal audits before manufacturing readiness review and production readiness review.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop our internal QMS road map for tools and capabilities to match the scaling of the company: to meet customer needs, to enable quality capabilities for new products, and scale quality processes as we grow — with particular attention to UK Export Control and ITAR/EAR interface requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure compliance with UK data protection requirements (UK GDPR / Data Protection Act 2018) as they relate to quality records, supplier data, and audit documentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Become a systems expert for Anduril’s quality tools, processes, and data sets to enable effective QMS execution across both US and UK operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate with external audit agencies, including UKAS-accredited certification bodies and NATO quality assurance authorities. Support customer audits as necessary.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage the QMS internal audit program and lead internal audits.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and implement continuous improvement opportunities that benefit the QMS and product quality, aligned with AS9100, NATO AQAP, and STANAG frameworks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support investigations, initiatives, and projects as needed, at the team or organisation level.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support developing QMS training modules and packages, including UK/NATO-specific regulatory and STANAG training. Facilitate training records and retention with manager of affected trainees.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive root cause analysis and corrective action with internal findings from audits and customer visits, including UK MOD and NATO audit findings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree and 3–5 years of experience in aerospace and/or defence manufacturing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expert knowledge of QMS requirements and auditing in a complex product environment, in one or more of the following QMS standards: ISO 9001:2015, AS9100D, AS9110C, AS9120B, AS6500, IATF 16949:2016, ISO 13485:2016, TL 9000 R6.3.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrable knowledge of NATO Standardization Agreements (STANAGs) for aerospace quality, including STANAG 4107, STANAG 4159, STANAG 4161, and their associated Allied Quality Assurance Publications (AQAPs): AQAP-2110, AQAP-2210, and AQAP-2310.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with UK MOD Defence Standards (DEF STANs) and Government Quality Assurance (GQA) processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of UK regulatory frameworks relevant to defence manufacturing, including UK Export Control Act 2002, HSE regulations, and UKCA/CE marking requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge with QMS software solutions which might include Net Inspect, Siemens, SAP, ETQ, One Factory, MasterControl, Compliance Quest, Hexagon, PTC, QT9.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with data analytics platforms, reporting tools, and basic data visualisation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated project management for software system implementation and onboarding suppliers (external users) and internal users.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of design, development, manufacturing, supply chain, deployment, contracts, and other organisations that are part of a company-wide audit.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of Enterprise Resource Planning (ERP), Product Lifecycle Management (PLM), and Business Intelligence (BI) systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong ownership mindset with demonstrated capability to drive projects from start to completion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of implementation and success with QMS.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Right to work in the United Kingdom.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expected travel up to 20% of the time, including travel to US facilities and NATO partner sites.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;The salary range for this role is an estimate based on a wide range of compensation factors, inclusive of base salary only. Actual salary offer may vary based on (but not limited to) work experience, education and/or training, critical skills, and/or business considerations. Highly competitive equity grants are included in the majority of full time offers; and are considered part of Anduril&#39;s total compensation package. Additionally, Anduril offers top-tier benefits for full-time employees, including:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;detailElios&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;At Anduril, we invest in our people. Our comprehensive, competitive benefits package (available at little to no cost to employees) ensures you’re supported in health, recovery, and whatever comes next.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;For more information, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.anduril.com/careers&quot;&gt;Explore Our Benefits&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;RichText column1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;detailElios&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Protecting Yourself from Recruitment Scams&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
