&lt;h3&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Privacy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;To view Anduril&#39;s candidate data privacy policy, please visit &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Hyperlink&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://anduril.com/applicant-privacy-notice/&quot;&gt;https://anduril.com/applicant-privacy-notice/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;By submitting your application, you consent to Anduril Industries using a third-party service provider to conduct pre-employment risk, integrity, and due diligence screening and assessing potential risks as part of your application process. This third-party service provider provides risk-intelligence services that may include analysis of sanctions and watchlists, adverse media, public-record information, and other lawful open-source or commercial data sources. This third-party service provider does not act as a consumer reporting agency. Use of this provider helps to ensure compliance with applicable laws and protect technology, intellectual property, and organizational security.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Waymo is an autonomous driving technology company with the mission to be the world&#39;s most trusted driver. Since its start as the Google Self-Driving Car Project in 2009, Waymo has focused on building the Waymo Driver—The World&#39;s Most Experienced Driver™—to improve access to mobility while saving thousands of lives now lost to traffic crashes. The Waymo Driver powers Waymo’s fully autonomous ride-hail service and can also be applied to a range of vehicle platforms and product use cases. The Waymo Driver has provided over ten million rider-only trips, enabled by its experience autonomously driving over 100 million miles on public roads and tens of billions in simulation across 15+ U.S. states.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Software Engineering builds the brains of Waymo&#39;s fully autonomous driving technology. Our software allows the Waymo Driver to perceive the world around it, make the right decision for every situation, and deliver people safely to their destinations. We think deeply and solve complex technical challenges in areas like robotics, perception, decision-making and deep learning, while collaborating with hardware and systems engineers. If you’re a software engineer or researcher who’s curious and passionate about Level 4 autonomous driving, we&#39;d like to meet you.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Waymo interns partner with leaders in the industry on projects that create impact to the company. We believe learning is a two-way street: applying your knowledge while providing you with opportunities to expand your skill-set. Interns are an important part of our culture and our recruiting pipeline. Join us at Waymo for a fun and rewarding internship!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to existing projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implement research ideas into existing projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run training and evaluation experiments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Currently enrolled in a Master&#39;s or PhD program in Computer Science, Robotics or a related technical field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Python coding&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep Learning experience with frameworks like TensorFlow, Jax or PyTorch&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We prefer:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Attention mechanism and autoregressive architectures&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Diffusion applied to multimodal data&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with autonomous driving and / or robotics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Note: This will be a hybrid onsite internship position. We will accept resumes on a rolling basis until the role is filled. To be in consideration for multiple roles, you will need to apply to each one individually - please apply to the top 3 roles you are interested in.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;The expected annual pay for this full-time position is listed below. Interns are also eligible to participate in the Company’s generous benefits programs, subject to eligibility requirements.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Masters Pay&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;£65,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;£65,000 GBP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;The expected annual pay for this full-time position is listed below. Interns are also eligible to participate in the Company’s generous benefits programs, subject to eligibility requirements.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;PhD Pay&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;£80,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;£80,000 GBP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At Ripple, we’re building a world where value moves like information does today. It’s big, it’s bold, and we’re already doing it. Through our crypto solutions for financial institutions, businesses, governments and developers, we are improving the global financial system and creating greater economic fairness and opportunity for more people, in more places around the world. And we get to do the best work of our career and grow our skills surrounded by colleagues who have our backs.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;If you’re ready to see your impact and unlock incredible career growth opportunities, join us, and build real world value.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THE WORK:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an Account Executive at Ripple Treasury, you will play a key role in our sales team, driving success in a high-growth region. This position offers an outstanding opportunity to work with a world-class team. You will help develop the future of corporate treasury by integrating modern technology with proven financial solutions.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your responsibility is to exclusively win new corporate clients for Ripple Treasury. This role requires effective positioning of a curated selection of the Ripple Treasury Platform&#39;s core capabilities to each target account, with end-to-end accountability for territory development and full deal lifecycle management.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU’LL DO:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Achieve new business revenue goals set forth by Managing Director of Europe Sales&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Win corporate new accounts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop pipeline consistently across your territory&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Attend trade shows, industry events, and user events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain a deep understanding of your market and its evolving potential&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyse and understand sales growth potential in your assigned territory&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay informed about the treasury industry and competition&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with your manager and sales team to develop competitive strategies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain a minimum of 10 days monthly in-office presence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU&#39;LL BRING:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years in New Business SaaS Sales, preferably in enterprise FinTech/Treasury Management Systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated large account navigation and complex sales cycle management skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong ability to position functionally rich, sophisticated value propositions across multiple business areas&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to execute pipeline generation at scale through outbound, driving and maintaining a 4x pipeline&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Consistent track record of top sales performance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent value based, consultative selling skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven organizational and interpersonal skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to travel 25-50%&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in business or equivalent experience preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHO WE ARE:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Do Your Best Work&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;The opportunity to build in a fast-paced start-up environment with experienced industry leaders&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;A learning environment where you can dive deep into the latest technologies and make an impact.&amp;nbsp; A professional development budget to support other modes of learning.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Thrive in an environment where no matter what race, ethnicity, gender, origin, or culture they identify with, every employee is a respected, valued, and empowered part of the team.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;In-office collaboration for moments that matter is important to our culture, and we give managers and teams the flexibility to decide which 10+ days a month they come in.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Bi-weekly all-company meeting - business updates and ask me anything style discussion with our Leadership Team&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We come together for moments that matter which include team offsites, team bonding activities, happy hours and more!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Take Control of Your Finances&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Competitive salary, bonuses, and equity&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Competitive benefits that cover physical and mental healthcare, retirement, family forming, and family support&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Employee giving match&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Mobile phone stipend&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Take Care of Yourself&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;R&amp;amp;R days so you can rest and recharge&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Generous wellness reimbursement and weekly onsite &amp;amp; virtual programming&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Generous vacation policy - work with your manager to take time off when you need it&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Industry-leading parental leave policies. Family planning benefits.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Catered lunches, fully-stocked kitchens with premium snacks/beverages, and plenty of fun events&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;Benefits listed above are for full-time employees.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;em&gt;Ripple is an Equal Opportunity Employer. We’re committed to building a diverse and inclusive team. We do not discriminate against qualified employees or applicants because of race, color, religion, gender identity, sex, sexual identity, pregnancy, national origin, ancestry, citizenship, age, marital status, physical disability, mental disability, medical condition, military status, or any other characteristic protected by local law or ordinance.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;br&gt;Please find our California, UK/EU, Singapore, DIFC, ADGM, Australia, and Switzerland&amp;nbsp; &lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://ripple.com/legal/applicant-privacy-notice/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Applicant Privacy Notice &lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;for reference.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW4324591 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW4324591 BCX8&quot;&gt;As a leader in Lawful and Location Intelligence, SS8 helps make societies safer. Our commitment is to extract, analyze, and visualize the critical intelligence that gives law enforcement, intelligence agencies, and emergency services the real-time insights that help save lives. Our high performance, flexible, and future-proof solutions also enable mobile network operators to achieve regulatory compliance with minimum disruption, time, and cost. SS8 is trusted by the largest government agencies, communications providers, and systems integrators globally.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a customer-facing Senior Solutions Engineer to support sales of SS8’s portfolio across Law Enforcement (LEA), Intelligence Community (IC), and Communications Service Providers (CSPs) across the APAC region. This role sits at the intersection of deep technical expertise and strategic sales—translating complex mission needs into deployable, scalable solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a highly skilled Senior Solutions Engineer, you will leverage your expertise to deliver pre-sales engineering support as a subject matter expert. This role involves extensive engagement with customers and partners, ensuring the highest technical and professional standards while upholding SS8’s customer-first approach. You will serve as the primary technical representative to customers, articulating SS8’s solution capabilities and playing a key role in influencing customer decisions and successful solution adoption.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll partner closely with sales, product, and delivery teams to drive technical wins, shape customer architectures, and ensure SS8 solutions align with operational and compliance requirements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pre-Sales &amp;amp; Solution Engineering&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead technical discovery sessions to understand customer mission requirements across lawful intercept, location intelligence, and data analytics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent SS8 and its partner ecosystem in designing and delivering end-to-end solutions tailored to customer and prospect requirements spanning telecom networks, data collection, mediation, analytics, and visualization platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the technical sales cycle: architecture, solution positioning, demos, POCs, and RFP/RFI responses with innovative and differentiated approaches.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate vague “we need intel” asks into concrete system designs (and push back when needed).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customer Engagement&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a trusted technical advisor to LEA, IC, and telecom stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Present complex solutions clearly to both engineers and non-technical decision-makers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support customer workshops, technical deep dives, and executive briefings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bridge the gap between operational users and IT/network teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Architecture &amp;amp; Integration&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop high-level and detailed architectures integrating SS8 solutions into existing customer environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure alignment with telecom standards, lawful intercept frameworks, and regulatory requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with delivery teams to ensure smooth transition from design to implementation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sales Support&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with account teams to develop winning strategies for new and existing opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own creation of proposals, quotes, SOWs, and technical documentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support competitive positioning and articulate differentiators.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product &amp;amp; Feedback Loop&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide structured feedback to product management on emerging trends, customer challenges, requirements analysis and field-driven insights based on field experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Influence product direction with real-world use cases and customer pain points.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Required Experience &amp;amp; Qualifications&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Expertise&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+ years in solution and systems engineering, sales engineering, network engineering, or solution architecture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to design and size high-capacity, high-performance, mission-critical systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of telecom network architectures and signaling protocols:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3G, 4G LTE/EPC, and 5G Core&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;IMS, VoLTE, VoIP&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;IP networking (routing, switching, protocols)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with lawful intercept frameworks and systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid understanding of data flows, packet capture, and network-based data collection.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Domain Knowledge&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting or working with:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Law Enforcement Agencies (LEA)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Intelligence Community (IC)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Telecommunications Service Providers (CSPs)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to OSINT, location intelligence, or analytics platforms is a strong plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with virtualization and/or cloud-native environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid knowledge of databases and storage systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of compliance, regulatory, and legal considerations in telecom and surveillance environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sales Engineering Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to run technical sales cycles and close complex deals. Experience responding to RFPs/RFIs and building technical proposals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong presentation and demo skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent verbal and written communication skills, with significant experience engaging directly with customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly professional, detail-oriented, and analytical, with the ability to operate independently and take initiative.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Capable of contributing as a key member of the technical leadership team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Interpersonal Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to simplify complex systems without dumbing them down.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable pushing back on unrealistic customer expectations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication across technical, operational, and executive audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-driven, adaptable, and able to operate in ambiguous environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with big data platforms (Hadoop, Spark, Elasticsearch).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of AI/ML applications in intelligence or telecom analytics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cloud experience (AWS, Azure, or private cloud deployments).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Travel&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;50% typical, 75% peak&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;Join a company where your ideas, expertise, and ambition can make a real difference.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;At SS8, we&#39;re committed to fostering a culture of collaboration, innovation, and continuous growth. Whether you&#39;re developing new solutions, supporting customers, or driving business success, you&#39;ll be part of a team that values your contributions and invests in your future.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW127407533 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW127407533 BCX8&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW195719623 BCX8&quot;&gt;SS8 does not discriminate&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun AdvancedProofingIssueV2Themed SCXW195719623 BCX8&quot;&gt;on the basis of&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW195719623 BCX8&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;age, disability, gender reassignment, marriage or civil partnership, pregnancy or maternity, race, religion or belief, sex, or sexual orientation, and provides reasonable adjustments throughout the recruitment process.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW17735712 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW17735712 BCX8&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW64983816 BCX8&quot;&gt;SS8 does not accept unsolicited resumes from staffing agencies, search firms, or third parties. Any resumes &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW64983816 BCX8&quot;&gt;submitted&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW64983816 BCX8&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;without a signed agreement in place will be considered the property of Company, and no fees will be paid if a candidate is hired as a result.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Cybercrime is growing, and more businesses are getting hit by threats that used to target only the biggest organizations. That pushes defenders like us to operate at the highest level, and it deepens our need for good people who want to make a meaningful impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Founded in 2015 by former NSA cyber operators, Huntress is a remote-first team working to make enterprise-grade cybersecurity accessible to businesses of all sizes. We work closely with security teams and service providers protecting complex environments, often without the time or headcount to handle it all. That’s why we build our technology in-house and back it with a 24/7 human-led Security Operations Center (SOC). As a result, our platform is never disconnected from the experts who manage it, ensuring our customers&#39; protection.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Huntress now secures more than 6M endpoints and 17M identities worldwide. Those numbers keep growing because more businesses rely on us to help carry the load and operate with more confidence. Every day, you can see that commitment in how we stand with our customers and how we show up for each other.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reports to: Senior Manager, Channel Marketing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location: Remote UK&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation Range: £90,000 to £100,000 base plus bonus and equity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Huntress is looking for a Senior Channel Marketing Manager to plan and execute channel marketing across EMEA, working with both distributors and resellers. You will make sure our distribution partners, and the resellers they serve, have the programs, content, and funding to generate demand for Huntress across several markets, and you will build campaigns that bring new resellers into the region&#39;s partner ecosystem.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is execution-focused. The ideal candidate is organized, comfortable running many campaigns and partner relationships at once, and skilled at adapting global programs to regional needs. You are data-driven, collaborative, and passionate about helping partners succeed.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plan and execute regional marketing programs with EMEA distributors and resellers, including demand generation campaigns, webinars, events, and product launch activity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create and run campaigns to recruit new resellers in the region via distributor-led recruitment and events.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage day-to-day marketing relationships with distributor partners and resellers, including joint plans, campaign calendars, and regular performance reviews.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enable distributors to run marketing to their reseller base, and support priority resellers directly where the impact is greatest.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Localize and adapt global campaigns, messaging, and assets for regional markets, including language, regulatory, and market-specific needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plan the activities and campaigns that put MDF and co-marketing funds to work across distributors and resellers, partnering with the Program Manager who administers MDF, and report on the results and ROI of funded activity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Product Marketing to deliver product updates and channel-specific campaigns that drive partner activation, product adoption, and lead generation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create and maintain partner-ready enablement and co-branded materials for distributors and resellers, and support engagement through the Huntress Hub partner portal.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track and report on regional channel marketing KPIs, including partner engagement, pipeline, campaign conversion, and fund utilization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify what distributors and resellers need to market Huntress successfully and bring those insights back to the Channel Programs team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support regional partner events, distributor business reviews, and partner communications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure consistent follow-up on all channel-generated leads, with accurate lead capture, tracking, and prompt routing to the appropriate internal owner for next steps.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Bring To The Team:&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience in channel or partner marketing, ideally in the SaaS or cybersecurity space.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience running co-marketing programs through distributors and resellers in EMEA.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building and running partner or reseller recruitment campaigns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of the EMEA channel landscape, including how distribution models and reseller tiers differ by country and region.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience planning MDF-funded or co-marketing activities and working within channel program mechanics such as deal registration and lead sharing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to plan, manage, and execute many campaigns and partner relationships at once across markets and time zones, and pivot quickly as needs change.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical skills, with the ability to assess opportunities and make ROI-based decisions on programs and investments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and relationship-building skills, with the ability to lead, influence, and collaborate across organizational and geographic boundaries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with CRM, marketing automation, and PRM or partner portal tools (e.g., Salesforce, HubSpot).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to travel across EMEA as needed for Partner events, QBRs, etc.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to Have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in cybersecurity, MSP, or SMB-focused markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in one or more European languages in addition to English.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with GDPR and regional marketing compliance requirements.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Success Looks Like in the First Year&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Joint marketing plans running with your key distributors and priority resellers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Regional campaigns executed on a consistent cadence with measurable pipeline impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stronger distributor-led demand generation to the reseller base.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recruitment campaigns in market that add new, active resellers to the program.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Well-planned, MDF-funded activity across the region with a clear view of ROI.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Offer:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;100% remote work environment - since our founding in 2015&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;New starter home office set up reimbursement (£398)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous personal leave entitlements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Digital monthly reimbursement (£92)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Travel to the US 1-2 times/year for various company events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pension&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to the BetterUp platform for coaching, personal, and professional growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Huntress is committed to creating a culture of inclusivity where every single member of our team is valued, has a voice, and is empowered to come to work every day just as they are.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We do not discriminate based on race, ethnicity, color, ancestry, national origin, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, disability, veteran status, genetic information, marital status, or any other legally protected status. &lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;We do discriminate against hackers who try to exploit businesses of all sizes.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
